<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">Ntomong Batom</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ntom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ntomong Batom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ntomong Batom aYeso</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ntomong Batom aYeso</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Adakunom tom na Kabik aJɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Sak na aTiyofulus, ni kufumung hom kufi imɛsɛng, imi kin da jɛk ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ aYeso kin tung ra ni nyɔng fɛ́ a kin tees ni itumung kutomong wu, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />sak ni kunom fɛ́ ba kin ku sok mo sak azanɛn. Dung ni kunom e yɔng ni ku nye, a mi tsang tak batom e yɔng fi iwu mi kasa, ikyɛng ira ayɛt Kabik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Ama iku wu, a tonong ice wu sak ni ba, a ka ba nyes nkyɔrɔk zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt fi in sak ba di rēn tsɛngtsɛng fok a se ni kutset. A sok nkɔs nsɔk nnaas, na woso cɛɛt ni iba naton irèn fɛ́ Adakunom di ya igwɔm na banet.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Atukak, fɛ́ ba kin tsin yas gung, aYeso ka ba nɔɔk agbat ifɛ̀ ye, na ba tot na aRushelima, ma ba shan kunang fɛ́ Ada wu mang nye kushi me, fok a bi ka ba nɔɔk, fi iwu kin fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;In mi foos yin na nu hom ye, <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />aYohana ras banet abatisma ne ashi, awɛt azeng sak nkɔs gyet, ba da ki ra yin abatisma ne Kabik aJɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba sok aYeso sak azanɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ni izen fɛ́ batom aYeso me nyim narɔ kazining, ba ku rip ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa, yɔkɔnɔng wu fi igwɔm da bun ni bɔk bafi aIsrela yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Irēn izén ni nnom yet nfiin awo, Ada wu a bi ice naton de. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Awɛt i bi sɛ yin kukyem ke Kabik aJɛrɛ tik naton yin, iyin bi sot yin bafi icɛɛt hom ne aRushelima ni mben aJudiya ngma kusum nɛ aSamariya ni ishɛrɛp mben azatse ngma kusum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ama fɛ́ a fɛrɛng anɔng, ba ku sok sak azanɛn na ayisi bá, sak izen fɛ́ anɔk tse a ku fam.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Iba di ban iyɛrɛ wu anɔng, ni iwu woso ngarak sak azanɛn, ni izen izining, bafɛ́ ba di banet bafaa ayɛt ares akan ni inyeseng ni ifam bá. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Banet e fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin banet aGalili, i nyeseng yin akyɛ azeng, ni iwoso tang yin ayisi azanɛn ɛ? Iwu aYeso me yong fɛ́ ba sok ni yin, sak azanɛn, a bi tɛ a bɛ́s wu kpaf kyɔn ti i di yin kutseet wu sak azanɛn anɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba kasa aMatiyas a sok karɔ aJudas aIskariyoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ama anɔng, ba tɛ ba bun sak na aRushelima, ba won Ihwyanang Ifat, kuyikyik akilomita azining<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akpaf itirik e ni icɛn aGirik yet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuyikyik kutseet fɛ́ ba nyes atuk aSabat.</char></note> sak ne aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta, ba tse ba ngarak ni kutu ari aton yɔng fɛ́ ba kin di sosok. Banet fɛ́ ba kin se azɔng kin yet, aBitrus nɛ aYohana nɛ aYakubu nɛ Andarawus, aFilibus nɛ aToma, aBatalomi nɛ AMatiyu, aYakubu arim Alfayus nɛ aSiman ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes anet ifup mben wu nɛ aJudas arim aYakubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Ngma ba ba nyis kaaki izen, na ba ras awon, ngma ne aMarya nggɔ aYeso, pet ne barunyining.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Ni nnom e yɔng, bafi ikuus kin nyim (kudot ba kin se anakat azining ni nsɔk nfaa). ABitrus dorok a fɛrɛng, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />ye, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, i se gbing-gbing ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni kufumung ajɛrɛ ni in shining. Kabik aJɛrɛ kin ra kutomong na kanu agwɔm aDauda a cɛɛt naton aJudas, ayɔng fɛ́ a kin tsa banet sak narɔ fɛ́ ba kin tse ba di tekap aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Iwu kin yet azining ayɛt yit, a moon mbɔk ngma ni iyit ni kutomong kang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Ni itsɔm kutomong anyas wu, aJudas di shan ikɔ, a kpa cirirang, kafa wu sarak, nkyɛ afa wu wuruk amatse. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Kaangan ni aRushelima fok ikyɛng fi ite, ba kpa yes ikɔ me dɔng ni ilem bá, &lt;&lt;Akeldama&gt;&gt; fi isonong naton Ikɔ Nasok.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />ABitrus fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Nek i se ni ijɛk ni kufumung Abom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;Won karɔ wu na ka sot abát;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">won na ba sɛ ayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">fɛ́ a da sot ni ka awo,&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;Won akak na a sok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">kuta isonong wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">kufi ikɔk ashon.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Abom 69:25</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Nek anɔng, i se gbing-gbing ni in kasa yit akak ayɛt banet bang fɛ́ a kin se neme ni iyit, ni izen fɛ́ aTisa aYeso kin kat azeng nate yit, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />nkum izen abatisma aYohana sak izen fɛ́ ba kin di sok aYeso sak azanɛn. I se gbing azining na a sot anet icɛɛt gung ni iyit naton idoro ifaben wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Nek anɔng, ba bɛ́ na ayerek banet bafaa: aYusufu fɛ́ ba ku yes aBarsabas, ba tɛ ba ku yes aJustus nɛ akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aMatiyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ba ma ra awon ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ngɔn rēn kayɛt iyɛ akaangan, ki tonong yit anet fi ngɔn mi kasa ayɛt banet bafaa bang, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />ayɔng fɛ́ a da sok kutomong atom kang fɛ́ aJudas won sak narɔ fɛ́ ka se kpaf ni iwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Ama anɔng, ba di barak icang, icang kasa aMatiyas, nek anɔng, iwu di barang kudot batom aYeso kusɔk abe azining e.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Izen fɛ́ aTuk aPɛntɛkɔs nye, ngma banet ikuus kin se narɔ kazining. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ni izen izining, ba fɛ̀ ba fok iwɔng ne azanɛn, tɛ nawoot itsombos, i bi shining kasa fɛ́ ba di se me ngma kusum. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ba fɛ̀ ba di ikyɛng kak fi i se tɛ alem nrong in ne, ni in tisik naton ace bá. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Ngma ba sɛ kushining na Kabik aJɛrɛ, ba kpa cɛɛt na alem akak kpaf ne agap fɛ́ Kabik e ka ba nɔɔk.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ni izen e yɔng, baYahuda fɛ́ ba foos nnyim Adakunom kin se ne aRushelima fɛ́ ba nes ni mben azatse ngma kusum. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ni izen fɛ́ banet fok awɔng e, kudyɛng banet kana tusung azɔng. Ikyɛng e ka ba te kpɛɛ, nek kaangan ayɛt ba fok bafi ikuus aYeso me ba cɛɛt ayɛt icɛ́n bá. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />A ka ba te kpɔrɔk makiyi, ba kpa nye, &lt;&lt;In nye yit kɛ banet bang fɛ́ ba tsin cɛɛt yet banet aGalili awɛ? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Wat ne anɛ fɛ́ kaakyɛ azining yit foos ba karang icɛn wu anɔng ɛ?<verse eid="ACT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />&lt;&lt;Azeng nate yit, banet fɛ́ ba ne na aPartya di se nɛ bafɛ́ aMidiyas di se nɛ bafɛ́ aElamitas di se nɛ bafi mben aMesopotamiya di se, ni mben aJudiya nɛ aKapadokiya, aPɔntus nɛ Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Nɛ aFirijiya nɛ aPamfiliya, aMasat nɛ bafɛ́ asamang aSirin ni mben aLibiya, pet ne batsen fɛ́ ba ne na aRoma <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(banet bakak kin yet baYahuda nɛ bakak kin yet Ícɛn-iduk fɛ́ ba mi kpa ras nggɔn baYahuda, bakak kin yet bafɛ́ aKiritan nɛ bafɛ́ Arabiya). Wat iyit fok yit ba taas ntomong ayɔɔt Adakunom ayɛt alem yit!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Ikyɛng e ka ba te kpɔrɔk, a tɛ ka ba te zii, ba kpa risim ace bá, &lt;&lt;Akyi deng i yet ideng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Wat bakak ayɛt ba, kpa ra bafi ikuus e ibyɛs, ba nye, &lt;&lt;Ba mi sɔ ashi anap fɛ́ a se jatang, ba feng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABitrus cɛɛt ni kudyɛng banet e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />ABitrus dorok, a nyeseng tsik ni kusɔk abe azining e, a sok kutɔ, a kpa cɛɛt ni kudyɛng banet e, &lt;&lt;Iyin banaan bafɛ́ aJudiya, ni ishɛrɛp batsen fɛ́ ba se kusot ni aRushelima, wes yin ato ni mi. Won in ki tonong yin ikyɛng deng fi ite. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Vit akak fɛ́ a mi feng ayɛt banet bang, tɛ bakak yin di sok na ayɛ bá. Izen yet itsɔm mbɔk agyɛng azining ifɛ́ adiding kyɛk! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ikyɛng de fɛ́ atan aJowel ki mang tak ibes de ye,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />&lt;Adakunom kin fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">&lt;&lt;Ni nkɔs igang e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Imi bi korok Kabik hom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">naton ngma banet kusum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Nnon yin namatek e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">nɛ nanamang e, bi tas ibes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">bacam yin, bi yɛrɛ nabos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">bashɔn yin, bi ras nabos.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ni nnom e yɔng, Imi bi korok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Kabik hom naton basam hom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">bamatek e nɛ banyining e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ngma pet ba bi tas ibes.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Imi bi tonong ajingjing naton aza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">ni ikyɛng abes azatse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Nasok, ni kurong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">nɛ atseng makiyi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ba bi tirik kunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ni ku sot ngmalak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">kufɛn bi sot tɛ nasok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">dang agbat kunom aTisa me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ni ku nye.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />I bi se fok, ngma ayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">fɛ́ a ra awon na aTisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">a ku sɛ mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">a bi sɛ isheshek.&gt;&gt; &gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">AJowel 2:28-32</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Iyin bafi aIsrela, wes yin ato ni kucɛɛt kang. AYeso anet aNazaret, kin yet atutup ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom kin ki tonong yin wɛshɛk fok iwu wu a ku tom nate yin. A tonong anɔng e, ni kuri ntomong ayɔɔt na abes zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt fɛ́ Adakunom nye ni bɔk aYeso. Kpaf ti iyin da rēn yin. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Adakunom rēn ikyɛng fi i bi te, ikyɛng fi iwu mang sak sɛ kushining ni izen fɛ́ ba nabak aYeso. Ni irun ama bafɛ́ anɛn, iyin ku fɛt yin naton kukum. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ngma na anɔng, Adakunom kudorok ni iku, a ku tun ni mgbang iku, nek iku kyem ni i ku tekap ni nyang awo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Agwɔm aDauda kin nye kucɛɛt ka naton wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">&lt;Kaakyi izen imi yɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">aTisa hom ashon hom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Nek a se ni bɔk iyak hom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">vit ikyɛng fi i di ki zuut.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Nek anɔng, iyɛ hom se ni itɛrɛk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ilem hom se na abom kafa kakan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">kurɔm hom da nye kusot ni ite iyɛ,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />nek ngɔn Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">da won kutset hom ni irɛk awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">kɛ ni won aJɛrɛ ngɔn na bush awo.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ngɔn mi di tees irèn isɛ kutset;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ngɔn di ki shining ni itɛrɛk iyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">nek ngɔn se gung ni imi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Abom 16:8-11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, in da ki tak yin ni iyɛ ting fok adakop yit aDauda kin ku, ba ku nɛt, kurɛk wu kang nate yit sak atut. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Iwu kin yet atan, a bɛ̀ kurēn fok Adakunom mang ku tak ayɛt kushi, fok a bi di sak nggon wu kakak ni kuta isonong wu. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ni iyɛrɛ kashon, aDauda nye kucɛɛt naton idoro ifaben Anet-Isheshek, ye ba bi won kukom wu ni irɛk awo, kurɔm wu bi bush awo. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Adakunom mi donong aYeso me ni isɔs ita, naton anɔng, ngma yit ba in yet yit bafi anu icɛɛt. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ba mi ku nɔk iratek ni bɔk iyak Adakunom, a mi shan Kabik aJɛrɛ na Ada, kpaf ni kushi fɛ́ a kin ki nye yit e, a mi ki korok yit Kabik aJɛrɛ me kang fi i tsin yɛrɛ yin ni foos yin. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Nek agwɔm aDauda kin ngarak azanɛn awo, ngma na anɔng, a fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;ATisa fɛ̀ na aTisa hom:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;&lt;Sonong ni bɔk iyak hom<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />ma in te bafi ifa ni ngɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">na atas atak ngɔn ninyɛn.&gt;&gt; &gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Abom 110:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, won banet aIsrela ngma kusum na ba rēn tsɛngtsɛng ane: Adakunom mi sak aYeso yong, ayɔng fi iyin tekak yin, aTisa nɛ Anet-Isheshek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Nkum fɛ́ banet e fok anɔng, ifɛ̀ me ka ba tubuk ayɛ, wat ba fɛ̀ ne aBitrus ni ishɛrɛp batom e, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, akyɛ fi in da nye yit ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Tirik yin, wosong yin anɛn yin, na ba ki ra yin abatisma, ngma yin, ayɛt iyerek aYeso Kristi, nɔng ba da bin ki fuut yin anɛn yin, ama anɔng, i da sɛ yin kunang Kabik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Nek Adakunom kushi me yet kufiin ni nnon yin, ngma na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se yik-yik, nkum bayɔng fɛ́ aTisa Adakunom bi yes.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />ABitrus ban ka ba tabak ni ncɛɛt dot; a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Sheshek yin ace yin ni izoot fi i bi bɛ́ na banet iras anyas azatse kang!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Kudot banet fɛ́ ba di nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ wu, fɛ́ ba ka ba ra abatisma atuk e yɔng, banet kin se agup ataat fɛ́ ba di barang kudot bafi ikuus.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyis bafi ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Ba nɔɔk nhwyɛ ba kusum sak ni ishashang itees ni mbɔk batom aYeso, ni kuyak angma, ni inyis, ni iras awon. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Nnyim yit akaangan, nek ntomong abes, ni nfɛ́ ajingjing fɛ́ Adakunom ras ni bɔk batom aYeso me. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Ngma bafi ikuus e, ya kashon ni kusonong myak, ikyɛng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ yet ifuu bá ngma. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Ba rɛs nkyɔrɔk mbɔk bá, ba kabasa itsɔm e, kpaf ni kunanang fɛ́ kaangan bɛ̀. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ba ya kashon ni inyis atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong kaakyi izen. Ba kabasa nayak na nasa bá, na ba yas gung ni iyɛ izining ni itɛrɛk iyɛ, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />na ba tere Adakunom, banet ngma kusum ka ba tere. Adakunom di barasa kudot bá, ifɛ̀ banet fɛ́ ba sɛs isheshek kaakyi kunom.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">ABitrus te kyang amɛrɛk anet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Atuk akak, aBitrus nɛ aYohana, ba kin tsin tseng sak ni kutu iya Adakunom ntong, ni izen ira awon, kpaf itsɔm bɔk itaat ifɛ́ ahwyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Azɔng atisi me yɔng fɛ́ ba yes ika Katisi Katek, amɛrɛk akak di se, fi nggɔ wu ku tes anɔng, fɛ́ ba tse na ba ku saas azɔng, nek awon itsɔm na bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔs ni itu iya Adakunom ntong e. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ni izen fɛ́ a di aBitrus nɛ aYohana shim ba nɔ, a ra awon itsɔm ni ba. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />ABitrus di sak ayisi ting ni wu, ngma na aYohana. ABitrus da ma fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ki yɛrɛk yit!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Wat anet e di sak kuhwyɛ ni ba, a yes nyan a da sɛ ikikak ni ba.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />ABitrus ma fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi bi itsɔm awo, nkum ikyɛng fi in bɛ̀, in da ka nɔk ide. Ni iyerek aYeso Kristi anet aNazaret, dorok da tseng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />A ku tekap kubɔk iyak, a ku sɛ mo idorok, ni izen izining, atak nɛ agbirik wu wat a te gbagba. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />A furuk lot, a kpa kutseet. A ka ba kuus mo sak atasa kutu iya Adakunom ntong e, a tseng na furu, na woso itere Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Ni izen fɛ́ banet ku di, a tsin tseng na tere Adakunom, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />ba rēn fok iwu wu fɛ́ a sosok, na ras awon, atisi kutu iya Adakunom ntong fɛ́ ba yes ika Katek, ngma ba, ayɔɔt, nɛ akpɔrɔk ka ba yit naton ikyɛng fi ite.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucɛɛt fɛ́ aBitrus nye atasa karɔ iya ntong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Na anet awon e di te nyɛng nɛ aBitrus nɛ aYohana, ayɔɔt yit banet, ba kana ra ni i tsi sak narɔ fɛ́ ba yes Agubuk aSolomon. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Fɛ́ aBitrus di anɔng, a fɛ̀ ne banet e, &lt;&lt;Banet aIsrela, akyɛ ki nɔɔk yin ayɔɔt naton ikyɛng deng fi ite ɛ? Akyɛ sak i di tup yin ayisi ni yit anɔng ɛ? Ti ni kukyem yit, ke ni kusas iyɛ yit ashon Adakunom wu fi ku sak, in di te yit anet yong kyang ɛ? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Adakunom afi aIbrahim, afi aIshaku nɛ afɛ́ aYakub, Adakunom afɛ́ badakop yit, iwu fɛ́ a nɔɔk asam wu aYeso iratek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 3:13">&lt;&lt;Iyin ku nabak yin na ba ku fɛt, aBilatus shim ke a ku bisik na a tseng, ngma na anɔng, iyin ku rayin nanu ashon aBilatus. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Iyin rayin Anet aJɛrɛ na Atsak, i da ma kasa yin fok na ba ki bisik yin anet ifɛs banet. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ifɛt yin ayɔng fɛ́ a yet itis kutset, ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom tɛ a ku shemeng ni kutset. Iyit yet yit bafi icɛɛt naton anɔng e. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Nek inɔɔk atsak ni iyerek aYeso, anet yo, fi i tsin kuyɛrɛ yin, ayɔng fi i ku rēn yin, di sɛ agap. Ayet nek inɔɔk atsak ni iyerek aYeso de, fi i sak anet yong di sɛ kukyang irɔm kusum. Ngma yin i tsin yɛrɛ yin.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />&lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, imi rēn i nye yin anɔng ayɛt idun, pet nɛ bakɔk-ashon yin. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Na anɔng wu fɛ́ Adakunom di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ a kin mang cɛɛt nanu batan wu ye, Anet-Isheshek wu a da sɔ izot. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Nek anɔng, tirik yin, won yin anɛn yin, bun yin narɔ Adakunom, nɔng ba da ki fuut yin anɛn yin, nɔng i da bin sɛ yin ifɔn na nawu aTisa, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />nɔng a da ki tom yin Anet-Isheshek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:6">BaKolosi 1:6</ref></char>.</note> fi iwu ki mang ki myak yin ne, ayet Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />I se gbing-gbing aYeso na a bun azanɛn, ma izen fɛ́ ba bi te nkyɔrɔk ni in bun nfas, kpaf tɛ fɛ́ Adakunom ki mang cɛɛt neme nanu batan ajɛrɛ wu. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Nek aMusa kin fɛ̀, &lt;ATisa Adakunom yin, bi ki tom yin ne atan akak ti imi ayɛt banet yin; i se gbing-gbing ni ifoos yin ifɛ̀ wu. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Ngma anet fɛ́ a rawu dang fok ifɛ̀ wu, ba bi ku tun ayɛt banet wu.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Iyɛrɛk Ntsi 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />&lt;&lt;Ayɛt atsak, ikyɛng fi i sok nkum atan aSamela sak ashon, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ki mang cɛɛt ibes, a mang cɛɛt azaton nnom nang. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ngma ibes fɛ́ batan e kin cɛɛt, ba kin cɛɛt nek iyin, iyin ba i da ya yin itek irosom fɛ́ Adakunom kin nye na badakop yin, fɛ́ a kin fɛ̀ ne aIbrahim, &lt;Ngma icɛ́n azatse bi di sɛ itek ni izit ngɔn.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Imɛsɛng 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:4">26:4</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Fɛ́ Adakunom tun asam wu, a tung ku tom sak ni yin, na ki te yin awɛng, na a ki tirik yin sak iwon anɛn yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">ABitrus nɛ aYohana ashon azumung bashɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBitrus nɛ aYohana se ni icɛɛt na banet, áware nɛ akɔk-ashon bafi itosok karɔ iya Adakunom ntong nɛ BaSadusi, bɛ́ ba ka ba sɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Ikyɛng e ka ba daam makiyi, nek ba sɛ batom aYeso na ba tsin tees, nɛ ba shara banet ifɛ̀ naton idorok ifaben aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ba tekap, aBitrus nɛ aYohana, awɛt nek kahwyɛ tsang nye, ba ka ba te ari inyang ma akatson. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ngma na anɔng, banet dot fɛ́ ba fok ifɛ̀ me di nɔɔk atsak, wat kudot bamatek di barang sak agup atoon.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Akatson, bágwɔm nɛ bashɔn iwɔp, nɛ bágwɔm irēn ntsi, ba te kazumung ni aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Agbat-agbat àware Anas kin se azɔng nɛ aKayafas nɛ aYohana nɛ Alekzanda ni ishɛrɛp bafi izít agbat-agbat àware. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Ba sak na ba ka ba bɛ́ na ba aBitrus nɛ aYohana ashon bá, ba kpa ka ba nyes nrisim: &lt;&lt;Ngan wu a ki nɔɔk yin kukyem ite anet yong kyang ɛ? Ke ni iyerek angan wu i di nye yin anɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Awɛt aBitrus ayɛt ishining ne Kabik aJɛrɛ, fɛ̀ ni ba: &lt;&lt;Bágwɔm nɛ bashɔn iwɔp. <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ki iyin tsin ki nyes yit nrisim atut naton ikyɛng itek deng fi in ra yit amerek anet yong ne, ni ki risim yit kukyem fi in ku te yit mo kyang, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />in shim yit ni i rēn yin ana. Iyin ne banet aIsrela ngma kusum: Ayet ni iyerek aYeso Kristi anet aNazaret, ayɔng fi iyin tekak yin, awɛt Adakunom kudorok ni iku fɛ́ anet yong di sɛ kukyang ashon yin. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Iwu yet</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">&lt;kuta fɛ́ bafi inok kin raba iko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ku mi sot kuta itsok itu kutek.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Abom 118:22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />&lt;&lt;Vit iyerek ikak fɛ́ ba di sɛs isheshek, nek vit iyerek ikak fɛ́ ba mi nɔɔk banet azatse fi i se gbing-gbing in di sɛ yit isheshek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba di agap iyɛ ba aBitrus ne aYohana, ba rēn gyat fok ye da ba mang sɛ ifa ni itees awo. Ba tɛ ba yiring fok ba aBitrus e yet bafi ikuus aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Awɛt ayet anet fɛ́ ba ku te kyang e, se ni nyeseng azɔng ni iba, vit ikyɛng fɛ́ ba da kyem ba fɛ̀. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Nek anɔng, ba sak batom aYeso me na ba ka ba nɔɔk kawat, ama anɔng, ba kpa tɔ wɔɔn ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi in da nye yit na banet bang ɛ? Kaangan ne aRushelima rēn fok ikyɛng abes iratek mi te, in da kyem in ton yit ne awo. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Nek in di te yin nkum ni kurasak ikyɛng deng ayɛt banet yit, in da kɔrɔk yit banet bang kuto ye, ba bi tɛ ba ya kashon ni kucɛɛt naton iyerek deng awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ba ma tɛ ba ka ba yes sak ayɛt e, ba ka ba nye agbat-ifɛ̀ ye, ba bi tɛ ba cɛɛt ke na ba tees ikikak ni iyerek aYeso awo. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Awɛt aBitrus nɛ aYohana fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin tsɛɛt yin ishɔt e ikyɛng yin i da di yin, ke i da se yɛɛt nanu ashon Adakunom, ni in ki fok yin iyin aza Adakunom ɛ? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Nek iyit da kyem ni in won yit dang cɛɛt yit naton ikyɛng fi iyit mi di yit, ni ikyɛng fi in mi fok yit awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ama fɛ́ ba bang ka ba te nnyim, ba ka ba wosong ba tseng. Ba kyem ba rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ ba da nye ni iba awo, nek banet ngma kusum se ni itere Adakunom nek ikyɛng fi ite. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Nek ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku te kyang e, a wat ayɛ nsɔk nnaas ni kutes.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafi ikuus ra awon <optbreak /> na Adakunom a ka nɔɔk agap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ama fɛ́ ba ka ba wosong, aBitrus nɛ aYohana, ba bun, ba tse ba sɛ banet bá, ba ka ba tak ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ agbat àware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp fɛ̀ ni iba. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, ba sok ntɔ ba ngma ayɛt awon sak na Adakunom, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ngɔn fi i bi ízɔk naton akaangan, ngɔn fi i nye kazanɛn nɛ kazatse, ni izek, ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛt ashi ngma kusum. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ngɔn kin cɛɛt ayɛt Abik aJɛrɛ nanu asam ngɔn adakop yit agwɔm aDauda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;Akyɛ sak fi Ícɛn-iduk, fes anɔng ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">nɛ banet e yiring ni dun anɔng ɛ?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Bágwɔm azatse mi kana nye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">nek itsom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">Bakɔk-ashon mi moon ace bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">nek ifa na aTisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na ayɔng fɛ ba mi ku korok name.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fi itonong ane: </char><char style="fqa">aKristi ke Anet-Isheshek.</char> Ban di yin: <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Abom 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref></char>.</note>&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />&lt;&lt;Na tsak e agwɔm aHiridus nɛ aPontiyus aBilatus, ba kin nyim gung ni Ícɛn-iduk na bafi aIsrela, ba moon ice bá ni wɔp kang, nɔng ba bin te gup asam ajɛrɛ ngɔn aYeso, ayɔng fi ngɔn mi di korok name. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ba nye ikyɛng fi ngɔn ayɛt kukyem ngɔn, ni ishim ngɔn, imang fɛ̀ ey, i bi sot anɔng. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Ada aTisa, di yɔkɔnɔng kuri nnyim fɛ́ ba ki tes yit ne! Nɔk basam ngɔn, iyɛ ting fi in di ki shara yit ifɛ̀ ngɔn, vit nnyim. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Nabak kubɔk ngɔn nek ites banet kyang, nyes ntomong abes ni nkyɔrɔk ajingjing ni iyerek asam ajɛrɛ ngɔn aYeso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ama fɛ́ ba ra awon anɔng, karɔ fɛ́ ba di se me, ka zuut. Kabik aJɛrɛ wat ka ka ba shining ngma ba, ba kpa shara ifɛ̀ Adakunom kaakyɛ ni iyɛ ting.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banet ikuus kabasa ikyɛng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Ngma bafi ikuus e, kuyiring bá, ni nse bá, yet nzining. Vit azining bá, fɛ́ a sok ikyɛng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ ti ifuu, ba kas ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Batom aYeso me ya kashon ni ishara ifɛ̀ naton idorok ifaben aYeso ne kukyem makiyi. Itek Adakunom se naton ba makiyi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Vit azining ba fɛ̀ a bit ikikak. Nek izén-izén bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ akɔ nɛ nasa, ba rɛs ina, ne ba bɛ́s ni itsɔm e <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ashon batom aYeso. Ba kabasa banet ne, kpaf ni ndaam fɛ́ ba bɛ̀.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ni izen e yɔng akak kin di se ayet bafi ikuus e, fi iyerek wu yet aYusufu. A kin yet anet izit aLawi fɛ́ a ne ni izek aSayipurus. Batom aYeso me kin ku yes aBarnabas nek a kin yet ayɔng fɛ́ a di barasa banet agap. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />A kin rɛp ikɔ wu, a sok itsɔm e, a tse ne ashon batom aYeso.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiyas nɛ aSapiratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Awɛt anet akak kin se fɛ́ ba ku yes Ananiyas, iwu nɛ abining wu aSapiratu, ba rɛp ikyɛng ibɔk bá ikak. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ni kushim abining wu, a kaba itsɔm ikɔ me, a kyɛk ikak nek ice wu, a da ma tse ni ishɛrɛp e sak ashon batom aYeso.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn Ananiyas, Akyɛ sak fi ngɔn won aShetan da nɔ ni iyɛ yɛ? A da te ira mbɔɔs sak na Kabik aJɛrɛ, ama fi ngɔn mi nɛt ishɛrɛp itsɔm fi i di rɛp ikɔ me. <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Dang ngɔn ni rɛp ikɔ me, i yet ifɔɔn awɛ? Ama fi irɛp ide, itsɔm ikɔ me yet ifɔɔn awɛ? Akyɛ da sak i nye aduk kuyiring anɔng ɛ? Di, ayet anet fi ngɔn ku ra mbɔɔs awo, ayet Adakunom wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Nkum fɛ́ Ananiyas fok anɔng, a wat a kpa aben, a kɔrɔk nsong igang e. Nnyim yit kaangan makiyi fɛ́ a fok ikyɛng fi ite. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Ama anɔng, bacam bɛ́, ba kunung kukom e, ba sok iko, ba tse ba nɛt.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ama igip itaat, abining wu bɛ́ a nɔ, vit irēn ikyɛng fi i mi te. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />ABitrus ku rip ye, &lt;&lt;Di tak, ngak itsɔm e de fi i di rɛp yin ikɔ me yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Abining e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ey, i se anɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Wat aBitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi ngɔn nɛ atekari ngɔn, imoon yin kanu, nɔng i da mara yin Kabik aTisa yɛ? Fok! Atak banet fɛ́ ba ne kunɛt atekari ngɔn yɔng atitu, ba da bɛ́ ba da sok sak amatse bà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ni izen izining, a kpa natak wu, a kɔrɔk nsong igang e. Ama anɔng, bacam e bɛ́ ba ku sɛ kukom e, ba ku tun amatse, ba tse ba ku nɛt ni fam amatek wu. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Nnyim yit bafi ikuus e ngma kusum makiyi, ni ishɛrɛp banet fɛ́ ba fok ikyɛng fi ite me.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Batom aYeso nyes ntomong abes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Batom aYeso me ras ntomong abes, ni ikyɛng ajingjing dot nate banet. Ngma bafi ikuus e nyis narɔ fɛ́ ba yes Agubuk aSolomon, atasa Karɔ Iya Ntong. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Vit akak ayɛt baYahuda fɛ́ da ba yet bafi ikuus awo fɛ́ a shim a tse bakat ni iba, ngma na anɔng, banet ngma kusum ka ba nesek iratek. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Ngma na anɔng, banet hwyɛt, bamatek nɛ banyining nesek atsak na aTisa, ba di barasa kudot bá. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Anɔng e sak banet kok bafi nrɔk sak ni irèn, ba ka ba saas naton na meneng nɛ ashit ye fok nyen nawu aBitrus di ki kpa naton bakak ayɛt bafi nrɔk e, ni izen igot wu. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Banet dot woso kana tusung, ba nes ne naban wɔp fɛ́ na se bakat ni aRushelima, ba woso del na bafi nrɔk nɛ bayɔng fi kurɔk itseng ka ba nesek mgbang, ngma ba, ba ka ba tes kyang.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba nesek batom aYeso izot nek inɔɔk atsak bá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Agbat-agbat àware nɛ bafidang itomong wu, iba ba ba yet bafɛ́ azumung BaSadusi, ba foos ifup batom aYeso makiyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Nek anɔng, ba tekap batom aYeso me, ba tse ba ka ba te kpaf ari inyang. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Awɛt atomaza aTisa ne natuk, a tarak katisi ari inyang e, a ka ba tun amatse. Ama fɛ̀ ni iba, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />&lt;&lt;Tse nyeseng yin atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong, tsi shara yin ngma ifɛ̀ deng fi i nesek banet kutset kufas!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ama fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, ba tseng ba nɔ atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong e na abop adiding, ba tse ba tees banet, kpaf tɛ ba di fɛ̀ ni ba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ni izen fɛ́ agbat-agbat àware me nɛ bafidang itomong wu bɛ́ ba ta, ba nye iyes azumung bá, ne bashɔn aIsrela ngma kusum, ba da ma tom, ne ba ka ba bɛ́ ne batom aYeso me. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Awɛt, fɛ́ ba tse ba ta ari inyang e, banet itosok karɔ iya Adakunom ntong e, ba tse ba se vit batom aYeso me azɔng. Nek anɔng, ba tɛ ba bun, ba tse ba tak ye, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;In tsi, in sɛ yit kari inyang e ni ifam akabes, nɛ bafi itosok karɔ me ni inyeseng atisi me; awɛt fi in tarak yit natisi me, in tsin se yit vit anet ayɛt e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Nkum fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, ikyɛng e te akɔk-ashon bafi itosok karɔ iya Adakunom ntong nɛ agbat-áware yɔɔt, ba kpa ras ikyɛng fi i da kuus kama.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Ba se ne anɔng, anet akak bɛ́ a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Di yin! Banet yɔng fi i fam yin ari inyang, bayɔng ni nyeseng atasa narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, ba tsin tees banet.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ni ifok anɔng, akɔk-ashon bafi itosok karɔ iya ntong, sok banet wu, ba tse ba bɛ́ ne batom aYeso me. Ba ka ba kɔk ne agap awo nek bakɔk-ashon e fok anyim kɔng banet bi ka ba bara na ata.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba bɛ́ ne batom aYeso me, ba ka ba sak ashon azumung e, nɔng agbat-agbat àware da ka ba nyes nrisim. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyit kin ki gyɔng yin fok, da ni i ti tees yin banet ayɛt iyerek dɔng awɛ anɛ? Di yin fi i mi shining yin aRushelima ni itees yin ne, ishonong yin fok, ma i ki sak yit nasok anet yɔng na na sot na ace yit ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />ABitrus ni ishɛrɛp batom e, ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;I se gbing-gbing ni in nye yit ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim, aza ifɛ́ anet! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Iyin ba i kin tekak yin aYeso ni kum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ni kum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku te shɛɛt na akum, i sot kawɛy Adakunom se naton wu. Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Iyɛrɛk Ntsi 21:23</ref></char>.</note>, i ku fɛt yin. Awɛt Adakunom badakop yit, wu fɛ́ a kin ku donong ni iku. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Adakunom ku donong sak ni bɔk iyak wu tɛ aRim agwɔm ne Anet-Isheshek, nɔng a da tarak irèn itirik ni iwosong inɛn ni isɛs ifuut anɛn sak ni aIsrela. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Iyit yet yit bafi inesek kanu ifɛ̀ naton ikyɛng fi ite, Kabik aJɛrɛ tsin nesek kanu bà. Kabik fɛ́ Adakunom tom e sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba foos ifɛ̀ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ni izen fɛ́ bakɔk-ashon e fok anɔng, ayɛ bá beseng makiyi, ba shim ke ba fɛs batom aYeso me. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Awɛt aFarasi akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aGamaliyel, anet itees ntsi aMusa, ayɔng fɛ́ ngma banet ku nesek iratek, a dorok tsik na Azumung e. A ka ba nɔɔk itabak fok na ba tsin di tun batom e amatse ninyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />A da fɛ̀ ne bafɛ́ Azumung e, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng bafi aIsrela, bang yiring yin ni ikyɛng fi i shim i nye yin banet bang ne. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Yiring yin fok ni nkɔs ama, aTiyodas kin ka ne anɔng, a tsot kugwɔm fok iwu kyem ikikak, kudot banet bakat anakat anaas ku rosok mo. Ama fɛ́ ba ku fɛt, ba te washash bafi ikuus wu, ikyɛng e ku, ikyɛng de.<verse eid="ACT 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />&lt;&lt;Ama idɔng, anet akak tɛ a ne fɛ́ ba ku yes aJudas anet aGalili, ni izen ifa kudot banet, a kɔk kashon banet idoro kuhwyɛ. Ba bɛ́ ba ku fɛt iwu bà, ngma banet fɛ́ ba ku kuus mo ba te shangaring bà. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Nek anɔng, azaton batom aYeso bang, ka ba won yin kyɛk na ba tseng! Ki ikyɛng ba me ne narɔ banet, i da ta ice awo. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Awɛt ke Adakunom wu a tumung ikyɛng deng, iyin da kyem ni nyeseng yin ne banet bang awo; i da sot, iyin se yin ni ifa na Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Kucɛɛt wu ka ba nɔ na ayɛ. Ba yes batom aYeso me, ba ka hwyereng. Ba fɛ̀ ni iba, da na ba tɛ ba nye itees ni iyerek aYeso awo, ba ma fɛ̀ ni iba na ba tseng.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Batom aYeso me won kazumung e, ni itɛrɛk iyɛ nek iba kyem na ba sɔ izot nek iyerek aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Kaakyi kunom, ba ya kashon ni itees atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong nɛ na nasa banet, na ba shara banet ifɛ̀ itek fok aYeso wu a yet Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ba kasa banet itomong kanakataat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ni nnom e yɔng, ni izen fi kudot bafi ikuus e, se ni idi barasa, baYahuda fɛ́ ba cɛɛt ilem aGirik ayɛt ba te kanak fok, baYahuda fɛ́ ba cɛɛt ilem Aram, mak nesek bakumung bá nayak nninom e awo. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Nek anɔng, batom aYeso kusɔk abe afaa me, tusung ngma bafi ikuus e, ba fɛ̀ ni iba ye, &lt;&lt;I da se gyat iyit ni in won yit kutomong ishara ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ni in kpa yit ikabasa nayak awo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Nek anɔng ábaruneng, kasa yin banet kanakataat ayɛt yin, bayɔng fi i rēn yin, ba bi nggɔn ntek, ba mi shining na Kabik ne kutsitsɛng kutsik. Iyit da ka ba nɔk yit kutomong kang, <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />nɔng iyit da bin nɔɔk yit ace ayɛt ira awon ni itees ifɛ̀ Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ikyɛng fɛ́ Batom aYeso me fɛ̀, itɛrɛk banet ngma kusum iyɛ makiyi. Ba kasa aIstifanus, anet fɛ́ a mi shining ayɛt atsak nɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ, nɛ aFilibus nɛ aPurokorus nɛ aNikano nɛ aTimon nɛ aParminas nɛ aNikolas anet Antakiya, ayɔng fɛ́ da a yet afɛ́ aYahuda awo, a yet ayɔng fɛ́ a tirik sak ni ikuus nggɔn baYahuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Ba ka ba nabak ashon Batom aYeso. Batom e di sak mbɔk ni ba, ba ka ba ra awon.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ifɛ̀ Adakunom ya kashon ni i rasak. Kudot bafi ikuus di barasa ni aRushelima makiyi, áware dot nesek atsak ni ifɛ̀ aYeso.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tekap aIstifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Ni izen e yɔng, aIstifanus anet fɛ́ Adakunom mi ku shining ni itek wu ni kukyem, a nye nkyɔrɔk ajingjing ni ntomong abes nate banet. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Wat banet bakak fɛ́ ba ka ba yes bafi inyis karɔ ka washak, fɛ́ ba yet baYahuda fɛ́ ba ne ni wɔp aSirin, nɛ Alekzandiriya, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni mben aKilikiya, nɛ bafi mben Asiya, iba ba ba kpa nanan na aIstifanus. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Awɛt ba kyem ba ku mes ni icɛɛt awo, nek Kabik aJɛrɛ ku nɔɔk kutsitsɛng makiyi ni icɛɛt e.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Nek anɔng, ba tse ba sɔ ice banet bakak ni nɛt fɛ́ ba da fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Iyit fok yit aIstifanus na tsin nye aman-fɛ̀ naton aMusa nɛ Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Nek anɔng, ba sak nhwyɛ banet nɛ bashɔn iwɔp nɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa dorok. Iba di ngarak ni aIstifanus, ba ku tekap, ba tse ni wu sak na azumung bashɔn. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Ba bɛ́ na banet bakak fɛ́ ba tse ba nɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ mbɔɔs naton wu ye, &lt;&lt;Anet yong di fit ibeseng iyerek karɔ iya ntong yit kang fɛ́ ka se Jɛrɛ ni ntsi aMusa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Nek iyit fok yit a fɛ̀ fok, aYeso anet aNazaret yong a bi fo karɔ kang, na shesheng nggɔn fɛ́ aMusa kin ki nɔɔk yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Ngma banet fɛ́ ba se na azumung e, di te ayisi gbit naton aIstifanus, ba di ayisi wu gyɛs tɛ atomaza.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kucɛɛt fɛ́ aIstifanus nye kazumung e ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Wat agbat-agbat àware me rip aIstifanus e ye, &lt;&lt;Kukun kang fɛ́ ba mi nye naton ngɔn, ku yet atsak ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />AIstifanus e ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng nɛ bada, fok yin ikyɛng fi in da fɛ̀. Adakunom Azɔk-Bazɔk, kin tonong ice wu sak na adakop yit aIbrahim ni iwu rēn resek mo ni mben aMesopotamiya, dang na a bun ni kusot na aHaran. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Adakunom fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;Won mben ngɔn, na banet ngɔn, tseng sak ni mben fi in da ka tonong.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Imɛsɛng 12:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, adakop yit e, a won mben aKaldiya, a tse a sonong na aHaran. Ama iku ada wu, Adakunom ku tom sak ni mben nang fi iyin di se yin yɔkɔnɔng. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ngma na anɔng, Adakunom tsang ku nɔɔk iya itekari mben e awo, ko kutak kuzining ngma awo. Awɛt Adakunom kin ku nye kushii fok, iwu ni nnon wu fɛ́ na bi ne ama wu, mben e bi sot nfuba. Ngma ni fi i yet, aIbrahim kin se dang nggon ni izen e yɔng. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Adakunom fɛ̀ ni wu ane: &lt;Izít ngɔn, bi sot batsen ni mben fi da ku yet kufuba awo, ba bi sot basam, ba bi sɔ izot nfɛ́ ayɛ anakat anaas. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Awɛt in bi tabak banet fɛ́ ba ka ba nesek izot e, ama anɔng, ba bi wuruk ni mben e yɔng, ba bi di ya ntong azeng narɔ kang.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Imɛsɛng 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />&lt;&lt;Ama anɔng, Adakunom nɔɔk aIbrahim amok iya katse fi i da sot ikyɛng iyiring irosom kushi me. Na anɔng aIbrahim di sot ada aIshaku, a ku ya katse ni kunom kufi nkara ama kutes wu. Ama anɔng, aIshaku bɛ́ a sot ada aYakub, aYakub bɛ́ a sot ada badakop yit kusɔk abe afaa.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Nek naman fɛ́ badakop yit kin bɛ̀ sak na aYusufu, ba ku rɛp tɛ asam sak na aMasat. Awɛt Adakunom kin se gung ni iwu, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />a ku sheshek naton ngma ndaam wu. Adakunom kin nɔɔk aYusufu kutsitsɛng kutsik, fi ku sak a di sɛ itek ashon aFirauna agbat agwɔm aMasat. AFirauna sak aYusufu sot agwɔm mben aMasat, a ya igwɔm naton banet ari aFirauna ngma kusum.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />&lt;&lt;Ama anɔng, aduk izong ikak kpa ni mben aMasat nɛ aKanan, nzong e bɛ́ ni izot makiyi, badakop yit kyem ba sɛ nayak awo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYakub fok fok nayak di se na aMasat, a tom badakop yit ni kutseet kufi imɛsɛng. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ni ku tse bá kufɛ́ afaa, aYusufu tonong ice wu sak barunyining, na anɔng wu aFirauna di rēn izit aYusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Ama anɔng, aYusufu sak na ba tse ba bɛ́ na ada wu aYakub ni ishɛrɛp banet ari wu ngma kusum, ba kin se nsɔk kanakataat ina ntoon. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ne anɔng wu aYakub dorok sak ni mben aMasat, azɔng fi iwu nɛ badakop yit di ku. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Ba kin kok nkom bá, ba tse na ba nɛsɛk na aShekem, ni irɛk fi aIbrahim kin shan ni itsɔm ni bɔk nnon aHamor na aShekem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />&lt;&lt;Fi izen bɛ́ bakat fɛ́ Adakunom da shining kushi fɛ́ a kin nye ne aIbrahim, kudot banet yit na aMasat di barasa makiyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Ba bɛ́ ba nye agbat agwɔm akak fɛ́ da a rēn ikikak naton aYusufu awo, a kpa ya igwɔm na aMasat. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />A kpa nyes banet yit anyas makiyi, a di nyeseng na badakop yit, a ka ba te mo gbing-gbing na ba bara nabin nnon fɛ́ ba tes nɔng na da bin kus.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />&lt;&lt;Kpaf izen e yɔng wu fɛ́ ba kin di tes aMusa, aMusa kin yet abɛrɛ nggon awo. Ba sok nfɛn ntaat na ba tsin ku nɛsɛk ari ada wu. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ama fɛ́ ba ku tun amatse, angas aFirauna tse a di tetuk ni wu, a rasak narɔ wu ti nggon wu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Ba kin tees aMusa kutsitsɛng bafɛ́ aMasat. A dorok na agap ni irēn icɛɛt makiyi.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fɛ́ aMusa shining ayɛ nsɔk nnaas, a nye kuyiring a tse di bafi izit wu nnon aIsrela. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Fɛ́ a tse a ta azɔng, a sɛ anet aMasat akak na tsin nesek afi aIsrela mgbang, fɛ́ a tse a ku shan mo, a fɛt anet aMasat e. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />AMusa nye gyan, banet wu bafi aIsrela da rēn fok Adakunom tsin ra kutomong a ka ba tun ayit isam. Awɛt banet e kyem ba di anɔng awo. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Akatson, aMusa bɛ́ a sɛ bafi aIsrela ba tsin kɔn wɔɔn ba. A tsɛt inye kusot ba, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Ábaruneng, iyin yet yin baruneng! Akyɛ sak fi i tsin ra yin imaane wɔɔn yin ɛ?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a se ni inyɔ afidang e, a wobok aMusa ni ifam, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;Angan da te ni isot agwɔm, fi i da ki tsɛɛt yit ishɔt ɛ? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ngɔn shim i di fɛt imi, ti fi i di fɛt anet aMasat yɔng nire yɛ?&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Iwuruk 2:14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Ni izen fɛ́ aMusa fok anɔng, a teng sak ni mben aMidiyan, a tse a sonong azɔng tɛ atsen. Abining wu ku tes nnon namatek e nafaa na aMidiyan e.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />&lt;&lt;Ama ayɛ nsɔk nnaas, atomaza tonong ice wu sak na aMusa ti kurong fi ku tsin ya kuci natse bakat ni Ihwyanang aSinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Ni izen fɛ́ aMusa di anɔng, a ku te yɔɔt ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a tsin yɛrɛ. A serek bakat, a da ban di, a fok kutɔ aTisa: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;Imi yet Adakunom badakop ngɔn, Adakunom afɛ́ aIbrahim, ni aIshaku, nɛ aYakub.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Iwuruk 3:6</ref></char>.</note> Nkum fi kurɔm aMusa ka tiim, a kyem a sɛ iyɛ ting a di ya kashon ni iyɛrɛ me awo.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />&lt;&lt;Adakunom ma fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;Tun akpatak ngɔn; nek karɔ fi i di nyeseng se jɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Di! In mi di mgbang banet hom na aMasat. In mi fok irus bá, nek anɔng in tik, in bi in ka ba bisik. Bɛ́ in da tom sak na aMasat e.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />&lt;&lt;Iwu aMusa me yong fɛ́ ba mang ku raba ni ifɛ̀ anu ye, &lt;Angan da te agwɔm, fi i da ki tsɛɛt yit ishɔt ɛ?&gt; Adakunom ice wu fɛ́ a ku tom na a sot agwɔm bà nɛ anet itun bà, itom ne nanu atomaza fɛ́ a tonong ice wu tɛ kayit fɛ́ ka tsin ya kurong. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />AMusa wu a kin ka ba tun na aMasat ama fɛ́ a mi nye nkyɔrɔk ajingjing ni ntomong abes na aMasat, ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a nye ni Kugbat Kukyɛk Kuseng, a tseng ni iba nate ayit ayɛ nsɔk nnaas.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />&lt;&lt;Iwu aMusa me yong fɛ́ a kin fɛ̀ ni nnon aIsrela yɛ, &lt;Adakunom bi ki tom yin atan akak ti imi fɛ́ a bi ne nate yin.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Iyɛrɛk Ntsi 18:15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Iwu kin tusung ngma banet aIsrela ayɛt ayit. A kin se azɔng gung na badakop yit ni izen fɛ́ atomaza kin cɛɛt ni wu ni Ihwyanang aSinai; iwu fɛ́ a kin shan ifɛ̀ fi inesek kutset fɛ́ a ki nabak yit ne.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt badakop yit raba dan wes ato ni wu, ba raba dan ku fok ifɛ̀. Ba shim ba tɛ ba bun na aMasat. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Ba fɛ̀ na aHaruna ye, &lt;Ki nye yit nabannom fɛ́ na da ki kɔk yit kashon. AMusa yɔng fɛ́ a ka ka tse a ki tun yit na aMasat, iyit rēn yit ikyɛng fi ite ni wu awo!&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Iwuruk 32:1</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ni izen e yɔng wu fɛ́ ba nye nabannom ti ki nyak. Ba bɛ́s ni nabak-akuce bá sak ni ka, ba woso ira amok sak ni ikyɛng fi iba nye ni mbɔk bá. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Nek anɔng, Adakunom ka ba tirik kama, a ka ba wosong na ba ya ntong sak na ádat. Anɔng e se kpaf ni ikyɛng fɛ́ batan Adakunom ki mang jɛk ni fumung yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">&lt;Iyin nnon aIsrela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ni izen fi i kin se yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">natse ayɛ nsɔk nnaas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">iyin kin di bes yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ni nabak-akuce,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ni inesek yin ɛ?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Iyin kin kok yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">kubut ntsi aMolek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">nɛ àdat kaban-nnom yin na fɛ́ aRifan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">nabannom fi iyin kin nye yin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">nek i ka na ya yin ntong.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Nek anɔng, imi bi ki tsa yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ni isam sak ashon aBabila.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fɛ́ badakop yit kin se natse, ba kin bɛ̀ Kubut fi ku tonong kusɛ Adakunom nate ba. Ba kin nye iko kpaf tɛ Adakunom di tak aMusa, a nye iko kpaf ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ku tonong. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Ama fɛ́ badakop yit shan kubut e, ba bereng iko gung ni iba sak ni mben nang fɛ́ Adakunom ro Ícɛn-iduk na yisi bá, a ka ba nɔk mo iko ni izen fɛ́ aJoshuwa tsin ka ba kɔk. Kubut e ya kashon ni isot azɔng sak izen aDauda. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />ADauda sɛ awɛng ashon Adakunom, a ra awon nɔng a da nok karɔ isot Adakunom, adakop yit aYakub ntong. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Awɛt arim wu aSolomon wu a kin ne a nok Adakunom kari me.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />&lt;&lt;Ngma na anɔng, Azɔk-Bazɔk da a sosok na nasa fɛ́ banet nos awo. Kpaf tɛ atan di fɛ̀,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;Adakunom fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">&lt;&lt;Kazanɛn kaa ka yet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kuta igwɔm hom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kazatse yet karɔ isaas atak hom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Akyɛ kuri kari fi iyin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">di ki nok yin ne yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Akɛ wu a yet karɔ ifɔn min ɛ?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Imi wu in nye ngma nkyɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:50">yɔng ni mbɔk yin awɛ?&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Iyin ágbarak ánet, bafɛ́ kɔnggɔt ayɛ, ánet fɛ́ da a foos ifɛ̀ awo! I se yin kpaf tɛ badakop yin: I rayin dan nesek yin Kabik aJɛrɛ kawat kaaki izen! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Akyɛ atan fɛ́ badakop yin kin won dan ku nesek iyɔm ɛ? Ba kin fɛɛs gung na bayɔng fɛ́ ba tak ibes kubɛ́ Anet Atsak e. Awɛt iyin ba i yet yin bafi irɛp e ni ifɛt e. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Iyin fɛ́ ba kin ki nɔk yin ntsi fi in ne ni bɔk batomaza, awɛt i di ra yin kutomong ni ina awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba woro aIstifanus <optbreak /> na ata ma ba fɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Fɛ́ bashɔn azumung e fok anɔng, a ka ba te fuu ni ibeseng iyɛ makiyi, ba ros anyi nek iyɛ beseng sak ni wu. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Awɛt aIstifanus ayɛt ishining Kabik aJɛrɛ, a cet ayisi sak azanɛn, a di ízɔk Adakunom, na aYeso ni inyeseng ni bɔk iyak Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />A ma fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Di yin, in tsin yɛrɛ kazanɛn piyot nɛ Arim Anet ni inyeseng ni bɔk iyak Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ni ifok anɔng, ba famasa ato, ba kpa tang nkun na agap, ba di ngarak naton wu, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />ba kpa ku sam sak ama iwɔp, ba kpa ku bara na ata. Kpaf izen e yɔng, bafi inɔɔk anu me, tusung ares bà ashon acam akak fɛ́ ba ku yes ye aShawulu.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba se ni i ku bara na ata, aIstifanus e ra awon ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa AYeso! Shan kutset hom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />A te akuut aben, a fɛrɛng ne agap ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa Adakunom, i bi sak inɛn deng naton ice bá awo.&gt;&gt; Ama fɛ́ a fɛrɛng anɔng, a men nda.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />AShawulu run kama ifɛt aIstifanus.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">AShawulu nesek bafi ikuus iyɔm</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Atuk e yɔng, izot iratek kpa naton bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se ni aRushelima. Kaangan te washash sak ni mben aJudiya, bakak sak na aSamariya, nkum batom-aYeso kyɛk fɛ́ ba di weseng ni aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba di fit ni irèn ikuus, tse ba nɛt kukom aIstifanus, ba ku tos makiyi. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Awɛt aShawulu shim a wey na bafi ikuus gbindis. A teng a kuus nasa-nasa, na kok bamatek nɛ banyining sak ari inyang.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">AFilibus shara ifɛ̀ na aSamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba te shangaring e, ba shara ifɛ̀ me ngma na narɔ fɛ́ ba di sɛs ace bá. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />AFilibus tik sak ni wɔp aSamariya, a tse a shara ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Ni izen fi kudyɛng banet e fok kucɛɛt aFilibus, ba di ikyɛng ajingjing fɛ́ a se ni nye me, ba bang di nɔɔk nhwyɛ ni kucɛɛt wu. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Itséng wuru ni irɔm banet dot, ni i tang nkun na agap, bayɔng fɛ́ áduru irɔm bá mang kus nɛ ámerek banet sɛs kukyang irɔm. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Nek anɔng, banet iwɔp e nye iyɛ ikan makiyi.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">ASiman anet kubok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Anet akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aSiman a se ni wɔp e, a mi fɔɔn na abok azɔng ni wɔp e, banet iwɔp aSamariya ngma kusum ayɔɔt ka ba yisik nek kabes yɔng fɛ́ aSiman ras. A tsosok kugwɔm fok iwu kyem makiyi, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />ngma banet iwɔp e, baratek nɛ babane, ba ku nesek izen bá, ne ba nye, &lt;&lt;Anet yong, bɛ̀ kukyem fi ku nes narɔ Adakunom fɛ́ ba yes iko Kukyem Kuratek.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Banet e teng ba ku kuus mo nek a mi sok izen na ka ba tes ayɔɔt ni kuborok wu me. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Awɛt nkum fɛ́ ba di nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ itek ifi igwɔm Adakunom, ni ifi iyerek aYeso Kristi fɛ́ aFilibus ka ba shara ide, ba ka ba ra abatisma bamatek nɛ banyining. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />ASiman ice wu a nɔɔk atsak, ba ku ra abatisma. A teng a di kuus aFilibus kaakyɛ fɛ́ a di tse, a ku tes yɔɔt makiyi fɛ́ a yɛrɛ nzam ntomong ajingjing ni ibes fɛ́ aFilibus ras.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Ni izen fɛ́ batom aYeso fɛ́ ba se ni aRushelima fok ye banet aSamariya mi shan ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ba tom ba aBitrus nɛ aYohana sak azɔng ni ba. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta azɔng, ba ra awon sak na Adakunom naton ba, nɔng ba bin shan Kabik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Nek sak izen e yɔng, Kabik aJɛrɛ rēn resek dang di tik natoon ba, nkum abatisma fɛ́ ba ras ni iyerek aTisa aYeso wu kyɛk fɛ́ ba mi tsang ka ba ra ne. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Wat aBitrus nɛ aYohana di saas mbɔk natoon ba, ba wat ba sɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ me.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Fɛ́ aSiman di banet ses Kabik ama fɛ́ batom aYeso di saas mbɔk natoon ba, aSiman sok itsɔm a nɔɔk ba aBitrus nɛ aYohana, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Di nɔk yin kukyem e kang bà, nɔng kaakyɛ anet fi imi di sak kubɔk ni wu, a da sɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ me bà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Wat aBitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Won itsɔm ngɔn ni ibeseng gung ni ngɔn, nek ngɔn di ti i da kyem ishan kunang Adakunom ni itsɔm! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Kubɔk ngɔn di se ayɛt kutomong kang awo ko gyeet, nek iyɛ ngɔn se tsik ashon Adakunom awo. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Tirik, wosong anɛn ngɔn, ra awon sak na aTisa Adakunom, nyan a da ka fuut inɛn aduk kuyiring yɔng fi i bɛ̀ ni iyɛ ngɔn. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Nek imi mi di aduk ifup ni iyɛ ngɔn ni irosom fi inɛn mi da nye ne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Wat aSiman tɛ a ku bun ni ifɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Ra awon na aTisa nek imi! Kɔng ikyɛng fi ngɔn mi fɛ́ bi te ni imi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi taas, ba shara ifɛ̀ aTisa sak na banet, ba aBitrus nɛ aYohana tɛ ba bun sak ni aRushelima, ba teng ba shara ifɛ̀ itek e na naban wɔp aSamariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">AFilibus nɛ Amaring aItopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ama anɔng, atomaza aTisa bɛ́ a fɛ̀ na aFilibus, &lt;&lt;Dorok, di kuus irèn katse fi i ne na aRushelima itisik sak na aGaza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />AFilibus dorok, a kpa ne sak azɔng, a nat a nyim na anet aItopiya fɛ́ ayet amaring, anet itomong igwɔm fi iwu wu a yɛrɛ ngma ímyɛ aKandas, afɛ́ azɛnɛ fɛ́ a ya igwɔm mben aItopiya. Anet e kin tse a ya Adakunom ntong ni aRushelima, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />a se ni ibun sak ari, a mi sonong ayɛt kubut-atak itsees ni itsaap, a se ni ifa kufumung atan aIshaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ̀ ne aFilibus, &lt;&lt;Tse bakat ni kubut-atak itsees ni itsaap e, nyeseng bakat azɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Wat aFilibus rumung i tsi sak narɔ kubut-atak itsees ni itsaap e, a tse a fok a se ni ifa kufumung atan aIshaya. AFilibus ku rip ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yɔng i rēn ikyɛng fi i tsin fa me yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Agbat anet e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;In da tsa anɛ fi in da rēn ɛ? In fɛ̀ kɛ ma akak di tees mo awɛ?&gt;&gt; Wat a fɛ̀ na aFilibus na ngarak, na a sonong gung ni iwu.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Amaring e kin se ni ifa karɔ ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">&lt;&lt;Ba kin ku ta ashon ti kitsamang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">fɛ́ ba tse ba tsɛɛt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">a di wey yuu tɛ katuruk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ni bɔk anet ikot akwyi ka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">a sot yuu anɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">vit itarak kanu.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Nek ibyɛs, ba raba dan ku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">tsɛɛt ishɔt atsak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Angan da kyem na cɛɛt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">naton izit wu yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Nek ba kin sok kutset wu azatse.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">AIshaya 53:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Amaring e rip aFilibus ye, &lt;&lt;Kabɔk di tak, atan Adakunom e se ni icɛɛt na angan ɛ? Ni ice wu a? Kɛ na akak ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Wat aFilibus sok nkum kufumung kuyɔng e, a di kpa ku shara mo ifɛ̀ itek naton aYeso.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Ba se ni kutseet naton irèn, ba wat ba sɛ ashi, amaring e fɛ̀ na aFilibus, &lt;&lt;Di ashi na, akyɛ da ro na ba di ra abatisma yɛ?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak fɛ́ ba jɛk ni kubɔk yame a bɛ̀ ibyat ifɛ́ </char><char style="fv">37</char> ane: <char style="fqa" closed="false">aFilibus fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Ki ngɔn nɔɔk atsak ni iyɛ izining, in da kyem in da ra abatisma.&gt;&gt; Amaring e fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ey, in nɔɔk atsak, aYeso Kristi yet Arim Adakunom e.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />A ma fɛ̀, na ba nyeseng ni kubut-atak itsees ni itsaap e. AFilibus nɛ amaring e, ba nɔ ayɛt ashi me gung, wat aFilibus ku ra abatisma. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba wuruk ayɛt ashi me, Kabik aTisa wat ka ta aFilibus fyew, ka tseng ni wu, agbat anet e tɛ a ku di awo, a ya kashon ni kutseet wu ayit iyɛ ikan. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />AFilibus tse a sɛ ice wu ne Azotus, a ya kashon ni ishara ifɛ̀ itek e ni nwɔp ngma ma a tse a di ta na aKaisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">AShawulu tirik a shan aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ni izen e yɔng, na aShawulu tsin rēn ya kashon ni ishiri bafi ikuus aYeso kaakɛ fok, iwu da ka ba fɛɛs. A tsɛ a sɛ agbat-agbat àware <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />a tsɛt kufumung ni wu fɛ́ a di ki tseng sak na karɔ inyis baYahuda fɛ́ ka se na aDamaskos, nɔng ke a tsɛ a sɛ akak azɔng fɛ́ a se ni irèn ikuus e<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 14:6">AYohana 14:6</ref></char>.</note>, kɛ na a yet amatek e kɛ abining e ayi, a da ka ba kok ni irosom sak ni aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ni wu mo ni irèn, a mi bɛ́ bakat na aDamaskos, ni izen izining mgbey nkak ne azanɛn in ku te nate. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />A kpa aben, a fok kutɔ fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;AShawulu, aShawulu, akyɛ sak fi ngɔn di nesek izot ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />AShawulu rip ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ngɔn yet angan ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">A fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet aYeso fi ngɔn tsin zoot.<verse eid="ACT 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Dorok yɔkɔnɔng, tseng sak ayit iwɔp, ba da ka tak ikyɛng fi i se gbing-gbing ni i nye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Banet fɛ́ ba se ni itseet gung ne aShawulu di wey yɔɔt; ba fok kutɔ me akabɛs, awɛt ba di anet awo. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />AShawulu dorok aben, a tarak ayisi vit ikyɛng fɛ́ a kyem a di. Nek anɔng, ba ku kɔk kubɔk sak ayit iwɔp aDamaskos. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />A sok nkɔs ntaat, ayisi vit iyɛrɛ, vit iya, vit isɔ ikikak.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Anet ikuus akak kin se azɔng na aDamaskos fɛ́ ba ku yes Ananiyas. Adakunom cɛɛt ni iwu na nabos abik, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ananiyas!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Ananiyas shim ye, &lt;&lt;Imi yo, aTisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />ATisa fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Dorok sak ari aJudas ni irèn fɛ́ ba yes iye aTsik. Rip anet fɛ́ ba ku yes ye aShawulu afi iwɔp aTarsus, nek a se ni ira awon. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />A mi di ayɛt nabos abik fok, anet fɛ́ ba ku yes Ananiyas bɛ́, a di sak mbɔk natoon wu, ayisi wu tarak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiyas fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;ATisa, imi mi fok ncɛɛt dot naton anet yɔng, ni kuri anyas fɛ́ a mi nye banet ikuus fɛ́ ba se ni aRushelima ne. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ku bɛ́ wu kang, agbat-agbat áware mi ku nɔk ice na a yisik ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba yes iyerek dɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Awɛt aTisa fɛ̀ na Ananiyas, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn tse kyɛk, iwu mi sot anet fi imi mi kasa tɛ ares itomong hom, a da tse sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, nɛ bágwɔm bá, a da tɛ a tse na bafi aIsrela. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Imi da ku tonong azikit mgbang fɛ́ a da sɔ nek iyerek hom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ananiyas ma tse ari me, a nɔ ayɛt e. Ama fɛ́ a di sak mbɔk ni wu, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Aruneng aShawulu, aTisa aYeso fɛ́ a nyim ni ngɔn ni irèn ibɛ́ azeng, iwu fɛ́ a di tom ni in bi in da tarak ayisi, nɔng ba bin da shining na Kabik aJɛrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ni izen izining, ikyɛng ikak tɛ kukpɛrɛ ne ni yisi me sak aben, a wat a kpa yɛrɛ. A dorok, ba tse ba ku ra abatisma, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />ama fɛ́ a yas, agap wu bun ni irɔm wu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">AShawulu na <optbreak /> aDamaskos nɛ aRushelima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">AShawulu nye nnom gaan ne bafi ikuus azɔng na aDamaskos. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Vit ibeseng izen, a kpa shara ifɛ̀ narɔ inyis baYahuda fok aYeso yet Arim Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku fok, ayɔɔt ka ba yisik, na ba nye, &lt;&lt;Anet e yong fɛ́ a fɛs banet na aRushelima nek iyerek e deng awɛ? Akyɛ me fok a bɛ́ azeng nek iyisik bafi ikuus fɛ́ a da tse ni iba ashon agbat-agbat áware anɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ngma ne anɔng, aShawulu ban rasak ne agap, a ya kashon ni ites baYahuda fɛ́ ba se na aDamaskos kpɔrɔk, a ka ba tonoso wɛshɛk fok aYeso yet Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ama nkɔs gaan bin igot, baYahuda tɔ wɔɔn ba fok ba da sok kutset wu, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />aShawulu fok ikyɛng fɛ́ ba shim ba nye. Kunom nɛ katuk ba woso tang ayisi atisi inɔ iwɔp nɔng ba da ku fɛt. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Awɛt nnon imɛɛs wu, ku sok natuk, ba ku tik ayɛt na akɔmɔng na ahyot akak fɛ́ a se ni bat.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Ni izen fɛ́ a tsɛ a ta na aRushelima, a shim a moon ice ne bafi ikuus, awɛt ngma ba ba ku teng wu, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak fok a yet atitup afi ikuus. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Awɛt aBarnabas wu fɛ́ a ku sok, a tse ni iwu ashon batom aYeso. A ka ba tak irèn fɛ́ aShawulu ni irèn wu sak na aDamaskos, di nyim na aTisa, fɛ́ a di fok kutɔ aTisa. A tɛ a ka ba tak irèn fɛ́ aShawulu shara banet ifɛ̀ Adakunom ayɛt iyerek aYeso na aDamaskos, vit inyim. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Nek anɔng, aShawulu sot gung ni iba, a tsees washak akɔn wu, na nyes kucɛɛt vit inyim ni iyerek aYeso ayɛt aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />A cɛɛt, na ba kɔk nanan ne baYahuda fɛ́ ba cɛɛt ilem BaGirik, ba tsɛt irèn ifɛt wu. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ni izen fɛ́ baruneng bafi ikuus fok anɔng, ba ku sok, ba tseng ni iwu sak na aKaisariya, ba ku te ni irèn sak na aTarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ne anɔng wu fɛ́ bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aJudiya nɛ aGalili nɛ aSamariya, di sɛ kusonong kukyang. Bafi ikuus di sɛ agap, Kabik aJɛrɛ ka ba sɛ mo, kudot bá di barasa kutseet ayɛt nnyim aTisa.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABitrus ra kutomong abes <optbreak /> ni wɔp aLida nɛ aJopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Fɛ́ aBitrus teng a tsees na narɔ zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, a tse narɔ bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se ni iwɔp aLida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />A tsɛ a di te tuk na anet akak azɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes Aniyas, ayɔng fɛ́ a se na meneng ayɛ nkara nek aduru irɔm wu mi ku. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Aniyas, aYeso Kristi mi da te kyang. Dorok, nye kameneng ngɔn.&gt;&gt; Ni izen izining, Aniyas wat a dorok tsik. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Ngma banet fɛ́ ba se na aLida nɛ bafi iwɔp aSharon fɛ́ ba ku di a mi te kyang, ba tirik sak na aTisa.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Abin ikuus akak kin se ni wɔp aJopa, fɛ́ ba ku yes aTabita, fi i ti i yet aDokas, kaakyi izen a ras banet ikyɛng itek, a di sɛs bakan. A ras bakan nkyɔrɔk ntek ngma ayɛ ites wu. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ni izen e yɔng, aTabita bɛ́ a kpa ni irɔk, a bɛ́ a ku, ba se ni so kukom e, ba tsɛ ba sak iko ni kutu ari aton. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Nek aLida sak na aJopa mak se yik-yik awo, fɛ́ bafi ikuus fok ye aBitrus se na aLida, ba tom banet bafaa sak azɔng ye, &lt;&lt;Kabɔk, bɛ́ ziri!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Wat aBitrus dorok, a ka ba kuus mo. Ni izen fɛ́ a tse a ta azɔng, ba ngarak ni iwu nitu ari aton e. Ngma bakumung fɛ́ ba se azɔng dorok, ba nyeseng bakat ni iwu, na ba san nanak, na ba ku tonoso nkpin fɛ́ aDokas e kin ka ba bat e, ni wu rēn se ni iba.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Wat aBitrus ka ba tun ngma ayɛt itu me, a te nyɔk na akuut wu, a ra awon. A tirik sak ni kukom abining e, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATabita, dorok tsik.&gt;&gt; Abining e tarak ayisi, a yɛrɛk aBitrus, a dorok a sonong tsik. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />ABitrus ku yit kubɔk, a ku sɛ mo idorok. A ma yes bafi ikuus, nɛ bakumung e, a ka ba nabak iwu ni kutset. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Kucɛɛt ikyɛng fi ite me, tseng kaakyɛ na aJopa, banet dot ban di nɔɔk atsak ne aTisa aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />ABitrus ban nye nkɔs dot azɔng na aJopa gung na anet kutomong akpa akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aSiman.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">AKonilus tom na ba ku yes aBitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Na aKaisariya, anet akak kin di se fɛ́ ba kin ku yes aKonilus. A kin yet agbat atsom aRoma, ni kudyɛng batsom fɛ́ ba yes iko ye Kudyɛng bafɛ́ aItaliya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Iwu nɛ bafɛ́ ari wu kusum, ba kin yet bafi inabak ice, ni inyim Adakunom; a nesek ni kubɔk washak sak nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ kudaam, na ras awon sak na Adakunom kaakyi izen. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Atuk akak abak itsom-bɔk itaat ifɛ́ ahwyɛ, nabos ku bɛ́, a di atomaza Adakunom ku wuruk, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;AKonilus!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />AKonilus di sak ayisi ni wu ayit inyim. A fɛ̀ ni atomaza me, &lt;&lt;ATisa, akyɛ de yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Atomaza me fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ba mi fok awon ngɔn, kunang fi i nesek bakan mi ta ashon Adakunom, ku mi te Adakunom mi yiring ni ngɔn. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Tun banet sak na aJopa yɔkɔnɔng, na ba tse ba bɛ́ na aSiman, ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes aBitrus. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />A se ni kusot ari aSiman anet kutomong akpa, ayɔng fɛ́ kari wu se bakat ne kanu izek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ama fɛ́ atomaza fɛ́ a nye kucɛɛt e mi tseng, aKonilus yes basam wu bafaa, ne atsom wu azining fɛ́ a ku tosok, ayɔng fɛ́ a bi inyim Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />A ka ba tak kaakyɛ fi i te, a ma ka ba tom sak na aJopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kabes fɛ́ aBitrus di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Akatson, abak itsom-bɔk kusɔk abe afaa ifi inom, basam aKonilus se kutseet ngmash na ba tse ba ta ni wɔp e, aBitrus ngarak naton itu, a tse ra awon. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Nzong ku yit, a tsɛt ikyɛng iya, na tsin rēn tot kuyak fɛ́ ba se ni inye me, a di abes. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />A di kazanɛn piyot, a di na ba tsin tisik ikyɛng kak ni kukpin atsok anaas sak azatse. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Ayɛt ko, nzam inyam ayit, idɔng itses aben, ni idɔng fi itses naton aza. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />A fɛ́ fok kutɔ fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Dorok aBitrus! Fɛt, da ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ye kye awey yo, aTisa! Imi kin man ya ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀ i se gbek-gbek ni igbiridik e awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Kutɔ me ti ku fɛrɛng ni wu ite kafa, &lt;&lt;I bi yes ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom nye fok i se gbiridik kɛ ibɛ arik awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ikyɛng deng te ni wu ite kataat, ama anɔng, ba sok ina sak azanɛn. <figure style="fig" alt="Peter's vision of unclean animals" file="WA03963b.tif" size="col" loc="ACT 10:16" copy="Wade Images" ref="10:9-16">Kabes fɛ́ aBitrus di naton inyam ntsi</figure><verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />ABitrus woso kuyiring ye, &lt;&lt;ikyɛng e deng yet akyɛ?&gt;&gt; Ayɛt anɔng, banet fɛ́ aKonilus yirik mi bɛ́ ba ta, ama fɛ̀ ba mi tsɛt kari aSiman, ba bɛ́ ba nyeseng natisi ari me <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />ba nɔ ba rip ye, &lt;&lt;Ke i bɛ̀ yin atsen akak azeng fɛ́ ba ku yes aSiman fɛ́ a yet aBitrus ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Na aBitrus tsin rēn bɔrɔng ni kuyiring kudi abes e, Kabik e fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;ASiman, banet bataat tsin da tsɛt. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Dorok, tik aben. I bi rangɔn itseng gung ni iba awo, nek a yet imi wu fi in ka ba tom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />ABitrus tik sak aben, a fɛ̀ ne banet e, &lt;&lt;Imi wu fi i tsin di tsɛt yin. Akyɛ bɛ́ ni iyin ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Banet e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Iyit ne yit narɔ aKonilus agbat atsom aRoma. Anet fɛ́ a foos inyim Adakunom, ayɔng fɛ́ baYahuda kusum ku nesek iratek. Atomaza aJɛrɛ fɛ̀ ni wu, na a sak ba da yes sak ari wu, nɔng a da bin fok ikyɛng fi ngɔn da fɛ̀ ni wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Awɛt aBitrus nɔ ni iba, a ka ba nɔk karɔ ifɔɔn.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">ABitrus ari aKonilus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Akatson, aBitrus yit irèn gung ni iba, bafi ikuus bakak fɛ́ ba se azɔng na aJopa ku kuus mo sak azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Akatson ba tse ba ta na aKaisariya. AKonilus se ni ikaba tot nek anɔng a sak ba ku tusung bafi izit wu nɛ bafidang isot wu. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBitrus bɛ́ a nɔ ari me, aKonilus ku shan ni kubɛ́, a kpa natak wu a tsin ku ya ntong. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Awɛt aBitrus ku sak na a dorok, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Dorok tsik, imi yet anet awe kpaf ti ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Na aBitrus tsin rēn se ni kucɛɛt ni wu, a nɔ ari me, a se banet dot mi ka na tusung. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />A fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ngma yin i rēn yin fok, ntsi yit rone anet aYahuda na a moon ice na bafi Ícɛn-iduk, kɛ na a ku tse itsen ayi. Awɛt Adakunom mi di tonong fok da ni in yes anet akak agbɛk-gbɛk kɛ agbiridik e awo. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Nek anɔng, izen fi in fok iyes, imi bat ifɛ̀ awo. Yɔkɔnɔng, imi shim in rēn ikyɛng fi i sak i di yes mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />AKonilus ku bun ni ifɛ̀: &lt;&lt;Nkɔs nnaas atut, in kin se ni ira awon bakat itsɔm bɔk itaat ifi inom, in fi in di anet ni nyeseng ashon in, a mi te ares fɛ́ a gyɛs. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Anet e fɛ̀ ni imi ye, &lt;AKonilus, Adakunom mi fok awon ngɔn ni nnang fi ngɔn nesek bakan e, a mi sak ba yiring ni ngɔn. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tom akak sak na aJopa, na ba da yes aSiman, ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes aBitrus. A se ni itsen ari aSiman afi kutomong akpa, ayɔng fɛ́ kari wu se nanu izek.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Nek anɔng wu fi in di tom, ba da yes mo ziri ziri, ngɔn nye gyat fi i bɛ́. Iyit bang in mi te nyɔk yit ashon Adakunom, in shim in fok yit ikyɛng fɛ́ a mi da nɔɔk nek i ki tak yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Awɛt aBitrus kpa cɛɛt ye, &lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng imi rēn fɛ́ atsak e di se fok Adakunom tonoso ishim ice awo, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />a shashang kaangan fɛ́ a foos nnyim wu, na nyes ikyɛng fi i se gyat, ke na a ne na kaakyi kuri icɛn ayi. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Iyin rēn yin itom fɛ́ Adakunom tom banet aIsrela ne, a ka ba shara ifɛ̀ itek fi ibɛ́s ni kusonong kukyang fɛ́ ba sɛs iko ni bɔk aYeso Kristi, iwu fɛ́ a yet aTisa aza akaakyi ikyɛng. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Iyin rēn yin nkyɔrɔk fi in te na aJudiya, i kin tumung na aGalili, ama ishara ifɛ̀ fɛ́ aYohana nye banet e naton abatisma. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Iyin rēn yin imyak fɛ́ Adakunom myak aYeso anet aNazaret, a ku shining ne Kabik aJɛrɛ ni kukyem, na narɔ fɛ́ a teng a di kat, na di ras ntomong ntek, na tes ngma bayɔng fɛ́ aShetan mi ka ba te gyip kyang, nek Adakunom kin se gung ni iwu.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />&lt;&lt;Iyit kin di yit ngma ikyɛng fi i kin te ni mben baYahuda nɛ ayɛt aRushelima. Ba kin ku fɛt ni irèn itekak ni kum, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />awɛt Adakunom ku donong ni iku ni kunom kufɛ́ ataat, a sak na tonong ice sak na banet. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ayet fok banet kusum wu fɛ́ ba ku di awo, nkum sak ni yit fɛ́ Adakunom man ki kasa yit ni in sot yit bafi icɛɛt. Iyit ba in kin yas yit, in kin sɔ yit gung ni iwu, ama fɛ́ ba ku donong ni irɛk. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />A fɛ̀ ni iyit ni in shara yit ifɛ̀ me sak na banet e, ni in tas yit fok iwu wu a yet ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom myak tɛ agwɔm ishɔt naton bafi kutset nɛ bafaben. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Ngma batan man nye kucɛɛt naton wu ye, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni iwu, a bi sɛ ifuut inɛn wu ni iyerek aYeso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Na aBitrus tsin rēn cɛɛt ifɛ̀ me dɔng, Kabik ajɛrɛ tik naton ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni ifoos ifɛ̀ me. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba ne gung na aBitrus, iba bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bafɛ́ katse, a kaba te yɔɔt fi kunang Kabik aJɛrɛ di tik naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet Ícɛn-iduk. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Nek iba fok fɛ́ ba tsin cɛɛt ayɛt icɛn akak fɛ́ da ayet afuba awo, na ba tere Adakunom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">ABitrus ma fɛ̀, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Akak di se fɛ́ a da ro na ba ra banet bang abatisma ashi yɛ? Ba mi shan abatisma Kabik aJɛrɛ nagbɔng ti iyit.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Nek anɔng, a fɛ̀ na ba ka ba ra abatisma ni iyerek aYeso Kristi. Ama anɔng, banet fɛ̀ na aBitrus, na a ban nye nkɔs gung ni iba.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">ABitrus tonong bafi ikuus kutomong fɛ́ a ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Batom aYeso ni ishɛrɛp bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se ni mben aJudiya fok, fok Ícɛn-iduk mi shan ifɛ̀ Adakunom bà. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Nek anɔng, izen fɛ́ aBitrus bun sak ni aRushelima, bayɔng fɛ́ ba tees naton nggɔn iya katse ku te ashon, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn tsi nɔɔs na nasa Ícɛn-iduk, bayɔng fɛ́ ba se dang iya katse, i tsi iyas gung ni iba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />ABitrus kpa ka ba taas ikyɛng fi ite, nkum itumung e, sak ni igang e: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Imi kin se ni wɔp aJopa, in tsin ra awon, in di abes, in wat in di ba tsin tisik ni ikyɛng ikak fɛ́ ba rosom atsok anaas e, ba tik ide sak narɔ fi imi kin di se. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />In yɛrɛ kayɛt ko, in di nzam inyam azatse, ifɛ́ ayit, ni idɔng fi i kɔk nafa lee aben nɛ nanon aza. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Wat in fok kutɔ fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;Dorok, aBitrus. Tsɛɛt ina, da ya.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />&lt;&lt;Imi fɛ̀ ni kutɔ me, &lt;ATisa, ko ni kuro, imi da kyem in ya awo! Neme fi in di se, ikyɛng fi i se gbɛk-gbɛk kɛ igbiridik e man nɔ nanu hom awo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Kutɔ azanɛn e ti ku fɛrɛng ifɛ́ afaa ye, &lt;I bi yes ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom nye igbɛk-gbɛk kɛ ifɛ́ arik awo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ikyɛng e deng te anɔng, ite kataat, ama anɔng, ba kɔrɔk iko sak naton.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen e yɔng, banet bataat fɛ́ ba bɛ́ ne na aKaisariya se ni nyeseng natitu ari yɔng fi imi di se. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Kabik e fɛ̀ ni imi ye da in bi ramin dang in kaba kuus mo awo, nek itonong fok akak se zɛɛt awo. Baruneng karataat kin tse gung ni imi, ngma yit in nɔ yit ari anet e. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />A ki tak yit kpaf fɛ́ a di atomaza ni nyeseng ari wu, fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;Tom sak na aJopa, ba da yes aSiman ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes aBitrus. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />A da ka bɛ́ ni itom fi i da sak ngɔn nɛ bafɛ́ ari ngɔn ngma kusum di ki sɛ isheshek.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fi in kpa cɛɛt, Kabik aJɛrɛ tik naton ba, kyɔn tɛ ka kin di tik naton yit ni itumung e. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Wat kuyiring di bɛ́ naton ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa kin man fɛ̀ ye: &lt;aYohana kin ras abatisma ne ashi, awɛt iyin ba bi ki ra yin abatisma ne Kabik aJɛrɛ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ke Adakunom ka ba nɔk kunang kpaf ni kuyɔng fɛ́ a kin ki nɔɔk yit, iyit bayɔng fi in nɔɔk yit atsak na aTisa aYeso Kristi. Ki i se anɔng, imi yet angan fi i da tɛnɛng Adakunom ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, nanan ba wat na nyeseng, ba tere Adakunom na ba nye, &lt;&lt;Árɔ, pet ni Ícɛn-iduk, Adakunom mi tarak irèn ifi itirik iwosong inɛn sak isɛs kutset.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafi ikuus na Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ama ifɛt aIstifanus, ba kpa tang bafi ikuus iyɔm makiyi. Nek anɔng, ba ka na shara yik-yik sak na narɔ zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt. Bakak tseng sak na aFinikiya nɛ aSayipurus, nɛ Antakiya. Ba teng ba shara ifɛ̀ aYeso sak na baYahuda kyɛk. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Bakak ayɛt bafi ikuus e na aSayipurus nɛ aSirin, ba tse na Antakiya, ba tse ba shara ifɛ̀ itek aYeso sak na BaGirik. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Kubɔk aTisa kin se gung ni iba, banet dot nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ bá, ba tirik, ba wosong inɛn bá, ba sot bafɛ́ aTisa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Kucɛɛt ikyɛng fi ite me nɔ na ato bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aRushelima, nek anɔng, ba tom aBarnabas sak na Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ni izen fɛ́ a tse a ta azɔng, a di itek fɛ́ Adakunom mi nye, a shining ni itɛrɛk iyɛ, a bang ka ba te gbagba ni kucɛɛt ye na ba ya kashon inesek atsak na aTisa ni iyɛ izining. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />ABarnabas kin yet anet nhwyɛ, ayɔng fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ mi ku shining, anet fɛ́ a bɛ̀ agap ni inɔɔk atsak. Banet dot di barang ni inɔɔk atsak na aTisa.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ama anɔng, aBarnabas tseng sak na aTarsus nek itsɛt aShawulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ni izen fɛ́ a ku sɛ, a tseng ni iwu sak na Antakiya. Ngma ba, ba sot azɔng na bafi ikuus iyɛ burang, na ba tees kudyɛng banet kucɛɛt atsak. Na Antakiya wu fɛ́ ba kin tumung iyes bafi ikuus aYeso ye bafi ikuus Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ni izen e yɔng, batan bakak nes na aRushelima ba tisik sak na Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Azining ayɛt ba fɛ̀ ba kin ku yes Agabus, a dorok tsik ni inyim ba ikak, ayɛt kushining abik, a tak ibes iduk nzong fi i da kpa kazatse ngma kusum. (Ibes e shining ni izen fɛ́ aKalaudiyus se ni iya igwɔm.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Nek anɔng, bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na Antakiya tɔ fok ba da nye itom nkyɔrɔk fi nda kyɛk kudaam sak na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aJudiya, kaangan da nɔɔk kpaf na agap wu. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ba kin ra anɔng e, ba ma yirik ba aBarnabas na aShawulu na ares e, nɔng ba bin tse ba nɔɔk bashɔn bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aRushelima.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ba fɛt aYakubu ne ba te kpaf aBitrus ni inyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ni izen e yɔng wu, agbat agwɔm aHiridus yisik bakak ayɛt bafi ikuus aYeso, a ka ba nesek izot. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />A te na ba fɛt aYakubu arunyining aYohana na awal. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Fɛ́ aHiridus di fok ikyɛng fɛ́ a nye itɛrɛk baYahuda iyɛ, a sak ba ku tekap aBitrus. Ikyɛng e deng kin te ni izen Amok Akpam Vit aYiis. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ama fɛ́ ba ku tekap, a ku te kpaf ari inyang, a ku sak ni bɔk batsom baninaas, baninaas, asa anaas na ba kuyɛrɛ. Kuyiring aHiridus kin yet fok a bi ne a tun aBitrus ni bang na a ku tsɛɛt ishɔt ama amok e. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Awɛt na aBitrus resek mo ari inyang e, bafi ikuus ra awon makiyi nek iwu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba nye aBitrus isheshek ayɔɔt ari inyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Natuk akatson fɛ́ aHiridus bi tsɛɛt aBitrus ishɔt, a se ni nda, ba mi ku rosom na anyang afaa nate batsom bafaa. Na batsom e bakak se ni itot katisi kari inyang e. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ni izen izining, kari inyang e wat ka ron gbey, atomaza bɛ́ a nyeseng ashon aBitrus. Atomaza me ku bamang mok na a shemeng, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Dorok, ziri ziri!&gt;&gt; Anyang e wat a tik jerek ni mbɔk wu. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Wat atomaza me fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Te ares ngɔn, te akpatak ngɔn&gt;&gt; Ama fɛ́ a nye anɔng, atomaza me fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Te kukpin amatse ngɔn, di kuus mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />ABitrus dorok a di rosok atomaza me ba won kari inyang e. Iwu yes gyan a tsin rasak nabos. A kyem a rēn fok ikyɛng fi i tsin te yet atsak awo. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ba bɛ́ ba got bafi itosok imɛsɛng e, ne bafɛ́ afaa me, izen fɛ́ ba bɛ́ ba ta na katisi ari inyang kafi igang e sak ayɛt iwɔp fɛ́ ba nye ika na atsom, katisi me wat ka tarak ikyɛng ka. Nek anɔng ba di tatɔk, ba kpa tseng na agbat irèn iwɔp e. Izen fɛ́ ba se na anɔng, wat aBitrus fɛ́ di atomaza me mi te bit, a ku won aziwu.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ni izen e yɔng wu aBitrus bun ni nhwyɛ wu, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng e yet atsak, aTisa tom atomaza wu, na a di sheshek ni bɔk aHiridus, na a di tun ni ikyɛng fɛ́ baYahuda tsɛt na ba nye ni imi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ama fɛ́ a di anɔng, a yit irèn sak ari aMarya, nggɔ aYohana fɛ́ ba ku yes aMarkus, karɔ fɛ́ banet mi kana tusung dot ba se na awon. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Ni izen nɔng fɛ́ aBitrus rus katitu amatse, kanamang yɔng fɛ́ ka ra kutomong ari me fɛ́ ba ka ka yes aRuda, ka tse nɔng ka da ku tarak e. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nkum fɛ́ ka fok kutɔ aBitrus, nek kudot ifeng, ka wat ka won itarak katitu me, ka tɛ bun sak ayɛt e, ka tse ka tak banet ngma kusum ye, &lt;&lt;ABitrus yɔng ni nyeseng atitu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Ba fɛ̀ ni ika, &lt;&lt;Ice ngɔn yet izining awo!&gt;&gt; Fɛ́ kago me di ban, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;A da yet atomaza wu wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ni izen e yɔng, aBitrus woso tsot katitu me. Ama fɛ́ ba ne ba tarak katitu me, ba ku di, ikyɛng e ka ba te kpɔrɔk. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />A ka ba tonong ni itsambɔk fok na ba te yuu, a ma ka ba tak irèn fɛ́ Adakunom ku tun mo ari inyang. A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Tak yin aYakubu ni ishɛrɛp baruneng ikyɛng fi ite.&gt;&gt; Ama anɔng, a yit irèn sak narɔ kakak.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Fɛ́ kadiding nye, kudaam hwyɛ awo nɔ nate batsom e, naton ikyɛng fi ite na aBitrus. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Agbat agwɔm aHiridus sak na ba tse ba ku bɛ́ na aBitrus. Fɛ́ ba ku bit, aHiridus risim batsom e, a nɔɔk ifɛ̀ na ba fɛɛs iba. Ama anɔng, aHiridus won mben aJudiya, a tseng sak na aKaisariya a tse sonong azɔng nfi ki izen.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iku aHiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Ni izen e yɔng, aHiridus beseng iyɛ ne banet aTiya nɛ aSidon. Nek anɔng, ba tun banet fɛ́ ba da tsɛt inosong-ashi ni wu, nek banet mben e tes iyɛ naton mben aHiridus nek isɛs kuyak iya. Banet fɛ́ ba tun e, ba sɛ irun ama aBilastus agbat asam fɛ́ a ra kutomong inyes igwɔm kameneng, <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />ba ka ba te izen inyim na aHiridus. Atuk fi kunom inyim e nye, aHiridus nɔ ayɛt ares igwɔm wu, a sonong ni kuta igwɔm wu, a kpa cɛɛt ni iba. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Fɛ́ a se ni kucɛɛt, banet e tang nkun, na ba ku tere ye, &lt;&lt;Kutɔ kang yet kufɛ́ kaba adakunom, da kufɛ́ anet awe awo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ni izen izining, nek aHiridus rawu dang nɔɔk Adakunom iratek, atomaza aTisa wat a ku tɛmɛng sak aben, itsusuk ku ya, a ku.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ngma na anɔng, ifɛ̀ Adakunom ya kashon ni i di barasa ni ifush.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba aBarnabas nɛ aShawulu gang ikyɛng fi i tse ni iba, ba tɛ ba won aRushelima, ba sok aYohana, fɛ́ ba ku yes aMarkus gung ni iba.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Ba tom aBarnabas nɛ aShawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Itusung bafi ikuus na Antakiya i bɛ̀ batan fɛ́ ba yet bafi itees: aBarnabas nɛ aSimiyɔn, ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes aNiga, nɛ aLushiyos, ayɔng fɛ́ a ne na aSirin, nɛ aManayen, ayɔng fɛ́ a rasak gung ne agwɔm aHiridus, nɛ aShawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ba kin se ni ira awon ni itekap anu sak na aTisa, wat Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Di tun yin ba aBarnabas nɛ aShawulu zɛɛt nek kutomong fi in mi ka ba yes ba di ra ne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Ama fɛ́ ba ya kashon na awon ni itekap anu me, ba di saas mbɔk naton ba aBarnabas nɛ aShawulu, ba di te itek ni ba, ba ka ba te ni irèn.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABarnabas nɛ aShawulu ni izek aSayipurus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Ba aBarnabas nɛ aShawulu, ama fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ mi ka ba tom, ba tseng sak na aSalushiya, ama fɛ́ ba won azɔng, ba nɔ ni kukyɛ ashi sak i bɛ́ na aSayipurus. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta ne aSalamis, ba shara ifɛ̀ Adakunom narɔ inyis baYahuda. AYohana aMarkus se ni i ka ba sɛs mo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi teng ba kat kaakyɛ ni izek e, ba tse ba ta ni wɔp aPafos, ba nyim na anet aYahuda akak fɛ́ a ras kubok, ba ku yes ye aBar aJoshuwa, atan mbɔɔs. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />A yet anet fɛ́ a di sɛs agwɔmna kabak mben e yɔng, iyerek wu yet aSarjiyus aBulus. Agwɔmna me yet atsitsɛng anet. Agwɔmna me sak na ba ku yes aBarnabas nɛ aShawulu nek a shim a fok ifɛ̀ Adakunom na anu bá. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Awɛt aLimas, anet kubok e (nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ba ku yes mo ni icɛn aGirik), a ka ba tɛnɛng, kɔng ba bi tirik nhwyɛ agwɔmna me na a shan atsak. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Awɛt aShawulu, ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes aBulus, ayɛt ishining na Kabik aJɛrɛ, a di sak ayisi gbit na aLimas, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn arim aShetan, afi imaan e ni ikyɛng itek! Wɔn mbɔɔs nanu ngɔn ne anyas kyɛk, ngɔn bi won ibeseng irén itek ifɛ́ Adakunom awɛ? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Kubɔk Adakunom se ni ifa ni ngɔn yɔkɔnɔng ana, i da sot akpatɔn, i da sok izen dang ni i ti i di mgbey kunom.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Ni izen izining, aming nɛ kurin kukak makiyi wat a fam ayisi wu, a kpa teng a wat mbɔk na tsɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a da ku tonong irèn.<verse eid="ACT 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Fɛ́ agwɔmna me di ikyɛng fi ite, a ku te yɔɔt, a shan atsak nek itees ifɛ̀ aTisa. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul's First Journey" file="cen Paul-1_B&amp;W.jpg" size="span" loc="ACT 13:14--14:28" copy="SIL" ref="13:4--14:28">Kutseet ishara ifɛ́ itek aBulus kufi imɛsɛng</figure><verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus nɛ aBarnabas na Antakiya afɛ́ aPisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Wat aBulus nɛ bafidang itomong wu, ba won aPafos ba nɔ ni kukyɛ ashi sak na aPaga afi mben aPamfiliya. AYohana aMarkus, ka ba won a tɛ a bun sak na aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Awɛt iba won aPaga, ba ya kashon ni kutseet sak na Antakiya afɛ́ aPisidiya. Atuk aSabat, ba tse ba nɔ narɔ inyis baYahuda, ba tse ba sonong. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ama fɛ́ ba fa kufumung ntsi aMusa ni ijɛk batan, akɔk-ashon karɔ inyis baYahuda me fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, ki i bɛ̀ yin kucɛɛt fi ku di ki barang banet ite nyɛk, ni fɛrɛng yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Wat aBulus dorok tsik, a waram mbɔk naton nɔng na ba te yuu, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, banet aIsrela, ni ishɛrɛp bafi Ícɛn-iduk fɛ́ ba foos inyim Adakunom, wes yin ato yin ni imi! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Adakunom banet aIsrela kin myak badakop yit neme, a ka ba sak ba sot izit iratek na ba tsin rēn resek na aMasat, a da ne a ka ba tun ni kukyem kuratek. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />A sok akabɔk ni nggɔn bá ayɛ nsɔk nnaas natse. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta ni mben aKanan, a ya icɛ́n kanakataat ni itsom, a ka ba nɔk mo mben e ni in sot nfuba. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Nkyɔrɔk e ngma kin sok ayɛ anakat anaas ina nsɔk ntoon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">&lt;&lt;Ama anɔng, Adakunom myak banet fɛ́ ba da sot bakɔk-ashon bá, nkum izen e yɔng sak izen atan aSamela. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ni izen e yɔng, banet e tsɛt fok ye na ba ka ba nɔk agwɔm, nek anɔng, a ka ba nɔk aShawulu arim aKish, afi izɔrɔk aBanyami, a ya igwɔm naton ba ayɛ nsɔk nnaas. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ama fɛ́ a mi tun aShawulu, Adakunom di te aDauda na a sot agwɔm bá. Adakunom fɛ̀ ane naton wu: &lt;I mi sɛ aDauda, arim aJesi, anet fi imi di te iyɛ makiyi; a da nye ngma ikyɛng fi imi shim.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />&lt;&lt;A yet ni izɔrɔk aDauda ye fɛ́ Adakunom kin di bɛ́ na Anet-Isheshek sak na bafi aIsrela, fɛ́ a yet aYeso, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ a kin di shiwu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Na aYeso mo dang bɛ́, aYohana shara ngma bafi aIsrela ye, na ba tirik na ba won anɛn bá, nɔng ba bin ka ba ra abatisma.<verse eid="ACT 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />&lt;&lt;Fɛ́ aYohana se ni igang kutomong wu, a fɛ̀, &lt;Iyin di yin imi yet angan ɛ? Imi yet ayɔng e awo. Awey, ayɔng e bi bɛ́ ama hom, imi kyem ni in bisik iwe ikpatak wu awo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, iyin fi i ne yin ni izɔrɔk aIbrahim, ni iyin Ícɛn-iduk fi ifos yin nnyim Adakunom, i yet nek iyit ba fɛ̀ Adakunom di tom ni ifɛ̀ isheshek deng. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Nek banet fɛ́ ba se ni aRushelima nɛ bágwɔm bá, ba kyem ba rēn kuri anet fɛ́ ayet aYeso awo, ko ba kyem ba rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ batan kin jɛk fɛ́ ba ka ba fa ne kaakyi kunom aSabat awo. Nek anɔng, ba di shining ifɛ̀ batan ba ku tsɛɛt mo ishɔt iku. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ngma na avit inɛn fɛ́ ba sɛ ni wu fɛ́ ba da ku fɛt mo, ngma na anɔng, ba ra awon na aBilatus na a te ba ku fɛt. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi shining ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ba jɛk naton wu, ba ma ku tik ni kum, ba tse ba ku nɛt ni isɔs ita. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Awɛt Adakunom ku donong ni iku, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />aYeso sok nkɔs gaan na tonoso ice wu sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin ne gung ni iwu na aGalili sak ibɛ ni aRushelima, fɛ́ ba yet bafi anu ifɛ̀ wu sak na banet.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Iyit tsin ki shara yin ifɛ̀ itek deng bà, ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom man rosom na badakop yit, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />a mi ki shining yit ide, iyit fi in yet yit nnon bá, nek idonong aYeso ni iku. Kyɔn tɛ ba kin di jɛk na Abom afɛ́ faa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">&lt;Ngɔn yet Arim hom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Atut imi mi sot aDa ngɔn.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Abom 2:7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Adakunom mi ku donong ni iku, a da tɛ a bush awo, a kin cɛɛt ane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;In bi ki nɔk yin kunang ajɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">atutup awɛng fi in kin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">rosom na aDauda.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Nek anɔng, a kin tɛ a fɛ̀</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:35">na Abom akak ye:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:35">&lt;Ngɔn da won aJɛrɛ ngɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:35">na a bush awo.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Abom 2:7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />&lt;&lt;Nek ni izen fɛ́ aDauda kin se ni kutset, a kin nye ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim, ama anɔng, a ku, ba ku nɛt na arɛk badakop wu, a bush azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom ku donong ni iku me, a kin bush awo.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, ábaruneng, in shim ni i rēn ane: ba kin ki shara yin ifuut anɛn yin ni iyerek aYeso Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni iwu, a mi hwyet na kaakyi ikyɛng fi ntsi aMusa da kyem i ku nɔk awo. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Tot yin ace yin kɔng ikyɛng dɔng fɛ́ batan kin jɛk bi shining na ace yin:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />&lt;Fok yin, bafɛ́ a bush icɛɛt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Won akpɔrɔk ki yisik yin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">kus yin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">nek imi da nye ikikak ni izen yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">idɔng fi i da kyem i nɔk yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">atsak ni ide awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ka akak fɛ́ a ki tak yin.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">AHabakuk 1:5</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas se iwuruk narɔ inyis baYahuda me, banet e ka ba tsot akabɔk fok, na ba bɛ́ atuk aSabat ashon, ba bin ban cɛɛt ni iba naton ikyɛng e dɔng. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ama fɛ́ banet e mi ka na ikaas, baYahuda dot nɛ bakak fɛ́ ba yet Ícɛn-iduk fɛ́ ba kuus nggɔn baYahuda, ba di kuus ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas. Ba aBulus e, fɛ̀ ni iba ye, na ba ya kashon ayɛt itek fɛ́ Adakunom mi ka ba nɔɔk.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Fɛ́ aSabat nye, banet iwɔp e kusum ka na tusung nɔng ba da fok ifɛ̀ aTisa. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ni izen fɛ́ baYahuda di kudyɛng banet, naman ka ba yit makiyi, ba kpa cɛɛt gadiring naton ikyɛng fɛ́ aBulus se ni icɛɛt e, na ba ku korok itok makiyi.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Awɛt aBulus nɛ aBarnabas, fɛrɛng ni iba na agap iyɛ ye, &lt;&lt;I se gbing-gbing ni iyit tun ki shara yin ifɛ̀ Adakunom ninyɛn. Yɔkɔnɔng fi iyin mi rayin iko, i mi tonong yin fok iyin kyem yin fi i da sɛ yin kutset vit igang e awo. Nek anɔng, iyit yɔng in tirik yit sak ni Ícɛn-iduk. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Nek ikyɛng de fɛ́ aTisa kin fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">&lt;Imi mi ki sak yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ni sot yin mgbey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">sak ni Ícɛn-iduk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">nɔng i da bɛ́ yin ni isheshek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">sak na banet azatse kusum.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">AIshaya 49:6</ref></char>. </note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ni izen fi Ícɛn-iduk fok anɔng, ba nye iyɛ ikan makiyi, ba tere ifɛ̀ aTisa; ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi myak nek kutset vit igang shan atsak.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ifɛ̀ aTisa nɔɔs kaakyɛ ni mben e. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Awɛt baYahuda di te banyining fɛ́ ba foos nnyim Adakunom, bayɔng fɛ́ ba foos ni iba, nɛ bamatek iwɔp e fɛ́ ba fɛrɛng na banet fok. Ba di te banet na ba dorok nhwyɛ nɛ ba ka ba nɔɔk mgbang, ba sak banet ro aBulus nɛ aBarnabas ni mben e. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Nek anɔng, iba ka ba waat ntong akpatak bá<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iwaat akpatak na baYahuda itonong fok, Adakunom mi rawu baYahuda fɛ́ ba raba ishan ifɛ̀ aTisa aYeso, nek anɔng a da ka ba tabak. Nek aYeso tees bafi imɛɛs wu na ba nye nɔng, ngma izen fɛ́ ba raba ifok ifɛ̀ bá, ngma ni ba. Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 6:11">AMarkus 6:11</ref></char>.</note>, naton ba, ba tseng sak ni aIkoniyum. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Bafi ikuus e ka na shining ni iyɛ ikan nɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas ni wɔp aIkoniyum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Fɛ́ ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas tse ba ta na aIkoniyum, ba tse ba nɔ narɔ inyis baYahuda. Ba shara ifɛ̀ azɔng e me ni irèn fɛ́ banet hwyɛt di nɔɔk atsak, baYahuda nɛ bafi ilem aGirik. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Awɛt baYahuda yɔng fɛ́ ba raba dang nɔɔk atsak, ba di te Ícɛn-iduk idorok nhwyɛ, ba di tes nadɔm na ayɛ bá nɔng imaan e bin se nate bafi ikuus e ni iba. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Wat ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas ban nye nkɔs gaan azɔng, ba woso ishara ifɛ̀ aTisa ni iyɛ izining. ATisa run kama kutomong bá ni itek fi i sak ba ras ibes ni nkyɔrɔk ajingjing. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Kuhwyɛ banet iwɔp e, kana ikaas; bakak run kama baYahuda, ne bakak run kama batom aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Bafi Ícɛn-iduk e, nɛ baYahuda tse ba moon kutɔ gung ne bakɔk-ashon bá, nɔng ba da bin nesek ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas mgbang, ba da ka ba woro ne ata. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Fɛ́ batom e fok ikyɛng fi i tsin tseng, ba teng sak ni nwɔp aLikoniya, na aListira ne aDerbe, ni nwɔp in bakat, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />ba ya kashon ni ishara ifɛ̀ itek e azɔng.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas na aListira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Azɔng na aListira, ba sɛ anet akak, fɛ́ a yet amerek e, neme ni tes wu, atak yɔng merek anɔng, a kin man mara kutseet awo. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Anet e di sak kuto ni ishara ifɛ̀ fɛ́ aBulus se ne. ABulus di sak ayisi gbit na anet e, a di fok anet e bɛ̀ inɔɔk atsak fɛ́ ba da kyem ba ku te mo kyang, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />aBulus ta kutɔ gbɛrɛy ye, &lt;&lt;Dorok tsik na atak ngɔn!&gt;&gt; Ni ifok anɔng, anet e furuk lot, a kpa shesh.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ni izen fi kudyɛng banet e di ikyɛng fɛ́ aBulus nye, ba ta nkun ni icɛn bá ifɛ́ aLikoniya, &lt;&lt;Nabannom mi tik nate yit ni nrɔm banet awe atut!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Ba te aBarnabas iyerek aZayus, na ba te aBulus iyerek aHarmis nek iwu wu a kin yet anet icɛɛt. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Wat àware atsi aZayus, fi kutu atsi wu se bakat azɔng ama iwɔp e, a tse a ne na amung ashoy, a te tsik wu atisi iwɔp. Àware atsi me nɛ banet iwɔp e, tsɛt ba inabak nabak-akuce bá sak na ba aBulus.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba aBarnabas nɛ aBulus, batom aYeso rēn anɔng, ba sarák ares irɔm bá, ba nɔ nate banet ni i tsi ni nkun, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Ka! Ábaruneng, akyɛ sak fi i nye yin anɔng ɛ? Iyit yet yit banet inam na nasok nagbɔng ti yin. Iyit tsin ki shara yin ifɛ̀ itek ye, ni i wosong yin ntomong abap nang sak na Adakunom atset, ayɔng fɛ́ a nye kazanɛn, nɛ kazatse, ni izek, ngma ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛɛt na. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />A kin se ayame, Adakunom wosong banet ne ba nye ikyɛng fɛ́ ba shim. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ngma na anɔng, a ki mang won banet vit ikyɛng idi awo: A ki tonoso yin itek wu ni iza fi ines azanɛn, a saas nayak akɔ yin nyes ni izen ye; a ki nesek yin ihwya, na ki shinishi yin ni iyɛ ikan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Ngma kucɛɛt fɛ́ ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas nye, a ka ba se gbang na ba ro na banet e inabak nabak-akuce e sak ni ba.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Wat baYahuda bakak tse ba ne na Antakiya nɛ aIkoniyum, ba bɛ́ ba sɔ nafa banet e, ba woro aBulus na ata, ba ku kɔk sak ama iwɔp, ba yes fok a mi ku. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ama fɛ́ bafi ikuus ku te nate, a dorok tsik, a tɛ bun sak ayit iwɔp e. Akatson, iwu na aBarnabas won kuwɔp e sak na aDerbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tɛ ba bun sak na Antakiya afɛ́ aSiriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ba tse ba shara ifɛ̀ itek ni wɔp e yɔng, ba sɛ bafi ikuus dot. Ba tseng sak na aListira nɛ aIkoniyum nɛ Antakiya, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />ba ban gbingding bafi ikuus, ba ka ba barang mo agap ye na ba ya kashon iyit inɔɔk atsak. Ba fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;I se gbing-gbing ni in nyiis yit ni mgbang in da ni nɔ yit ari igwɔm Adakunom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />ABulus nɛ aBarnabas, di saas bashɔn na kaakyɛ karɔ inyis bafi ikuus, ayɛt awon ni itekap anu, ba ka ba nabak sak na aTisa, ayɔng fi iba di te iyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ama fɛ́ ba got ni mben aPisidiya ni mben aPamfiliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />ba tse ba shara ifɛ̀ me ni wɔp aPaga, ba da ne ba tisik sak ni wɔp Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Izen fɛ́ ba won Ataliya, ba wɔk ayɛt kukyɛ ashi sak na Antakiya, narɔ fɛ́ ba di te itek Adakunom ayɛt kutomong fɛ́ ba mi gang. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta azɔng, ba tusung bafi ikuus narɔ kazining, ba kpa ka ba taas ngma kutomong fɛ́ Adakunom ra ni iba, ne irèn fɛ́ Adakunom mi tarak katitu fi Ícɛn-iduk di shashan atsak. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Ba sot azɔng na bafi ikuus e sak izen gyet awo.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Kusonong azumung itusung <optbreak /> bashɔn ikuus na aRushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Banet bakak ne na aJudiya, ba bɛ́ ba kpa tees bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na Antakiya ye fok, &lt;&lt;I se gbing-gbing ba ki ya yin katse, kpaf ti nggɔn fɛ́ aMusa tees banet e, ke da anɔng awo, vit iyin ni i sɛ isheshek.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Ikyɛng e dɔng bɛ́ ne nanan gyet awo nate banet e nɛ ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas. Nek anɔng, ba kasa ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas nɛ bafi ikuus bakak, ba ka ba sak na ba ngarak sak na aRushelima, na ba tse ba di batom aYeso nɛ bashɔn nɔng ba bin fok ice icɛɛt e. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Itusung bafi ikuus e, ka ba te ni irèn. Wat fɛ́ ba se ni kutseet, ba got ni mben aFinikiya nɛ aSamariya, na ba teng ba taas bafi nwɔp e fok, bafi Ícɛn-iduk mi sot bafi ikuus bà. Ikyɛng e nɔɔk ngma bafi ikuus iyɛ ikan makiyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta na aRushelima, itusung bafi ikuus e nɛ batom aYeso nɛ bashɔn ka ba shan ni mbɔk nfaa. Wat ba aBulus kpa ka ba taas ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom ra ni mbɔk bá.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Awɛt bakak ayɛt bafi ikuus e yɔng fɛ́ ba moon ice na BaFarasi, ba dorok tsik, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;I se gbing-gbing Ícɛn-iduk na ba ka ba ya katse, na ba ka ba te na ba nye ikyɛng fi itees ntsi aMusa fɛ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Batom aYeso nɛ bashɔn bafi ikuus nyim, nɔng ba bin tɔrɔng naton ifɛ̀ me deng. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi tɔrɔng ifɛ̀ me tsik-tsik, aBitrus dorok tsik, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, iyin rēn yin ni nkɔs ama, Adakunom kin di kasa ayɛt yin, fok ni in sot ayɔng fi Ícɛn-iduk da fok ifɛ̀ itek na nu hom, nɔng ba di shan atsak. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Adakunom fɛ́ a rēn kuyiring akaangan, a tonong ishan ba ne Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ́ a ka ba nɔk, kpaf tɛ fɛ́ a kin ki nɔɔk yit mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Vit ishim ice fɛ́ Adakunom tonong nate yit ni iba, nek iwu mi sak ayɛ bá sot cɛ́l nek inɔɔk atsak bá. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nek anɔng, akyɛ sak fi iyin shim imara yin Adakunom, ni tes yin bafi imɛɛs bang kunanang fi da iyit ke badakop yit kyem ba ceshek awo yɛ? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Awɛt iyit bɛ̀ yit inɔɔk atsak fok, a yet nek itek fi i ne na aTisa yit aYeso wu fi in di sɛ yit isheshek, kpaf ti iba di sɛ bà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ngma banet azumung e di wey yuu ni izen fɛ́ ba aBarnabas nɛ aBulus se ni itaas ntomong abes ni nkyɔrɔk ajingjing fɛ́ Adakunom nye ni bɔk ba nate Ícɛn-iduk. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ama fɛ́ ba gang kucɛɛt e, aYakubu fɛrɛng ye, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, wes yin ato ni imi. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />ASiman Bitrus tsin mɛsɛng ki tonong yit kuri irèn fɛ́ Adakunom kin tung di tonong ishim wu sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, na anɔng wu fɛ́ a di sɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi iyerek wu ayɛt ba. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ifɛ̀ me deng tseng kpaf ni ifɛ̀ fɛ́ atan kin jɛk ye,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />&lt;Ama anɔng, in bi ti in bun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">in bin nok kubut aDauda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">yɔng fi ku kin kpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">In bi ti in nok abát e yɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">na a bun gyat,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />in bi nye anɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">nɔng ishɛrɛp banet e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">bin di tsɛt aTisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">na anɔng wu fi in di ki sɛ bayɔng fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">ba bi iyerek hom ayɛt Ícɛn-iduk,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />aTisa fɛ̀, bayɔng fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:18">ba ras nkyɔrɔk nang fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:18">ba mi rēn ina gbang-gbang yame.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, imi nyeseng naton, da iyit bi te yit kunanang naton Ícɛn-iduk fi i tsin tiri sak ishan Adakunom awo. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Awɛt, won in ka ba jɛk yit kufumung, ni in fɛ̀ yit ni iba, da na ba ya nayak fɛ́ ba mi beseng ina ni nabak sak na nabannom awo, da ba bi ra kubi awo, da ba bi ya ikyɛng fɛ́ ba firik kutɔ me awo, da ba bi ya nasok awo. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Nek neme na ayɛ ama bafi ishara ijɛk aMusa na kaakyi iwɔp di se, nek ba fa iye na narɔ inyiis baYahuda kaakyɛ aSabat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumung fɛ́ kazumung tom e sak na bafi ikuus Ícɛn-iduk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ama anɔng, batom aYeso nɛ bashɔn e ni itusung bafi ikuus ngma kusum, ba kasa bakak ayɛt banet bá, ba ka ba tom sak na Antakiya gung na aBulus nɛ aBarnabas. Ba kasa aJudas (fɛ́ ba ku yes aBarsabas), nɛ aSilas, banet bafaa me yet bakɔk-ashon bafi ikuus. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Ba ka ba yirik ni kufumung fɛ́ ba di jɛk ane:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Kufumung e kang ne na baruneng yin, iyit batom aYeso nɛ bashɔn bafi ikuus.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Sak ni yin ábaruneng,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">bafi Ícɛn-iduk fi ikuus yin aYeso fi i se yin na Antakiya, nɛ aSiriya, nɛ aKilikiya.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">In ki te show yin.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />In mi fok yit fok bakak ne azeng narɔ yit, ba bɛ́ ba te kudaam azɔng nate yin ni in ncɛɛt bá, ba ki te yin kudaam na ayɛ. Da iyit ba fi in ka ba tom yit na ba nye anɔng awo. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Nek anɔng, ama fi in mi tɔrɔng yit, in di yit i se gyat ni in kasa yit banet, fi in da ka ba tom yit azɔng ni yin gung na bacɛk iyɛ yit, ba aBarnabas nɛ aBulus, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />banet fɛ́ ba mi nɔɔk nwaa kutset bá nek kutomong aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Nek anɔng wu fi in di tun yit ba aJudas nɛ aSilas, ba ki tak yin ne kanu bá ikyɛng fi in jɛk yit. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Nek i se na Kabik aJɛrɛ ni yit gyat da in ki barang yin mo kunanang fi ku wat nkyɔrɔk nà awo: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />I bi ya yin ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi nabak-akuce sak na nabannom e awo, da i bi ya yin nasok awo, i bi ya yin ikyɛng fɛ́ ba firik kutɔ me awo, da ba bi ra kubi awo. Ki iyin bereng yin ace yin ni nkyɔrɔk nang, i nye yin yɛɛt.</para>
  <para style="pmc" vid="ACT 15:29">Sot yin kyang.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Wat ama fɛ́ ba mi ka ba te ni irèn, ba yit irèn sak na Antakiya, ama fɛ́ ba mi tusung bafi ikuus e, ba ka ba nɔk kufumung e. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi ikuus e fa kufumung e, ba nye iyɛ ikan nek agap fi ku ka ba barang mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Wat ba aJudas nɛ aSilas, fɛ́ ba yet batan, ba bang ka ba barang mo agap ni inɔɔk atsak bá ni kucɛɛt fɛ́ ba nye barunyining e. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ama izen fɛ́ ba nye azɔng, bafi ikuus e ka ba te ni irèn, na ba tse ba tik kyang. Ba bun sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba tom e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni mbɔk bɛ̀ ibyat ifɛ́ </char><char style="fv">34</char> ane: <char style="fqa">Awɛt aSilas i se yɛɛt na a bang sot azɔng.</char> Ban di yin: <char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amos 9:11-12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Awɛt ba aBulus nɛ aBarnabas di wey na Antakiya, iba nɛ bakak gaan ya kashon ni itees ni ishara ifɛ̀ aTisa.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus nɛ aBarnabas ka na kam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ama nnom nkak, aBulus fɛ̀ ne aBarnabas, &lt;&lt;Won in ti in bun yit, in tsin te gang yit baruneng ni nwɔp yɔng fi in kin di shara yit ifɛ̀ aTisa, in di yit iya kashon bá.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />ABarnabas shim ke aYohana fɛ́ ku yes aMarkus tseng gung ni iba. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Awɛt aBulus run kama na ba tseng na anet fɛ́ a kin teng a ka ba won na aPamfiliya, na nu kutomong awo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ba kpa nanan makiyi, nek anɔng, ba ka na kam. ABarnabas sok aMarkus gung ni iwu ba nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi sak na aSayipurus, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />awɛt aBulus a sok aSilas ba yit irèn ama fɛ́ bafi ikuus mi di te acicɛ aTisa ni ba. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ba aBulus e got ni mben aSiriya nɛ aKilikiya, ba teng na ba di barasa itusung bafi ikuus agap.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">ATimoti di kuus ba aBulus nɛ aSilas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />ABulus tse a ta ne aDerbe nɛ aListira. Afi ikuus akak kin se azɔng fi ba ku yes aTimoti, nggon angas baYahuda akak fɛ́ a kin yet afi ikuus, atek kun yet afɛ́ aGirik. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Ngma bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aListira nɛ aIkoniyum nyes kucɛɛt kutek natoon wu. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />ABulus kin shim aTimoti na tseng gung ni wu, nek anɔng, a ku ya katse, nek baYahuda fɛ́ ba se na narɔ me yɔng, nek ngma ba ba rēn fok ada wu yet afɛ́ aGirik. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba teng ba kat ni nwɔp zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, ba ka ba nesek ikyɛng fɛ́ batom-aYeso nɛ bashɔn ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aRushelima fɛ́ na ba ras. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nek anɔng, itusung bafi ikuus e bang sɛ agap abik, kudot ba di barasa nninom.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul's 2nd Journey" file="cen Paul-2_B&amp;W.jpg" size="span" loc="ACT 15:36--18:22" ref="15:36--18:22">Kutseet ishara ifɛ́ itek aBulus kufɛ afaa</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus di anet aMasedoniya ne nabos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Wat ba teng ba kat ni mben aFirijiya nɛ aGalati, nek Kabik aJɛrɛ mi ka ba ro mo ishara ifɛ̀ ni mben Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba mi tse ba ta ni mben aMeshia, ba tsɛt ba nɔ ni mben aBitiniya, awɛt Kabik aYeso ka ba ro mo inɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Nek anɔng, ba got ni fam aMeshia ba tisik sak ni wɔp aTorowas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Wat ba tonong aBulus e na nabos abik natuk, a di anet aMasedoniya ni nyeseng, na tsot akabɔk ni wu ye, &lt;&lt;Bɛ sak azeng na aMasedoniya, bɛ́ ki sɛ yit mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Nkum fɛ́ ba tarak ayisi aBulus e, in kpa tsɛt yit irèn sak na aMasedoniya, in mi sok yit na ayɛ yit fok Adakunom shim ni in tsin shara yit ifɛ̀ wu sak ni ba.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itirik aLidiya sak ni ikuus aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />In won yit aTorowas, in kpa wɔk yit ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, in di berem yit tabat sak na aSamutares, akatson e in tsin ta yit na aNiyapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />In won yit azɔng sak na aFilipi, agbat iwɔp na aMasedoniya fɛ́ banet iwɔp e yet bafɛ́ aRoma. In nye yit nkɔs nkak azɔng.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Atuk aSabat, in wuruk yit atisi iwɔp e sak ni ifam ikyɛk, in yes yit fok gyan in sɛ yit karɔ awon. In sonong yit, in kpa cɛɛt yit ne banyining fɛ́ ba kana tusung azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Azining ayɛt banyining fɛ́ ba ki fok yit e kin yet aLidiya, fɛ́ a ne ni wɔp aTayatira. A yet anet irɛɛs ares agyigyɛl, anet ikuus Adakunom. ATisa tarak iyɛ wu nɔng a di te nhwyɛ ni ifɛ̀ fɛ́ aBulus se ni icɛɛt e. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba ku ra abatisma ni ishɛrɛp bafɛ́ ari wu, a fɛ̀ ni iyit, &lt;&lt;Ki iyin mi di sok yin tɛ afi ikuus aTisa, bɛ da sonong yin ari hom.&gt;&gt; A di ban ni yit.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba te aBulus nɛ aSilas ari inyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Atuk akak, in kin se yit ni itseng sak narɔ awon, in wat in nyim yit ne kanamang kakak kasam e fɛ́ ka bɛ̀ kabik kubok iyɛrɛ, na anɔng, batèk ka di sɛs ijik makiyi nek kubok fɛ́ ka ras. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ka di kuus aBulus nɛ bakak yit, na ka tang kukun ye, &lt;&lt;Banet bang yet basam Adakunom Azɔk-Bazɔk, fɛ́ ba tsin ki shara yin ifɛ̀ irèn isɛ isheshek.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ka woso i di ban anɔng, nnom dot. Izen fi ikyɛng e tsi ibeseng aBulus iyɛ makiyi, a tirik, a fɛ̀ ne kabik e, &lt;&lt;Imi fɛ̀ ni ngɔn ayit iyerek aYeso Kristi, wuruk ayɛt ka.&gt;&gt; Ka wat ka wuruk ayit izen e yɔng.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Awɛt izen fɛ́ batèk ka di fok irèn isɛs ijik ba mi tseng, ba tekap aBulus nɛ aSilas, ba kpa ka ba kɔk sak ashon batek azumung narɔ ijik. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta ashon batek azumung e, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Banet bang yet baYahuda, ba doro nhwyɛ iwɔp yit gyet awo. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Ba ki tees yit nggɔn fi da in se gyat iyit bafɛ́ aRoma ni in ra yit awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Kudyɛng banet e ka ba sɛ mo idoro fulul naton ba, batek azumung e, ama fɛ́ ba mi ka ba sarak ares, ba sak na ba ka ba tsot ni íshɛn. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi ka ba nye aduk itsot, ba ka ba barak ari inyang, ba kɔrɔk anet itosok kari inyang e kuto fok, da a won na ba hwyet awo. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Wat iwu nek ishan ifɛ̀ kuri idɔng, a ka ba sok a barak nitu kufɛ́ ayɛt e, a rosom atak bá ni kum.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Abak katite atuk, aBulus nɛ aSilas se ni ira awon nɛ abom sak na Adakunom, ishɛrɛp bafi inyang e se ni i ka ba foos, <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />ni izen izining mben kpa zuut, fi in sak itis kari inyang e kpa to. Izen izining natitu ari inyang e wat na tarak, anyang akaangan wat a ibis na. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Ni izen fɛ́ anet itosok kari inyang e shemeng, a di natitu piyot, a kɔrɔk awal wu, nɔng a di ki fɛt ice wu, a yes gyan bafi inyang e mi hwyesek. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Awɛt aBulus ta kutɔ a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;I bi man ice ngɔn awo! Iyit bang mo azeng ngma yit!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Anet itosok kari inyang e sak na ba ku bɛ́ ni kurong, a di berem ayɛt e, ni itiim irɔm ni nnyim, a kpa ashon aBulus nɛ aSilas. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ama anɔng, a ka ba tun amatse, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Bátisa, akyɛ fi in da nye, nɔng in di ki sɛ isheshek ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Shan atsak ne aTisa aYeso, i da sɛ isheshek, ngɔn nɛ kasa ngɔn kusum.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ama anɔng, ba ku taas ifɛ̀ aTisa ni ishɛrɛp banet fɛ́ ba kin se azɔng ari wu. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ayɛt atuk e, a ka ba sok, a ka ba kusu nfot e, ba wat ba ku ra abatisma iwu nɛ bafɛ́ ari wu ngma kusum. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Ama anɔng, a ka ba sok sak ari wu, a ka ba nɔk nayak. Iwu nɛ bafɛ́ ari wu ngma kusum ba nye iyɛ ikan nek iwu mi nɔɔk atsak ne Adakunom.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Awɛt fɛ́ kadiding nye, batek azumung e tom nnon-íshɛn, ye, &lt;&lt;Tsi fɛ̀ yin na ba won banet e na ba tsɛng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Anet itosok kari inyang e tak aBulus itom e, ye, &lt;&lt;Batek azumung e mi te itom fok na ba ki won yin ni i tsɛng yin. Nek anɔng, wuruk yin, da tsɛng yin kyang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Awɛt aBulus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ba mi ki tsot yit na yisi banet, dang ba ki tak yit inɛn yit, ngma ni kusot yit tɛ nnon mben aRoma, ba mi ki barak yit ari inyang. Wat yɔkɔnɔng ba shim ba ki tun yit ni nɛt ɛ? Awey yo! Won na ba bɛ́ ba ki tun yit ice bá.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Nnon-íshɛn e tɛ na bun ni ifɛ̀ me sak na batek azumung e, wat nnyim ka ba yit fɛ́ ba fok fok ba yet nnon mben aRoma. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Nek anɔng, ba bɛ́ ba tsot akabɔk ni ba. Ama fɛ́ ba mi ka ba tun, ba fɛ̀ ni iba na ba won kuwɔp e. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ama fɛ́ ba wuruk ari inyang e, ba tse ari aLidiya, ama fɛ́ ba nyim ne bafi ikuus, ba te bafi ikuus e agap iyɛ, ba da ne ba tseng.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Ba aBulus tse ba ta na aTesaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi got ni nwɔp Amfipolis nɛ Apoloniya, ba tse ba nɔ na aTesaloni. Karɔ inyis baYahuda se ni wɔp e yɔng. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ti nggɔn aBulus di se, a tse a nɔ narɔ ba ite kataat atuk aSabat, a te nhwyɛ ni iba naton ifɛ̀ Adakunom, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />na ka ba tonoso, ne nye fok i se gbing-gbing Anet-Isheshek me na a sɔ mgbang, na te na dorok ni iku. A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;AYeso me yong fi in tsin di shara naton e, iwu wu a yet Anet-Isheshek me.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Bakak ayɛt ba shan ifɛ̀ me, ba bun abak ba aBulus nɛ aSilas nɛ banet aGirik dot fɛ́ foos nnyim Adakunom, dot ayɛt banyining yet agbat banet.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Awɛt baYahuda kpa nye fulul, ba tse ba kok nnon iwung iwɔp e, ba te kudyɛng, ba dorok ni nhwyɛ ni wɔp e, ba tse ba di tik nasa aJasɔn, fok na ba ka ba tun ba aBulus amatse ni kudyɛng banet. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Awɛt nek ba kyem ba ka ba sɛ awo, ba kpa kɔk aJasɔn ni ishɛrɛp bafi ikuus e sak ashon bafi igwɔm iwɔp e, na ba tang nkun, ye, &lt;&lt;Banet yɔng fɛ́ ba tiri kazatse cirirang mi bɛ́ ba ta azeng bà, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />awɛt aJasɔn ka ba shan tɛ batsen wu, ngma ba ba raba inye ntsi ada mben aKaisar, na ba nye fok agwɔm akak di se fɛ́ ba ku yes aYeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Izen fɛ́ banet iwɔp e nɛ bafi igwɔm e fok anɔng, nhwyɛ ba dorok. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi shan itsɔm ishan kubɔk na aJasɔn ni ishɛrɛp e, ba da ne ba ka ba won ba tseng.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba aBulus tse ba ta na aBeriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Bafi ikuus e wat ba tun ba aBulus nɛ aSilas natuk, ba ka ba te ni irèn sak na aBeriya, ni izen fɛ́ ba tse ba ta azɔng, ba tse ba nɔ narɔ inyis baYahuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Banet iwɔp aBeriya bi nggɔn ntek aza bafɛ́ aTesaloni. Iba shan ifɛ̀ me ni ngash iyɛ makiyi, ba woso itsɛɛm kufumung Adakunom kaakyi izen, nɔng ba di ki di ke ikyɛng e se anɔng e. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Nek anɔng, banet dot di nɔɔk atsak ayɛt ba, pet ne ágbát banet banyining nɛ báték bafi icɛn aGirik. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Awɛt izen fɛ́ baYahuda fɛ́ ba se na aTesaloni fok fok aBulus se ni ishara ifɛ̀ na aBeriya bà, ba di kuus sak azɔng bà, ba di tes nadɔm na bafidang, na ba doro nhwyɛ kudyɛng banet e. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Bafi ikuus e wat ba te aBulus e ni irèn sak ni izen, awɛt aSilas nɛ aTimoti di wey azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba te aBulus ni irèn, ku tsa sak na Atena, ama fɛ́ ba shan itom ye ba aSilas nɛ aTimoti na ba tse ba ku se ziri ziri, ba won azɔng ziri.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus na Atena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ne aBulus tsin rēn ka ba tot azɔng na Atena, ikyɛng e kudaam fɛ́ a di fi kuwɔp e shining ne nabannom. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Nek anɔng, a woso tse na tɔ ne baYahuda, nɛ bafi nnyim Adakunom ayɛt arɔ inyis baYahuda, nɛ narɔ ijik. Na ma tɔ na bayɔng fɛ́ a ka ba sɛs azɔng kaakyi izen. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Bafi irēn bakak fɛ́ ba ka ba yes ba aEpikuriyan nɛ ba aSitokir, ba kpa cɛɛt ni iwu. Bakak ayɛt ba nye, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ de fɛ́ agwɔm itsot anu yong shim a fɛ̀ yɛ?&gt;&gt; Bakak ayɛt ba fɛ́, &lt;&lt;In di yit tɛ a da yet anet ishara ifɛ̀ azaton nabannom nakak fɛ́ na yet natsɛn ni yit,&gt;&gt; nek a kin se ni ishara ifɛ̀ naton idorok ifaben aYeso.<verse eid="ACT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ba ma tseng gung ni wu sak na azumung bá, fɛ́ ba yes iwu Ariyopagus, ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Iyit shim in rēn yit, akyɛ kuri itees ifas yɔng ngɔn tsin tees banet e yɛ? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Nek itees ngɔn yɔng yet ifas na ato yit. Iyit shim ni ibang ki nɔɔk yit awɛshɛk ni de.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Nek ikyɛng fɛ́ banet Atena nɛ batsen fɛ́ ba se azɔng waat ishim yet, na ba fɛɛs izen naton ifoos itees ifas, nɔng iba bin di sɛ ikyɛng icɛɛt.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Wat aBulus dorok tsik nate banet azumung Ariyopagus e, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Banet Atena, i mi di iyin yet yin banet fɛ́ ba nesek nabannom yin iratek gyet awo. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Nek izen fi in tsin gosok, in tsin yɛrɛ narɔ ntsi zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, in di karɔ ntsi kakak fi i di jɛk yin, &lt;Sak na Adakunom akak fi da iyit rēn yit awo.&gt; Adakunom e yɔng fi iyin ku ya yin ntong, da i ni ku rēn yin awo, iwu fi in tsin cɛɛt naton wu.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Adakunom fɛ́ a nye kazatse nɛ kaakyɛ fi i se ayɛt e, iwu fɛ́ a yet aTisa azanɛn nɛ kazatse, iwu sosok na atu iya ntong fɛ́ ba noos ni mbɔk awo. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ke a tsɛsɛk banet awe ku sɛ mo ikikak awo, vit ikyɛng fɛ́ a tsɛt, nek iwu fɛ́ a nesek banet awe kutset, ni nsong, nɛ kaakyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Na anet azining, a di nye ndiri-ndiri banet, nɔng ba bin shining kazatse, ama fi iwu mi sak akaangan izen, ni nkum ace narɔ isosok bá, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />nɔng ba bin tsɛt Adakunom nyɛn ba wat ba ku bamang, na ba ku sɛ. Atsak e yet Adakunom se yik-yik ne akak yit awo. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Nek, &lt;Iyit se yit ayɛt wu, in di nye nyamang yit, in di sɛs yit kutset.&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Kpaf tɛ bafi ijɛk yin bakak kin di jɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">&lt;Iyit yet yit nnon wu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, ti nnon Adakunom, in se gyat ni in yiring yit tɛ Adakunom se tɛ ata asɛng, kɛ ata akan, kɛ ata awo, in bi di yit tɛ a se ti ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nye ni mbɔk nok, ke kuyiring anet awe awo. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ni izen idun, Adakunom nes akabɔk, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng a mi fɛ̀ banet ngma kusum na ba wosong anɛn bá, ba tirik sak na Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Nek a mi sak kunom fɛ́ a bi di ra kazatse ishɔt ifɛ́ atsak fɛ́ a bi ra ni bɔk anet fi iwu mi myak; ne ane fɛ́ a mi di barang banet ngma agap iyɛ, ni idorok fɛ́ a kudorok ni iku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok ifi idoro bafaben, bakak ba ku mas. Awɛt bakak fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;In bi bang da fok yit naton ifɛ̀ dɔng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Nek anɔng wu, aBulus ka ba won mo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Bakak ayɛt banet e ku kuus mo, ba sot bafi ikuus aYeso. Ayɛt ba yet: aDayonisus ayɔng fɛ́ a se na azumung Ariyopagus, nɛ abining akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aDamaris, nɛ bakak.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">ABulus na aKorinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ama anɔng, aBulus won kuwɔp Atena, a tseng sak na aKorinti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />A tse a sɛ aYahuda akak fɛ́ ba ku yes Akwila, afɛ́ aPɔntus. Akwila nɛ abining wu aPrisila mɛsɛng ne ni mben aItaliya sak ni mben aPɔntus, nek kucɛɛt fɛ́ ada mben aRoma aKalaudiyus kin nye fok kaakyɛ anet aYahuda na a won kayɛt iwɔp aRoma. ABulus tse a di ba Akwila me. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Nek kutomong ibɔk wu yet kuri me kuzining ni iba, a sot gung ni iba ba ra kutomong, kutomong ba yet kufi ibat abut. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kaakye kunom aSabat, aBulus tses na tɔ ni iba, a shim isɔ ice baYahuda nɛ BaGirik.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ni izen fɛ́ aSilas nɛ aTimoti ne na aMasedoniya, aBulus nɔɔk kuhwyɛ wu ni ishara ifɛ̀ Adakunom, na tonoso baYahuda dɛdɛt fok aYeso wu a yet Anet-Isheshek me. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Awɛt fɛ́ ba ya nanan, ni itok fɛ́ ba ku nye ne, a waat kukpin wu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:5">ALuka 9:5</ref></char>.</note> ama fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Nasok yin na na sot na ace yin! Imi mi wusup mbɔk hom. Nkum atut sak ashon, imi da tirik sak ni Ícɛn-iduk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ama anɔng, a won azɔng, a tseng sak ari anet akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aTitiyus aJustus, afi nnyim Adakunom. Kari wu se bakat ne karɔ inyis baYahuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />AKirispus, anet fɛ́ a yet akɔk-ashon karɔ inyis baYahuda me, nɔɔk atsak ne aTisa, gung nɛ banet ari wu. Banet aKorinti dot fɛ́ ba fok ifɛ̀ aBulus, ba shan atsak, ba ka ba ra abatisma.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Ama anɔng, aTisa aYeso fɛ̀ ne aBulus atuk kak na nabos, ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi fok nnyim awo, ya kashon ni kucɛɛt, i bi te yuu awo, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />nek imi se gung ni ngɔn, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da ka ra kɛ a da man, nek in bɛ̀ banet dot ni wɔp kang fɛ́ ba yet banaan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Nek anɔng, a bang sot azɔng iyɛ izining ni ibit, na ka ba tees ifɛ̀ Adakunom.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ni izen e yɔng, na aGaliyo tsin yet agwɔm mben Akaya, baYahuda moon mbɔk naton aBulus, ba tse ni wu na azumung ishɔt, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />ba tse ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Anet yɔng di bang ne banet fok na ba kuus Adakunom ni irèn ikak fi da ntsi fɛ̀ awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Awɛt izen fɛ́ aBulus kpa cɛɛt, aGaliyo fɛ̀ ne baYahuda, &lt;&lt;Ke anet yong fɛ́ a beseng ntsi nkak kɛ a nye ikyɛng ikak imaane ayi, ki in sonong in da fok kukun yin. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Awɛt ayet fi ifɛ̀ me se naton kucɛɛt nɛ ayerek, ni ntsi yin kyɛk, tsi nye yin ifɛ̀ me ikyɛng yin. Imi ramin ifok kukun ti kuyɔng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />A sak ba ka ba tun na azumung ishɔt e. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Awɛt ba di ta mbɔk na aSostenes akɔk-ashon karɔ inyis baYahuda me, ba ku karang itsot azɔng ashon azumung ishɔt e. Awɛt aGaliyo rawu dang te kuhwyɛ wu ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ba se ne.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Ama anɔng, aBulus bang nye nnom gaan azɔng, a da ne te a tɔ na bafi ikuus, a da ne nɔ kukyɛ ashi sak na aSiriya, ba tseng gung nɛ aPrisila nɛ Akwila. Ni iba resek na aKɛnkɛrɛya, aBulus kot ice wu azɔng, nek a mang sok kushi. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ba tse ba ta na Afisa, aBulus won ba aPrisila nɛ Akwila azɔng, iwu tse a nɔ narɔ inyis baYahuda, a tɔ na baYahuda azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu na a bang nye nkɔs gaan azɔng ni iba, iwu rawu a ya kashon ni kutseet. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ni izen fɛ́ a se ni ite a tɔ ni ba, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ke Adakunom shim, in bi ting bun azeng,&gt;&gt; a tɛ a nɔ kukyɛ ashi a won Afisa. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ni izen fɛ́ a tse a ta na aKaisariya, a ngarak, ama fɛ́ a mi te show bafi ikuus, a tɛ bun sak na Antakiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ama fɛ́ a nye nnom nkak azɔng, a won azɔng, a yit irèn nkum kuwɔp kuka sak ni kuya ni mben aGalati ni mben aFirijiya, a teng a di barasa bafi ikuus agap.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolos shara ifɛ̀ na Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ni izen e yɔng, aYahuda akak fɛ́ ba ku yes Apolos, afi iwɔp Alekzandiriya, bɛ ni wɔp Afisa. Ayet anet fɛ́ a rēn kucɛɛt gyet awo, a bi i rēn kufumung Adakunom gyet awo. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Ba kin man ku tees mo naton irèn ikuus aTisa aYeso. Tɛ anet fɛ́ kabik ku sɛs mo, a cɛɛt na di tees banet gyatgyat ifɛ̀ aYeso, ngma na anɔng, irēn wu gang nkum na abatisma aYohana kyɛk. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />A kpa kucɛɛt vit nnyim narɔ inyis baYahuda, awɛt fɛ́ aPrisila nɛ Akwila wes ato ni wu, ba ku sok, ba tse ba bang ku tees mo ifɛ̀ Adakunom yɛt-yɛt.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ni izen fɛ́ a shim a tat sak ni mben Akaya, bafi ikuus Afisa ku gbinding, ba jɛk kaban fumung sak na bafi ikuus ye, na ba ku shan ni mbɔk nfaa. Ni izen fɛ́ a tse a ta azɔng, a di sɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsang shan atsak nek ízɔk Adakunom, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />nek iwu kɔk nanan na agap nɛ baYahuda nate banet. A ka ba tonoso narɔ zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt ni ifumung Adakunom fɛ́ na tonong fok aYeso wu ayet Anet-Isheshek me.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul's 3rd Journey" file="cen Paul-3_B&amp;W.jpg" size="span" loc="ACT 18:23--21:16" copy="SIL" ref="18:23--21:16">Kutseet ishara ifɛ́ itek aBulus kufɛ ataat</figure><verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">ABulus na Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Ni izen fɛ́ Apolos rēn resek na aKorinti, aBulus kuus irén atak, a teng a nyeseng ni nwɔp e, iwu ni irèn sak na Afisa. A tse a sɛ bafi ikuus bakak azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />A ka ba rip ye, &lt;&lt;Neme fi i kin di shan yin atsak, i man sɛ yin Kabik aJɛrɛ yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Awey, iyit man fok yit fok ikikak di se tɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ ngma awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Wat iwu tɛ a ka ba rip ye, &lt;&lt;Wat akyɛ kuri abatisma wu fɛ́ ba kin ki ra yin ne yɛ?&gt;&gt; Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Kuri ayɔng fɛ́ aYohana ras wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />ABulus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Abatisma aYohana kin yet afi iwosong anɛn sak itirik na Adakunom. A kin fɛ̀ ne banet, na ba di nɔɔk atsak na ayɔng fɛ́ a da bɛ́ ama wu, fɛ́ a yet aYeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ni ifok anɔng, ba ka ba ra abatisma ni iyerek aTisa aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBulus di sas mbɔk naton ace bá, Kabik aJɛrɛ tik naton ba, ba kpa cɛɛt ayɛt alem akak, na ba taas ibes. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Ba kin se banet kusɔk abe afaa.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Ama anɔng, aBulus tse a nɔ narɔ inyis baYahuda, a sok nfɛn ntat, na cɛɛt ni iba na agap iyɛ, na kɔk nhwyɛ ba azaton igwɔm Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Awɛt bakak ayɛt ba sot gbakasak, ba raba dang nɔɔk atsak, ba woso nyes ncɛɛt nmaane naton irèn ikuus ashon banet, nek anɔng, aBulus ka ba won, a tseng na bafi ikuus, kaakyi kunom na tɔ ni iba nitu itees aTiranus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ba ya kashon anɔng sak ayɛ afaa, fi i sak baYahuda nɛ BaGirik fɛ́ ba se ni mben Asiya fok ifɛ̀ aTisa.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnon aSikeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Adakunom ra kutomong abes na aBulus makiyi, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />fi i sak ke banet sok icɛk ikpin ibɔk wu, ki ikyɛng ifamasa kurɔm wu ayi, ke ba tse ba di sak naton afi irɔk, na kurɔk e wat ku gang, ni itsɛ́ng wuru ni irɔm banet.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />BaYahuda bakak fɛ́ ba teng ba kat ni nwɔp-nwɔp fok, ba shim ba turung itsɛ́ng ni iyerek aTisa aYeso naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi nrɔk itsɛ́ng, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi fɛ̀ ni iyin ayɛt iyerek aYeso yɔng fɛ́ aBulus di shara ifɛ̀, wuruk yin!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Barim aSikeba agbat-agbat àware aYahuda, iba kanakataat, ba kin ra kutomong e yɔng. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Awɛt itsɛ̀ng e fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Imi rēn aYeso, in rēn aBulus, awɛt iyin yet yit bangan ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Wat anet fi itsɛ́ng se ayɛt wu me, dorok fulul ni ba, a ya agap ba pet, a zim na man, na teng na wuruk ari me kpiip, ni nfot ni nrɔm na.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Banet fɛ́ ba se na Afisa ngma kusum fok ikyɛng fi ite, baYahuda nɛ BaGirik. Nnyim yit akaangan, iyerek aTisa aYeso sɛ iratek. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Banet dot fɛ́ ba shan atsak, bes ba taas anɛn bá ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ba man ras nate banet. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Ni kudot banet fɛ́ ba tsang se ni irèn kubok, bes na afumung kubok bá, ba shosh ina na yisi banet. Ba fa kudot itsɔm na, ba sɛ kudot itsɔm na, nfɛ́ ata itsɔm akan nsɔk ntoon. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Nek anɔng, kucɛɛt Adakunom bang ya kashon ni ku rasak na agap.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ama nkyɔrɔk e yɔng, aBulus sok ayɛt iyɛ wu fok, a da got abak mben aMasedoniya ni mben Akaya, a da ne a tse ni aRushelima, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ama fi in ne azɔng, i se gbing-gbing ni in tsin in di aRoma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Nek anɔng, a tom bafi isɛs wu bafaa, aTimoti nɛ Arastus sak na aMasedoniya, iwu bang sot na Asiya ninyen.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idorok nhwyɛ na Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Kpaf izen e yɔng, idorok nhwyɛ gyet awo nɔ na Afisa naton irèn ikuus aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Nek anet akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aDemetiriyus fɛ́ a ra kutomong itu ata itsɔm akan. A nyes narɔ fɛ́ ba di ya nabannom ntong fɛ́ ba yes ina ye Atemis. Banet ntomong inoos narɔ ntsi me yɔng di sɛs ijik gyet awo.<verse eid="ACT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />ADemetiriyus tse a tusung banet e ngma nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras kuri ntomong e yɔng, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, ngma yin i rēn yin fok ayet kutomong kang ko fi in di ses yit kurúm. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Iyin ice yin i tsin yɛrɛ yin ni foos yin fɛ́ aBulus e yɔng mi sɔ nhwyɛ banet ngma kusum nkum azeng na Afisa kyɛk awo, ngmash na ya mben Asiya ngma kusum, a nye ni iba fok nabannom fɛ́ ba nye ni mbɔk, na yet nnom awo. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Di yin kudaam e yet, azeng sak ashon ijik itomong yit deng da bi i kpa, ama anɔng, banet yɔng ba da sok karɔ iya ntong agbat nabannom yit Atemis ni ibyɛs, ikuus agbat adakunom yit Atemis ngma ni mben Asiya, nɛ kazatse kusum, a da bit igbat ízɔk wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok ifɛ̀ me, ayɛ ba beseng makiyi, ba kpa nye na agap, &lt;&lt;Atemis Afisa wu a bi iratek!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Wat kuwɔp e wat ku shining ne awɔng, ba wat ba kpa kɔk ba aGayus nɛ Aristakus bafidang itseet aBulus fɛ́ ba yet banet aMasedoniya sak ni bang. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Awɛt aBulus shim a tse a sɛ kudyɛng banet e, bafi ikuus ku ro mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Bakak ayet bakɔk-ashon mben e fɛ́ ba yet bafidang wu, iba tom na ba ku tak da a bɛ́ ni bang e awo.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Banet cɛɛt kpɛɛ, ba ba fɛ̀ ana, nɛ ba ya fɛ̀ ane, karɔ me te kpɛrɛdɛng, banet dot kyem ba rēn ice inyim e ngma awo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Bakak ayɛt baYahuda me, yirik Alekzanda sak ashon, iwu sok kubɔk naton nɔng banet bin di te yuu, nɔng a bin di tɛnɛng ice wu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ni izen fɛ́ banet e di fok a yet afɛ́ aYahuda, nek ba sok nkip nfaa na ba woso nye, &lt;&lt;Atemis Afisa wu a bi iratek!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ama fɛ́ agbat anet ijɛk iwɔp e mi sak kudyɛng banet e te yuu, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Banet Afisa, angan wu a won dang rēn fok iyin bɛ yin atsi fi i di raas yin ntsi sak na azɔk Atemis e, ni nfi kuta ajɛrɛ fi ku kin ne azanɛn sak aben ɛ? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Vit anet fɛ́ a tsin ra nanang, nek anɔng, i se gyat ni i men yin nhwyɛ yin, i bi nye yin ikikak ayɛt aziri awo.<verse eid="ACT 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />&lt;&lt;Wat iyin bɛ yin na banet bang azeng, fɛ́ da ba mi yi ikikak kɛ ba beseng iyerek kaban-nnom yit awo. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ke aDemetiriyus nɛ bafidang itomong wu bɛ kukun naton akak, natisi atu ishɔt yɔng piyot, bágwɔm ishɔt yɔng azɔng, won na ba tse ni kukun ba azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ki ikikak ti i rēn di se fi i shim yin, ni tak yin kazumung bashɔn kang da fok. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Nek ki ishɔt idorok nhwyɛ ki ya yit atut, nek in bi yit ikyɛng fi ki in di tɛnɛng yit ace yit awo, nek kuri iburuk fi ite azeng atut.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ama fɛ̀ a gang ifɛ̀ wu, a sak kaangan na a tseng.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">ABulus tɛ a bun sak ni mben aMasedoniya nɛ aGiris</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ama fi idorok nhwyɛ me nyeseng, aBulus yes bafi ikuus e, ama fɛ́ a mi ka ba barang mo agap iyɛ, a te a tɔ ni iba, a ma yit irèn sak na aMasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />A teng a kat ni mben e yɔng, na di barasa bafi ikuus agap iyɛ ni ncɛɛt wu, a tse a ta na aGiris. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />A nye nfen ntaat azɔng, ni izen fɛ́ a se ni i kana nye a da nɔ kukyɛ ashi sak na aSiriya, baYahuda se ni ite agunung fɛ́ ba da ku fɛt mo, nek anɔng, a tɛ a bun sak na aMasedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Banet fɛ́ ba kin ku kuus mo sak azɔng, kin yet ba aSopata arim aPirius fɛ́ a yet anet aBeriya, nɛ Aristakus nɛ aSekundus afi iwɔp aTesaloni, nɛ aGayus afi iwɔp aDerbe, nɛ aTimoti, nɛ bafi mben Asiya aTikikus, nɛ aTurofimus. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Banet bang kin tung tseng ashon, ba tse ba ki tot yit na aTorowas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Iyit kin ni in won yit kuwɔp aFilipi ayɛt kukyɛ ashi ama igang Amok Akpam Vit Ayist e, ama nkɔs ntoon, in tsi in ka ba sɛ yit na aTorowas. In nye yit nkɔs kanakataat azɔng.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyim ifi igang e fɛ́ ba ra na aTorowas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ni kunom imɛsɛng inyis-nnom baYahuda, in nyis yit ni in yas yit. ABulus cɛɛt ni iba, nek a bi won azɔng akatson, a ya kashon ni kucɛɛt sak kate atuk. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Agaramun kin se dot ni kutu ari aton, fi in kin di nyim yit e. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Acam akak fɛ́ ba ku yes ye aYutikus a kin sɛ ni isonong ni iwere, a mi sok nda ntsik makiyi na aBulus tsin rēn cɛɛt. Ni nda mi tseng ni iwu, a ne azɔng na agubuk ataat afi kutu aton e sak aben, ba tse ba sɛ a mi ku. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Awɛt aBulus tik sak aben, a men naton acam e, a ku kunung ni nbɔk wu, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I bi daam yin awo, a sɛ ni kutset!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />A tɛ a ngarak ni itu aton e, a but akpam, a ya. A di fit kucɛɛt ma kadiding weshek, a da ne tseng. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Banet e sok acam e ni kutset sak ari, ba shining ni ifeng gyet awo.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus te bashɔn Afisa a tɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Iyit kin no yit kukyɛ ashi, in tseng yit ashon aBulus sak ni wop Asos, narɔ fi in da wat ku sok yit mo. Iwu kin won anɔng, nek iwu kin tseng na atak. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ni izen fɛ́ a tse a ki sɛ yit na Asos, in ku sok yit, in ma yit yit irèn sak ni wɔp aMitilin. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Akatson, in wɔk yit, in tat yit ni wɔp izek aKiyos, ni kunom kufɛ́ afaa, in tsin in ta yit ni wɔp izek aSamos, in tin ikoso yit kutseet, akatson iyit bang na aMiletus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Na aBulus mi sok ayɛt iyɛ wu na tun a di ki berem karak vit ite rɛɛt na Afisa kɔng ba bi fɛt izen ni mben Asiya. Nek a kin se na ziri, nyen na a tse a ta na aRushelima aTuk aPɛntɛkɔs.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />A kin nat a nyeseng na aMiletus, a da tom na ba yes bashɔn ikuus Afisa. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Izen fɛ́ ba bɛ́, a fɛrɛng ni ba ye, &lt;&lt;Iyin rēn yin kuri kusot fi in nye, neme fi in di se ni yin, nkum kunom imɛsɛng fi in kin di nɔ ni mben Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />In tik ni ice hom, in ra Adakunom kutomong ayɛt nayisi, ngma ni kuri izot fɛ́ baYahuda di mara ne. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Iyin rēn yin fok imi mang won dang ki tak yin ngma ikyɛng fi i se gyat ni yin awo, in ki tees yin ni dɛt, nɛ na nasa. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Imi mi tonong baYahuda nɛ bafi ilem aGirik fok i se gbingbing na ba wosong anɛn, na ba tirik na Adakunom ni inɔɔk atsak na aYeso aTisa yit.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />&lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng ana, Kabik di te mo nyɛng, in se ni irèn sak na aRushelima, in rēn ikyɛng fi i da te ni imi azɔng awo. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Nkum ikyɛng fi in rēn yet, na kaakyi kuwɔp, Kabik aJɛrɛ nye ni imi fok, izot ni inyang tsin di tot. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ngma na anɔng, imi sok kutset hom nanu ikikak awo, ki in da kyem in gang i tsi fi in se ne, ni in gang kutomong fɛ́ aTisa hom aYeso mi di nɔk kyɛk. Kutomong e yet ishara ifɛ̀ itek ifi itek Adakunom.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng in rēn fok vit azining ayɛt yin fi imi mi kat ishara ifɛ̀ igwɔm Adakunom fɛ́ a da tɛ a di di. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Nek anɔng, in tsin ki tak yin atut fok, nasok akak se naton ice min awo. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Nek imi mi won dang ki tak yin ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom fɛ̀ awo. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Tosok yin ace yin, ne banet fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ mi ki sak yin bafi iyɛrɛ ba. Sot yin banek bafi ikuus Adakunom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon kin bɛ́: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bafi ikuus aTisa.</char></note>, bayɔng fi iwu shan na nasok ari wu. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nek imi rēn fok, ama fi in mi tseng, aduk anet fɛ́ a se tɛ agbayɔrɔ, bi bɛ́ a nɔ ayɛt yin, a bi won bafi ikuus e awo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Bakak ayɛt yin ace yin, bi dorok nek ibeseng atsak e, nek ba di kɔrɔk nhwyɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi ka ba kuus mo. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nek anɔng, tosok in ace yin, yiring yin ayɛt ayɛ ataat fi in ra ni yin, imi won dang in ki kɔk yin ato, kunom nɛ katuk ayɛt nayisi awo.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />&lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng, in tsin ki won yin ni bɔk Adakunom. Won ifɛ̀ Adakunom fi i nesek itek, ni i ki nok yin, ni i ki nɔɔk yin iya itekari gung na bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba te jɛrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Imi mi te kuhwye ni kutsɔm kukan, kɛ kutsɔm kuseng, kɛ ares akak awo. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Iyin ice yin i rēn yin fok, mbɔk hom nang na fi in ya ni imi, na banet fɛ́ ba se gung ni imi. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ayɛt ikyɛng fi in ras, in ki tonoso yin fok i se gbing-gbing ni in taat kutsin ni tomong, in di se yit in di gyerep yit bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit agap. Won ni in yiring yit ni ifɛ̀ aTisa yit aYeso ye, &lt;Awɛng se naton inesek aza ishashang.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ama fɛ́ a mi gang kucɛɛt, a sak akut aben ni iba, ra awon. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Ngma ba ba tos na ba yisik aBulus na ba ku nyes ashow isak anu. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Ikyɛng fi idung ka ba ra iyɛ yet ifɛ̀ dɔng fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ye da ba bi tɛ ba ku di awo. Ama anɔng, ba tse ba ku tsa sak ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">ABulus tseng sak na aRushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ama fi in mi tirik kama, in kpa wɔk yit ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, in sok yit irèn tsik sak ni iwɔp izek aKos. Akatson, in tsin ta yit ni wɔp izek aRodes, ama fi in won yit azɔng, in tsin ta yit na aPatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />In tsi in sɛ yit kukyɛ ashi fi ku da tat sak ni mben aFinikiya, in nɔ yit iko, in kpa wɔk yit. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ni izen fi in kpa nye gang yit aSayipurus, in won yit kuwɔp izek e ni bɔk imen, in tatɔk yit sak na aSiriya, in tsin nyeseng yit na aTiya, azɔng wu fi kukyɛ ashi me da turung acet fi ku cet. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Fi in sɛ yit bafi ikuus azɔng, in sot yit ni iba nkɔs kanakataat. Kabik tik ni ba, ba fɛ̀ na aBulus ye da a bi tse ni aRushelima awo. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Awɛt ama fi izen idorok nye, in won yit azɔng, in ya yit kashon ni kutseet yit. Ngma bafi ikuus e, nɛ banyining bá, ni nnon bá, ba tse ba ki tsa yit sak ama iwɔp, sak na anu ashi, in sak yit akut aben ra yit awon. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ama fi in kana te yit a tɔ, in tsi nɔ yit kukyɛ ashi, iba tɛ ba bun sak ari.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Iyit won yit aTiya, in ya yit kashon ni kutseet sak na aTolemayis. In tsin te show yit bafi ikuus, in nye yit kukɔs kuzining azɔng ni iba. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Akatson in won yit azɔng sak na aKaisariya, in tsin in tik yit ari aFilibus anet ishara ifɛ̀ itek, azining ayɛt banet kanakataat. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />A bɛ̀ bangas banaas fɛ́ ba resek dang ras nweneng, fɛ́ ba taas ibes.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Ama fi in bɔ yit nnom gaan azɔng, atan akak fɛ́ ba ku yes ye Agabus, a ne na aJudiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Ntomong Batom 11:28</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />A bɛ́ bakat ni iyit, a sok kudun awit aBulus, Agabus e kana rosom mo, atak ni mbɔk, a da ma fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng de fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ cɛɛt, &lt;Ane wu fɛ́ baYahuda fɛ́ ba se ni aRushelima da nye, na atek kudun awit ka, ba da ku rosom, na ba ku nabak ni bɔk Ícɛn-iduk.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Izen fi in fok yit anɔng, iyit nɛ banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng, in di tsot yit akabɔk na aBulus fok da a bi tse ni aRushelima awo. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />ABulus bun ni ifɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi iyin tos yin, ni di bushung yin nkap ɛ? Imi mi kana nye, da ni isot inyang kyɛk awo, won ni in ku na aRushelima gbak nek iyerek aTisa aYeso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Nek in kyem in sɔ yit ice wu awo, in ku won yit, in fɛ́ yit, &lt;&lt;Won ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa shim ni i sot.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ama nnom e yɔng, in kana nye yit, in kpa ngarak yit sak na aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Bakak ayɛt bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aKaisariya, ba tse ba ki tsa yit sak ari aNason afɛ́ aSayipurus, anet fɛ́ a mi fɔɔn ni ikuus, azɔng fi in tsin sot yit.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus nɔ ni aRushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ni izen fi in tsi in ta yit na aRushelima, bafi ikuus ki shan yit ni iyɛ ikan. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Akatson aBulus ni ishɛrɛp yit, in tsin di yit aYakubu, ngma bashɔn bafi ikuus aRushelima kin se azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Ama fɛ́ aBulus mi kaba te show, a kpa kaba tas nzizining ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ Adakunom mi nye ayɛt Ícɛn-iduk ayit kutomong fɛ́ a se ne.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, ba tere Adakunom. Wat ba fɛ̀ na aBulus, &lt;&lt;Aruneng, ngɔn di baYahuda agup dot fɛ́ ba mi shan atsak, di ngma ba ba bɛ́ iyɛ ngash ikuus ntsi aMusa, <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />ba mi fok fok ngɔn tees ngma baYahuda fɛ́ ba se ni mben Ícɛn-iduk fok, ye na ba won ntsi aMusa, ni nye ni iba fok, da ba bi ya nnon bá katse awo, fok da ba bi kuus nggɔn yit awo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Akyɛ yet ikyɛng inye ɛ? I se gbing-gbing ba da fok fok ngɔn mi bɛ́, <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />nek anɔng, nye ikyɛng fi in da fɛ̀ yit ni ngɔn. Banet banaas bang gung ni iyit fɛ́ ba mi sok kushi.<verse eid="ACT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />&lt;&lt;Ngɔn sok banet e bang, tsi mon ice ni iba ni izen fɛ́ ba da kpa nasos ajɛrɛ, tsi tarang itsɔm, nɔng ba da ka ba kot mo ace bá. Na anɔng wu, kaangan da rēn fok vit atsak ayɛt kucɛɛt fɛ́ ba kin fok naton ngɔn, ba da fɛ̀ ngɔn ice ngɔn i kuus ntsi. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Awɛt azaton bafi ikuus Ícɛn-iduk, iyit mi kaba jɛk yit kufumung ikyɛng fi iyit nyeseng yit naton e fok, na ba te yik-yik ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi di nye inabak-akuce sak na nabannom e, da ba bi ya nasok awo, da ba bi ya ikyɛng fɛ́ ba firik kutɔ me awo, da na ba ras kubi awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Akatson, aBulus sok banet e, iwu nɛ banet e ba tse ba so nasos ajɛrɛ. Ama anɔng, a tse nitu iya Adakunom ntong, nɔng a tse a tak kunom ni izen fi ntsi ajɛrɛ bá bi di gang, na ba nabak kunang naton akaangan ba.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tekap aBulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ni izen fi nkɔs kanakataat bɛ́ bakat ni in shining, baYahuda bakak fɛ́ ba ne ni mben Asiya, di aBulus ni itu iya Adakunom ntong. Ba ruk kudyɛng banet ngma kusum, ba tekap aBulus, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />na ba tang nkun ye, &lt;&lt;Banet aIsrela, ki sɛ yit mo! Anet e yong fɛ́ a teng na tees banet kaakyɛ fok da ba bi kuus nggɔn yit ni ntsi yit nɛ karɔ kaJɛrɛ kang awo. Ama anɔng, a mi ne na BaGirik, a bɛ́ a nɔ ni iba ni itu iya Adakunom ntong, a mi beseng karɔ kang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Nek iba mi tsang di aTurofimus anet Afisa gung nɛ aBulus ayɛt iwɔp, nek anɔng ba yes fok aBulus mi nɔ ni iwu narɔ iya Adakunom ntong.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Kuwɔp e ngma kusum wat ku te kpɛrɛdɛng, banet nes ni irèn zizɛɛt. Ba tekap aBulus, ba ku tun ni itu iya Adakunom ntong e, ba wat ba famasa natisi me. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Na ba tsin tsɛt ba da sok kutset wu, ifɛ̀ me tsi nɔ ni to agbat-agbat batsom aRoma fok idorok nhwyɛ mi nɔ ni wɔp aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Ni izen izining, a sok bakɔk-ashon batsom nɛ batsom e, ba di berem sak narɔ kudyɛng banet e. Ni izen fɛ́ bafi idorok nhwyɛ me di agbat-agbat batsom e, nɛ batsom wu, ba won itsot aBulus e.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Agbat-agbat batsom e, tse a tekap aBulus, a sak ba ku rosom na anyang afaa. Ama ku rip fok a yet angan ɛ, a ra inɛn akyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Bakak ayɛt kudyɛng banet e tang nkun fok ane, nɛ bakak fɛ̀ ane, nek agbat batsom e kyem a yit atsak ice icɛɛt e awo nek awɔng, a sak na ba tse na aBulus ni wɔp batsom. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBulus ta na ata ingarak, idorok nhwyɛ me di barang makiyi fi i sot gbing-gbing batsom e ku sok ikyɛng ba. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba di rosok e, woso tang nkun fok, &lt;&lt;Na ba ngasang amaan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus cɛɛt ni kudyɛng banet e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Ni izen fɛ́ batsom e shim nɔ na aBulus ni wɔp batsom e, a rip agbat-agbat batsom e, &lt;&lt;In da kyem in fɛrɛng ikikak ni ngɔn ɛ?&gt;&gt; Agbat batsom e ku rip yi, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn rēn icɛn BaGirik ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ngɔn wu i yet anet aMasat fi i kin tumung idorok nhwyɛ, fi i kin tun bafi idoro nhwyɛ banet agup anaas sak atse ni nkɔs ama awɛ? <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />ABulus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi yet afɛ́ aYahuda, afi iwɔp aTarsus ni mben aKilikiya, afi kuwɔp fi ku yet ikyɛng ibyɛs awo. Kabɔk di nang kawat in di fɛrɛng na banet e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Ni izen fɛ́ agbat batsom me kunang kawat e, aBulus ngarak na ata ingarak e, a ka ba te kubɔk ye na ba te yuu. Ni izen fɛ́ ba te yuu, a fɛ̀ ni iba ni ilem a Aram.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Ábaruneng nɛ badada, fok yin ikyɛng fi in da fɛ̀ nek itɛnɛng ice hom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok a tsin cɛɛt ni iba ni ilem Aram, ba bang te yuu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">ABulus fɛ̀ ni iba: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />&lt;&lt;Imi yet afɛ́ aYahuda, kutes aTarsus ni mben aKilikiya, imi rasak azeng ni wɔp kang. In sɛ itees makiyi ni bɔk aGamaliyel, naton ntsi badakop yit. In bi iyɛ ngash kutomong Adakunom kpaf ti iyin di tonoso yin atut. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Imi nesek banet ikuus Irèn yeng iyɔm sak ikok kutset bá, in yisik, ngma batek nɛ banyining ni in tsees e ari inyang, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />agbat àware nɛ kazumung bashɔn ice ba da fɛ̀ ey ikyɛng fi in cɛɛt. In man nin shashan afumung ni bɔk bá sak na baruneng fɛ́ ba se na aDamaskos, in tse azɔng nek iyisik bafi ikuus e, ni in tses ni iba na aRushelima ti nnon inyang, nɔng ba ka ba nesek iyɔm.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />&lt;&lt;Bakat kate inom, ngmash ni in ta na aDamaskos, ni izen izining, mgbey ne azanɛn in di faam. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />In wat in kpa aben, in fok kutɔ fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;AShawulu! AShawulu! Akyɛ sak fi i di nesek iyɔm ɛ?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Imi ku rip yɛ, &lt;ATisa, ngɔn yet angan ɛ?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">&lt;&lt;A fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;Imi yet aYeso anet aNazaret, ayɔng fi ngɔn tsin ku nesek iyɔm.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Bafidang itseet in di mgbey e, awɛt ba kyem ba fok kutɔ ayɔng fɛ́ a cɛɛt ni imi awo.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />&lt;&lt;Imi ku rip yɛ, &lt;Akyɛ fi in da nye aTisa yɛ?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">&lt;&lt;ATisa fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;Dorok, tseng sak na aDamaskos. Azɔng wu fɛ́ ba da ka tak ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi sak fi i da ra.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Bafidang itseet hom, di kɔk ni bɔk sak na aDamaskos, nek mgbey kurong e di te akpatɔn.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />&lt;&lt;Anet akak fɛ́ ba ku yes Ananiyas, bɛ́ a di di. A yet anet ikuus ntsi Adakunom, anet fɛ́ baYahuda fɛ́ ba se azɔng ku nesek iratek makiyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />A bɛ́ a nyeseng ni fam in, a fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;Aruneng aShawulu, sɛ ayisi ngɔn!&gt; Ni izen izining, in wat in kpa yɛrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />&lt;&lt;A ma fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;Adakunom badakop yit, mi da kasa nek ni i rēn kushim wu, nek i di di aJɛrɛ me, ni i di fok ifɛ́ nanu wu. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ngɔn da sot kanu icɛɛt wu, sak na banet ngma naton ikyɛng fi i mi di, ni ikyɛng fi i fok. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Ngɔn sha ngɔn akyɛ? Dorok, ba tse ba da ra abatisma, ikusu anɛn ngɔn, ni irèn iyes iyerek wu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fi in bun na aRushelima, in se ni ira awon ni itu iya Adakunom ntong, nda-abik wat in di sok, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />in di aTisa na tsin cɛɛt, a fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;Nye ziri da won aRushelima yɔkɔnɔng, nek ba da nɔɔk atsak ikyɛng fi ngɔn da ka ba tak azaton hom awo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />&lt;&lt;Imi fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;ATisa, banet bang rēn fok imi teng ni in kuus narɔ inyiis baYahuda, nek itosok ni ites bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak ni ngɔn ari inyang. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ama anɔng, ni izen fɛ́ ba kin nosong nasok aIstifanus, imi kin nyeseng azɔng ayɛt irun ama ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin nye, ni itosok ares bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin se ni ifɛt wu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />&lt;&lt;Ama anɔng, aTisa fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;Tseng, imi da ka tom yik-yik sak ni Ícɛn-iduk.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus nggon mben aRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Kudyɛng banet e woso di wes ato ni wu ma sak ni kucɛɛt wu kang. Ama anɔng, ba ta ntɔ bá ye, &lt;&lt;Na ba wey na anet yong azatse! I se gyat na ba won ayong ni kutset awo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba se ni itang nkun, na ba woro ares bá naton, na ba tang ntong naton, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />agbat-agbat batsom e fɛ̀ na ba nɔ na aBulus ni wɔp batsom. A sak fok na ba ku nye ahwyereng, nɔng ba bin sɛ ba di rēn ikyɛng fi isak banet e di tang nkun ni wu anɔng. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba mi ku rosom ba da kpa ku zim, aBulus fɛ̀ na akɔk-ashon batsom e fɛ́ a se ni nyeseng azɔng, &lt;&lt;Ntsi nɔɔk irèn na ba hwyereng nggon mben aRoma dang na ba ka ka tsɛɛt ishɔt ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ni izen fɛ́ akɔk-ashon batsom e fok anɔng, a tse a sɛ agbat-agbat batsom e, a tse a ku tak. A ku rip, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi ngɔn da nye yɛ? Anet yong yet nggon mben aRoma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Agbat-agbat batsom e tse a se aBulus, a ku rip ye, &lt;&lt;Di tak, ngɔn yet nggon mben aRoma yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">ABulus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ey.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Agbat-agbat batsom e fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Imi fɛt itsɔm dot in da ni in di sɛ kusot nggon mben.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Awɛt aBulus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi ba di tes ayɛt de.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Nek anɔng, bayɔng fɛ̀ ba tsɛt ba kpa ku nyes nrisim e, wat ba kɔrɔk kurɔm. Agbat-agbat batsom e ice wu nnyim ku yit, ni izen fɛ́ a rēn fok iwu mi rosom aBulus nggon mben aRoma ni ndun.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus ashon kazumung bashɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Akatson, nek agbat-agbat batsom e shim a rēn kpaf ikyɛng fi isak baYahuda di tang nkun na aBulus, a sak ba ku bisik ndun, a sak agbat àware, nɛ kazumung bashɔn na ba nyim. A tun aBulus, a sak na a nyeseng ashon bá.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />ABulus di sak ayisi na bashɔn azumung e, a fɛ́ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, kayɛt iyɛ hom se cɛ́l naton kutseet hom ashon Adakunom sak atut ana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ni ifok anɔng, agbat-agbat àware Ananiyas sak bayɔng fɛ̀ ba nyeseng bakat ni iwu na ba ku carak kanu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />ABulus fɛ́ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Adakunom bi da carak ngɔn, ngɔn anet nanu nafaa! Ngɔn sonong azɔng ni di ras ishɔt ni irèn ntsi, ni ngɔn ice ngɔn tsin beseng ntsi me fok ba di carak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba nyeseng bakat na aBulus e, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn shim i tosong agbat-agbat àware Adakunom ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />ABulus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, da imi rēn fok iwu wu a yet agbat-agbat àware awo, nek i se ni ijɛk fok, &lt;I bi nye amaan fɛ sak na akɔk-ashon banet ngɔn awo.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Iwuruk 22:28</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBulus di fok kazumung e bɛ́ BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi, a ta kutɔ nate kazumung e, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, imi yet aFarasi, arim aFarasi, nek anɔng wu ba tsin di ra ishɔt nek ite iyɛ fi in bɛ́ nek idoro bafaben.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Nkum fɛ́ a fɛrɛng anɔng, nanan dorok nate BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi me, kazumung e wat ka te shangaring, <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />nek BaSadusi nye fok vit idoro bafaben, vit batomaza, vit kabik, awɛt na BaFarasi nye ngma nkyɔrɔk e yɔng di se.<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Iwɔng dorok makiyi, bafi itees ntsi me bakak fɛ́ ba yet BaFarasi, dorok ba kpa nanan na agap ye, &lt;&lt;Iyit sɛ yit anet yong ni inɛn ikikak awo. Iyin rēn yin anɛ nyen kabik ke atomaza ayi mi cɛɛt ni wu anɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Nanan e dorok cuut ni kuren fi isak agbat-agbat batsom e fok nnyim fok nyɛn ba da cɛkɛt aBulus icɛk-icɛk e. Nek anɔng, a sak batsom e, na ba tik, na ba tenat aBulus ni bɔk ba, na ba nɔ ni iwu ni iwɔp batsom.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Natuk e yɔng, aTisa nyeseng ni fam aBulus, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;I bi fok nnyim awo! Kyɔn ti fi i kin di shara ifɛ̀ hom ni aRushelima, i da tsi i nye kpaf anɔng na aRoma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba moon kanu ba da fɛt aBulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Akatson baYahuda moon kanu, ba sok kushii, vit iba ni kuyak, vit iba ni isɔ ikikak ma ba sok kutset aBulus ninyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Banet kin wat nsɔk nnaas fɛ́ ba kin moon kanu me. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ba tse ba sɛ ágbat-ágbat áware nɛ bashɔn, ba fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyit mi sok yit kushii, vit ikyɛng fi i da nɔ nanu yit ma in sok yit kutset aBulus ninyɛn. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Nek anɔng, won iyin nɛ kazumung karatek da tsɛɛt yin irèn na agbat-agbat batsom, i da ku wɔrɔk yin fok na i ki bɛ yin na aBulus ishim ibang fok yin kucɛɛt wu me. Iyit mi kana nye yit in da sok yit kutset wu dang na a ta azeng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Awɛt izen fɛ̀ arim anganeng aBulus fok ikyɛng fi i tsin tseng, a di berem ni wɔp batsom e, a tse a tak aBulus.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Nek anɔng, aBulus yes akɔk batsom e akak, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Tsi tsa acam yo narɔ agbat-agbat batsom, a bi ikyɛng fɛ́ a shim a ku tak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Nek anɔng, a tse ni ika narɔ agbat batsom e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Akɔk batsom e, fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Afi inyang aBulus sak ba di yes, a fɛ̀ ni imi in da bɛ́ na acam yo, nek a bi ikyɛng fɛ́ a shim a fɛ̀ ni ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Agbat batsom e, yit kubɔk kacam e, a ka ka kɔrɔk ni fam, a ka ka rip ye, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ de fi i shim i di tak ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Acam e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;baYahuda mi moon kanu fok ba da ka wɔrɔk, ni i ka ba bɛ́ na aBulus na kazumung karatek natson ye fok ba shim ba bang fok ifɛ̀ wu gyatgyat. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />I bi fok ifɛ̀ ba awo, nek banet waat nsɔk nnaas fɛ́ ba mi nɛsɛk ni itsɛt nek iwu. Ba mi sok kushii fok vit kuyak, ni isɔ ikikak ma ba sok kutset wu ninyen. Ba mi kana nye, ba tsin tot ngɔn ni i fɛ̀ ey ni ifɛ́ ba kyɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Agbat-agbat batsom e te acam e ni irèn, a fɛ̀ ni ika, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi tak akak fok ngɔn mi te kukun e ni imi awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tseng na aBulus na aKaisariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ama anɔng, agbat-agbat batsom e, yes bakɔk batsom wu bafaa, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Tsi moon yin batsom anakat afaa, bafi isɔkɔ nsɔk kanakataat afaa, nɛ bafi ikɔrɔng nɛ ákon anakat afaa fɛ́ ba da tsɛ na aKaisariya ni itsɔm bɔk agyɛng azining afɛ́ atuk atut. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Nye yin ítsáp fɛ́ aBulus da ngarak, nɔng ba da tse ni iwu narɔ agwɔmna aFeliks vit ice song.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />A ku jɛk kufumung ane:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Imi aKalaudiyus aLisiyas wu in jɛk kufumung kang sak na aZɔk agwɔmna aFeliks:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:26">In da te show.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Anet yɔng, baYahuda kin ku tekap, ba kin shim ba sok kutset wu, awɛt imi ne nɛ batsom in, in bi in ku shan yit, nek in fok fok a yet nggon mben aRoma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />In tsɛt in rēn inɛn fɛ́ a ka ba nye ne, nek anɔng fi in di tse ni wu na kazumung karatek bá. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ikyɛng fi in sɛ yet fok inɛn e se naton nrisim azaton ntsi bá, awɛt vit inɛn ikak fɛ́ a ra fi i kyem ba di sok kutset wu ke na ba ku te ni nyang ayi. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ni izen fi in fok imoon anu fɛ́ ba mi nye naton anet e, In sak ba da bɛ́ ni wu vit ibeseng izen. In mi te bafi nkun wu na ba bɛ́ ba te kukun inɛn fɛ́ a ra ashon ngɔn.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Nek anɔng, batsom e nye ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ka ba sak mo, ba sok aBulus gung ni iba natuk sak ni wɔp Antipatiris. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Akatson, ba won bafi isɔkɔ tsɛng ni iwu, awɛt iba tɛ ba bun sak ni wɔp batsom. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi isɔkɔ me tse ba ta na aKaisariya, ba nabak aGwɔmna kufumung e ngma nɛ aBulus e. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ama fɛ́ a fa kufumung e, a ku rip fok iwu ne na akyɛ mben ɛ. Ni izen fɛ́ a rēn fok a ne na aKilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />aGwɔmna me fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;In bi fok ifɛ̀ ngɔn ki bafi nkun ngɔn ta azeng.&gt;&gt; A sak fok na ba fam aBulus ari inyang agwɔm aHiridus.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">ABulus ashon agwɔm aFeliks</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ama nkɔs ntoon, agbat-agbat àware Ananiyas tisik sak na aKaisariya gung nɛ bashɔn nɛ anet icɛɛt fɛ́ ba ku yes aTatulus nek ite kukun aBulus ashon agwɔmna. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba nɔ na aBulus, aTatulus kpa nɔɔs ni kukun wu ashon aFeliks, fok:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">&lt;&lt;Neme fi ngɔn di kpa igwɔm ngɔn, in mi sɛ yit kusot kukyang, kutsik iyɛrɛ ngɔn mi tes nkyɔrɔk zizɛɛt ni mben yit. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Na kaakyɛ arɔ, na kaakyi irèn azɔk aFeliks, in tonoso yit kafa kakan yit ni ngɔn makiyi. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Awɛt nek in bi da ya izen awo, In tsin ra awon ni ngɔn, nye akabɔk ki nang yit kuto ngɔn gyeet.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />&lt;&lt;Iyit mi di yit anet yɔng yet anet ifa, a teng na a tuus idoro nhwyɛ baYahuda kaakyɛ azatse. Iwu fɛ́ a yet akɔk-ashon bafi ikuus anet aNazaret <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />a shim a tse a beseng karɔ iya Adakunom ntong, nek anɔng in ku tekap yit.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni mbɔk bɛ̀ ibyat ifɛ́ </char><char style="fv">6-8</char> ane: <char style="fqa" closed="false">Iyit shim in ku ra yit ishɔt kpaf ni ntsi yit. </char><char style="fv">7</char> <char style="fqa" closed="false">Awɛt akɔk-ashon aLisiya bɛ a ku shan na agap ni bɔk yit, </char><char style="fv">8</char> <char style="fqa" closed="false">a sak banet nkun wu na ba bɛ ashon ngɔn.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Ki ngɔn bang ku risim ice ngɔn, i da sɛ kpaf fok kukun fi in tsin te yit yet atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />BaYahuda me wat ba moon nanu fok, kucɛɛt aTatulus yet atsak.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Ni izen fɛ́ agwɔmna nɔk aBulus irèn icɛɛt, aBulus kpa cɛɛt ye:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">&lt;&lt;Imi rēn fok ngɔn mi bɔ ayɛ dot ni tsin ras ishɔt ni mben nang, nek anɔng in bi iyɛ ikan icɛɛt itɛnɛng ice hom. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ngɔn da kyem i rip ikyɛng ngɔn, da nnom mi wat kusɔk abe afaa fi imi ne iya Adakunom ntong na aRushelima awo. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Vit akak ayɛt bafi nkun in fɛ́ a di sɛ ni in tsin ra nanan na akak ke ni in tsin tees banet idoro nhwyɛ narɔ iya Adakunom ntong ke narɔ inyiis baYahuda ke ayɛt iwɔp awo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Vit akak ba fɛ̀ a da kyem a da tonong atsak kukun kang fɛ́ ba tsin te naton in. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ngma na anɔng, imi tsin fɛ́ ey, imi kuus Adakunom ba badakop yit tɛ afi Irèn e yɔng fi iba yes iye ifi mbɔɔs. Imi nɔk atsak ni ikyɛng fi Ntsi run kama me ni idɔng fɛ́ batan Adakunom jɛk, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />in bi ite iyɛ na Adakunom tɛ banet bang fok ba bi dorok bafaben bafɛ́ atsak nɛ bafɛ́ vit atsak. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Nek anɔng, in nye nyɛk kaakyi izen kayɛt iyɛ hom na ka sot cɛ́l ashon Adakunom nɛ ashon banet.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />&lt;&lt;Ama in mi sok ayɛ dot wɛrɛng, in be na aRushelima in bi in nɔɔk banet in kunang fɛ́ ba tusung mok bakan, nin nabak kunang hom na Adakunom. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />In mi gang nasos ajɛrɛ hom, ba bɛ ba di sɛ atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong, vit kudyɛng banet ni fam in, vit idorok nhwyɛ ikak fi in se ne. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Awɛt baYahuda bakak fɛ́ ba ne ni mben Asiya, fi ki i se yɛɛt ke ba se azeng, na ba da tak ke ba bi ikikak naton in. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ke da anɔng awo, won ba bang fɛ́ ba se azeng na ba fɛrɛng na nanu bá inɛn fɛ́ ba di sɛ ni ide ni izen fi in ki nyeseng nazumung karatek, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ke nyɛn nek ikyɛng izining de fi in kin fɛrɛng fi in kin nyeseng ashon ba ye, &lt;Ayet nek kucɛɛt idoro bafaben wu fɛ́ ba tsin di ra mo ishɔt atut.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ama anɔng, nek kutsik irēn fɛ́ aFeliks bɛ azaton Irèn aYeso, a serek ishɔt e sak ashon, aFeliks fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ma aLisiyas agbat-agbat batsom bɛ ninyɛn, in bi ni in tsɛɛt ishɔt e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />A sak akɔk-ashon batsom e na a tsin di sak aBulus ari inyang, na a won kuwun ku fɛp, na a nɔɔk bafidang irèn ba ku gbinding ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a tsɛt.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ama nnom nkak, aFeliks bɛ nɛ abining wu aDursila, anap baYahuda. A sak ba ku yes aBulus, ba di wes ato ni wu na tsin shara ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBulus kpa cɛɛt naton kusot kutabat, ni iyit kurɔm, ni ishɔt Adakunom fi i bi bɛ̀, nnyim yit aFeliks, a fɛ̀ na aBulus, &lt;&lt;Tsing di won kucɛɛt e anɔng ninyen. I da kyem idorok. Izen fi in ti in sɛ kawat, in bi sak ba tɛ ba da yes.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />A yes nyɛn aBulus da ku nɔk itsɔm, nek anɔng, a woso sas na ba ku yes aBulus atut na katson na ba tɔ amok.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ama ayɛ afaa mi bɛ̀ a got, aPɔshius aFestus bɛ̀ a shan aFeliks kubɔk, awɛt nek aFeliks shim a nye baYahuda iyɛ́, a won aBulus ari inyang.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">ABulus ni ishɔt ashon aFestus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ama nkɔs ntat ni inɔ wu ni mben e, aFestus won aKaisariya a ngarak sak na aRushelima, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />azɔng wu fɛ́ agbat-agbat àware nɛ bakɔk-ashon baYahuda, tse ashon wu, ba ku nabak kukun bà naton aBulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Ba tsɛt iwu ka ba sɛ mo, na a sak na a tse na aBulus na aRushelima vit ibeseng izen, nek iba tsin kana nye ba da sak bayɔng fɛ́ ba da ku tot nɔng ba da ku fɛt ni rèn. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />AFestus fɛ̀ ni ba ye, &lt;&lt;ABulus se ni ifam na aKaisariya, imi ngmash ni in tse azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Won bakak ayɛt bakɔk-ashon yin bi di kuus mo, ki inɛn di se fɛ́ anet e ra, won na ba tonong ide.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Ama fɛ̀ a nye nkɔs nkara sak kusɔk azɔng ni iba, a tɛ a tisik sak na aKaisariya. Akatson, a sak kusonong azumung ishɔt wu, a sak na ba ku bɛ̀ na aBulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ni izen fɛ̀ aBulus mi nɔ, baYahuda fɛ̀ ba ne na aRushelima me, ku te nate, ba kpa ncɛɛt-nfe zizɛɛt naton wu fɛ́ ba kyem ba tonong atsak na awo.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Wat aBulus kpa kucɛɛt itɛnɛng ice wu ye, &lt;&lt;Imi mi nye inɛn ikak sak ni ntsi baYahuda ke sak na karɔ iya Adakunom ntong ke sak na aKaisar awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Awɛt nek aFestus shim a di sɛ baYahuda, a fɛ̀ na aBulus, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn shim i da tse na aRushelima, nɔng in da tsin in da ra ishɔt yeng azɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />ABulus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi yong ni nyeseng nitu ishɔt aKaisar, narɔ fɛ̀ ka se kpaf ba di ra mo ishɔt. Imi mi ra baYahuda inɛn ikikak awo, ngɔn ice ngɔn irēn anɔng. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ki inɛn ikak di se, fɛ́ ba mi di sɛ ni ide, fi i kyem ba di sok kutset hom, imi tsin ramin iku me awo. Awɛt ki kukun fɛ́ baYahuda ba mi nɔ ne yet atsak awo, vit anet fɛ́ a kyem a di nabak ni bɔk bá. In tsin ra awon aKaisar ki fok yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Ama fɛ́ aFestus mi tɔ na bafɛ́ azumung wu, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn mi ra awon aKaisar da fok, ni wu fi i di ki tse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">AFestus tsɛt itabak <optbreak /> na agwɔm Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ama nkɔs gyet, agwɔm Agripa nɛ aBanise tse ba ta na aKaisariya, ba tse ba te show aFestus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ite ashow, ke ishow ni kubɛ́ ayi.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Nek ba da nye nkɔs gaan azɔng, aFestus bɛ̀ ni kucɛɛt aBulus ashon agwɔm e ye, &lt;&lt;Anet inyang akak yong azeng fɛ́ aFeliks won ni ifam. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ni izen fi in kin ne na aRushelima, agbat-agbat àware nɛ bashɔn baYahuda, bɛ́ ba te kukun wu ni mi, ba tsɛt fok ni in ku tsɛɛt ishɔt iku.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />&lt;&lt;Imi kaba tak fok nggɔn aRoma rone na ba nabak anet dang na a nyim ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba te kukun wu, dang na a sɛ kawat itɛnɛng ice wu ni icɛɛt e. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba kin di kuus mo sak azeng, vit ibeseng izen akatson, in wat in yes kazumung ishɔt, in sak ba di bɛ́ na anet e. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ni izen fɛ̀ bafi kukun e dorok ba kpa cɛɛt, ba kyem ba bɛ̀ ni inɛn ikak fi imi yes fok a ra awo. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Tit nanan fɛ́ ba se ni iwu se naton nggɔn ikuus bá, nɛ naton akaku akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aYeso, ayɔng fi iwu aBulus nye fok a se ni kutset. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Imi dun irèn fi in di ki got ni ishɔt e, nek anɔng, in ku rip fok ke a shim na a tse ni aRushelima na ba ra ishɔt azɔng ɛ? <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Awɛt nek aBulus mi ra awon fok na ba ku won ni inyang sak izen fɛ́ Ada mben aRoma bi tsɛɛt ishɔt wu, imi ku yit azeng sak izen fi in bi ku yirik sak na aKaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Awɛt Agripa fɛ̀ na aFestus, &lt;&lt;Imi da shim ni in fok anet yong ice min.&gt;&gt; AFestus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Natson, ngɔn bi ku fok.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus ashon agwɔm Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Akatson, Agripa nɛ aBanise bɛ́ ba nɔ ayɛt ízɔk igwɔm, ba bɛ́ ba nɔ na azere isosok gung nɛ ágbat-ágbat batsom nɛ ágbat banet iwɔp e. Wat aFestus sak na ba bɛ́ na aBulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Wat aFestus fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Agwɔm Agripa ni ishɛrɛp banet fɛ́ ba se azeng ni iyit, di yin anet e yo! BaYahuda ngma kusum mang te kukun wu ni mi azɔng ni aRushelima nɛ azeng, ba tang iwɔng fok ke a tɛ di se ni kutset awo. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Awɛt imi mi di inɛn fɛ́ a ra fi ikyɛm ba di sok kutset wu awo, awɛt nek awon fɛ́ a mi rasak na Ada mben aRoma, imi mi won in da ku yirik sak azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Awɛt in mi sɛ atitup ikyɛng fi in da jɛk Ada mben e awo. Nek anɔng, in tsin di bɛ́ ni wu ashon yin, amak e ashon ngɔn, agwɔm Agripa, nɔng ama ifok ishɔt e, nyɛn in da sɛ ikyɛng fi in da jɛk. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Nek in di kutsitsɛng di se ni in yirik afi inyang ashon dang atitup inɛn fɛ́ ba di te kukun wu awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">ABulus tsin tɛnɛng ice wu ashon Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Wat Agripa fɛ̀ na aBulus, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi irèn fi i da cɛɛt na kanu ngɔn.&gt;&gt; Wat aBulus sok kubɔk naton a kpa icɛɛt:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Agbat agwɔm Agripa, imi yet anet awɛng fi in nyeseng ashon ngɔn atut, ni in tɛnɛng ice hom naton ncɛɛt fɛ́ baYahuda mi nye naton hom, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />awɛng hom e yet nek ngɔn bi irēn itsik naton nggɔn baYahuda ni ikyɛng fi ites nanan e. Nek anɔng, in ra awon ni ngɔn di sak kuto ni ifɛ̀ hom hwyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt;Ngma baYahuda ba rēn nggɔn fi in kuus neme imi kabaane, in tumung ina nkum ni wɔp in sak ni aRushelima. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Iba di rēn nkum atut awo, iba da fɛ́rɛ́ng anɔng ke ba shim ba tun atsak, fok imi rasak ayɛt nggɔn yit fi in dung se vɛt makiyi tɛ aFarasi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Wat kyɔrɔng nek ite iyɛ́ hom ni ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom kin nye badakop yit kushii me fɛ́ ba tsin di ra mo ishɔt. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Iko kushii me yɔng fi icɛn yit kusɔk abe afaa tsɛt idi ishining e, fi i sak ba di bi iyɛ ingash iya Adakunom ntong kunom nɛ katuk. Ho Ada agwɔm, ayet nek ite iyɛ me ye fɛ́ baYahuda di tsɛt mo ni inɛn. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Akyɛ sak fɛ́ akak ayɛɛt yin kyem anɔɔk atsak fok Adakunom da kyem na donong bafaben awɛ?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Imi ice min in man sok ni iyɛ fok i se gyat ni in nye kaakyɛ nek in di buruk iyerek aYeso anet aNazaret. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Anɔng wu fi in kin nye ni aRushelima. Ni inɔɔk irèn agbat-agbat àware, in tsaas na bafɛ́ atsak dot ari inyang, ni izen fɛ́ ba kok ntset bá, imi bara icang fok na ba wey ni iba. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Izen dot, in mi kuus narɔ inyiis baYahuda ni in sas ba ka ba nesek iyɔm, ni in di tes inɛn ni ba na ba beseng iyerek aYeso. Nek kafa kawe fi in bɛ́ ni iba, in mi tses ni mben amatse nek in ka ba nesek iyɔm.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />&lt;&lt;Ni kutseet hom kukak, in kin se ni irèn sak na aDamaskos, ni ice, ni inɔɔk irèn ágbat-ágbat áware. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Bakat kate inom, Ada agwɔm, ni in tsin ren se ni irèn, In di mgbey nkak ne azanɛn, iron e wat nfi kunom aza, in ki te yit nate na bafidang itsɛt in. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Ngma yit in kpas yit aben, in fok kutɔ cɛɛt ni imi ni ilem Aram ye, &lt;aShawulu, aShawulu, akyɛ sak fi i di nesek iyɔm ɛ? I yet mgbang ni i risip kakon fɛ́ ka se myol-myol.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt imi rip, &lt;Ngɔn yet angan aTisa yɛ?&gt; ATisa me fɛ̀ ni mi, &lt;Imi yet aYeso, ayɔng fi ngɔn tsin ku nesek iyɔm. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Dorok yɔkɔnɔng, nyeseng na atak ngɔn. Imi tonong ice hom ni ngɔn, nɔng in da ka myak tɛ asam in, tɛ anet icɛɛt ikyɛng fi ngɔn mi di ni mi, ni idɔng fi in da ka tonong. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />In da ka tun ni bɔk banet ngɔn, nɛ ni bɔk Ícɛn-iduk. In tsin da tom ni ba, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />ni i ka ba tarak ayisi, ni ka ba tirik na ba won nhwyi sak ni mgbey, na ba won aShetan sak ni ishan Adakunom, nɔng ba da sɛ ifuut anɛn bá ni isɛ karɔ ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba te jɛrɛ, ni inɔɔk atsak ni imi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />&lt;&lt;Ada agwɔm Agripa, nek anɔng, imi kyem in ramin itak fi i ne azanɛn awo. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />In tumung ishara ifɛ̀ me na aDamaskos, sak ni aRushelima, sak ni ishɛrɛp mben aJudiya ngma kusum, ngma sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, in nye ni iba na ba wosong anɛn bá na ba tirik sak na Adakunom, na ba tonong ishan atsak bá ayɛt iras ntomong ntek. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Nek anɔng wu baYahuda di tekap mo atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong, ba shim ba di fɛt. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Awɛt Adakunom mi di sɛ mo sak atut, nek anɔng fi in di nyeseng azeng, in tsin cɛɛt na babaan e nɛ ágbat e, in tsin cɛɛt ikikak zɛɛt ni ikyɛng fɛ́ batan nɛ aMusa kin fɛ̀ i bi te awo. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ba kin fɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek me bi sɔ mgbang, tɛ afi imɛsɛng idoro bafaben, a bi bɛ́ ni mgbey sak na banet yit ni Ícɛn-iduk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Na aBulus tsin ren cɛɛt, aFestus ku nyeseng, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;ABulus, nhwyɛ mi wuruk ni rɔm ngɔn; kutsik irēn ngɔn e tsin da tsaas na tse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />ABulus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Azɔk aFestus, imi ririm awo, kucɛɛt fi in se ne yet atsak, ku tseng kpaf. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Ada agwɔm e rēn ikyɛng fi in di cɛɛt naton e, nek anɔng fi in di cɛɛt washak sak ni wu. Imi rēn fok a mi te burum ni ikikak ayɛt de awo, nek ba kin nye ina ni nɛt awo. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ada agwɔm Agripa, ngɔn nɔɔk atsak na Batan ɛ? Imi rēn fok i se anɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agripa fɛ̀ na aBulus, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn di ti ni ki gyeet izen ti iyeng ngɔn da kyem i di tirik ni in sot afi ikuus Anet-Isheshek yɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />ABulus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ke na agyeet izen, ke ishɔp ayi, awon hom na Adakunom yet da ngɔn kyɛk awo, won ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tsin di foos atut na a sot kpaf ti imi, da na a sot afi inyang kyek awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ama anɔng, agwɔm dorok nɛ agwɔmna nɛ aBanise nɛ banet fɛ́ ba se gung ni iwu. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Ba won azere me sak amatse, ba se ni icɛɛt wɔɔn ba fok, &lt;&lt;Anet yong mi nye inɛn ikak fi ikyɛm ba di sok kutset wu, ke na ba ku te mo ni nyang awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agripa fɛ̀ na aFestus, &lt;&lt;Zɔng ke ba wosong anet yong na a tseng, afɛ́ yet fok a mi tos fok aKaisar na a ku fok awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Ba wɔk na aBulus sak na aRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba mi won fok in da wɔk yit sak na aItaliya, ba nabak aBulus, ni isherep bafi inyang e ni bɔk agbat batsom akak fɛ́ ba ku yes ye aJuliyɔs, azining ayɛt kudyɛng Agustus. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />In nɔ yit kukyɛ ashi fi ku ne ni wɔp Adaramitiyum, fi ku da gosok ni nwɔp anu ashi na fi mben Asiya, in kpa wɔk yit ayɛt ashi. Aristakus anet aTesaloni na anet aMasedoniya kin se gung ni iyit.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Akatson, in tsin ta yit na aSidon. AJuliyɔs tonong aBulus ishim, a ku won a tse narɔ bafidang nɔng ba bin ku nɔk ikyɛng fɛ̀ a shim. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />In dorok yit azɔng, in wɔk yit ayɛt ashi nek áwun fɛ́ a tɛnɛsɛ kutseet e, in tsin gorok yit abak izek aSayipurus nek kuwun e ra se lɛɛ abak kayɔng. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ni izen fi in mi tat yit kukyɛk fi ku se bakat ni mben aKilikiya nɛ aPamfiliya, in tsin ta yit na aMera ni mben aLikiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Azɔng wu fɛ́ agbat batsom e sɛ kukyɛ ashi fi ku ne na Alekzandiriya fi ku da tseng sak na aItaliya, a ki te yit ayɛt ko. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />In wɔk yit hwyɛ ni ko nnom dot, ni mgbang in da ni tsin ta yit bakat na aKinidus. Ni izen fi kuwun e ki gaat yit iya kashon, in tin tirik yit sak abak karɔ fi kuwun e ra se lɛɛ, in gorok yit abak izek aKirit bakat ne aSalmoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />In woso bɔrɔng yit hwyɛ anɔng, in da tsin ta yit narɔ fɛ́ ba yes ika ye karɔ ifɔɔn katek, bakat ni kuwɔp aLasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Nek izen fi in beseng yit ni irèn, kutseet akyɛ-ashi mi sot ikyɛng nnyim, nek izen e yɔng iyɛ ngmash ni igang, na amok ifuut anɛn mi tsang got, wat aBulus ka ba nɔk itabak, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />ye, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, in di fok kutseet kang da bɛ́ na kawɛy gyet awo sak ni kukyɛ ashi me nɛ acet e, ngma sak ni ntset yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Awɛt agbat batsom e, rawu dang fok itabak aBulus, a wees ato ni ifɛ̀ anet ikɔk kukyɛ ashi me, nɛ atek kukyɛ ashi me ningya. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Nek izen awun azɛng bɛ bakat, nek anɔng, imak se gyat na ba saas akyɛ-ashi na a fɔrɔng azɔng awo. Nek anɔng, banet dot nɔɔk itabak fok ni in ya yit kashon ni kutseet, nyan in tsin in ta yit na aPinikis, nɔng in da fɔɔn yit azɔng ma ikos got. APinikis me bɛ́ karɔ inyeseng akyɛ-ashi na aKirit fɛ́ ka yere kabace fɛ́ abatin nɛ kabatin fɛ́ abace.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itsombos ashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Ni izen fi kuwun fi ku ne abatin kpa fɛsɛm hwyɛ, banet e nye nyan kudaam bà mi gang, nek anɔng, ba kɔrɔk kutsɔm fi ku nyeseng ni kukyɛ ashi me, ba kpa di kuus kufam izek e, bakat ni ice ibanang izek aKirit e. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Dang nin tse yik-yik, áwun iririm fɛ́ ba yes ina, &lt;&lt;awun abace afi iwurukunom&gt;&gt; a ne ni izek e. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ni izen fɛ́ awun e nyiming kukyɛ ashi me, fɛ̀ a sak kukyɛ ashi me gaat iserek, in won yit kuwun e ki yirik yit sak narɔ fi kushim kyɛk. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Fi in tsin gorok yit ama kizek kakak fɛ́ ba yes iye izek aKauda, narɔ fi kuwun e ra se lɛɛ, ni mgbang fi in di kɔrɔk yit kabankyɛ ashi ni fam kuratek e.<verse eid="ACT 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi kɔrɔk kabaane me, ba te ika ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me, ba karam kukyɛ ashi me ni ndun kɔn ku bi sarak. Ba tisik ni kutsɔm fi ku kyɛɛs kutseet kukyɛ ashi me, nɔng kuwun e ni ku yirik kukyɛ ashi me nek ikɔk e ka ba gaat. Ba nye anɔng, nek ba fok nnyim kɔn kukyɛ ashi me bi tsi ku fo ni iba ayɛt izek aSirtis. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ashi me ya kashon ni inye fuu, nek anɔng, akatson, ba kpa bara acet e ayɛt ashi. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ni kunom kufɛ́ ataat, ba bara ares itomong kukyɛ ashi me ni nbɔk bá ayɛt ashi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Fin sok yit nnom gaan vit idi kunom ke, ádat ayi, ni itsombos e woso kuren gyet awo, in nɔɔk yit nwaa kutset yit.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ama fɛ́ banet e mi sok nkɔs dot dang kuyak, aBulus dorok tsik nate ba, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, i fi di kuus yin itabak hom, fin fɛ̀ da nin dorok ni in wosong yin aKirit awo, ke kawɛy kang ni ibeseng yeng ki sɛ yin awo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ngma na anɔng, in shim in fɛ̀ ni iyin, di barang yin agap iyɛ, nek vit anet azining fɛ́ a da wey ayɛt yin, nkum kukyɛ ashi me ko kyek fi ku da wey. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Nek natuk kang atomaza Adakunom fin in yet afu, ayɔng fi in yɛɛt asam wu, a nyeseng ni fam in, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />a fɛ̀ ni mi, &lt;ABulus, i bi fok nnyim awo. I se gbing ngɔn da tsi i nyeseng ni ishɔt ashon aKaisar, di nek itek Adakunom sak ni ngɔn, a mi da nɔk kutset banet bang ngma fɛ́ ba se na ashi gung ni ngɔn.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng di barang yin agap iyɛ, nek imi bi inɔɔk atsak na Adakunom fok i da te kpaf anɔng ti iwu di fɛ̀ ni imi. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ngma na anɔng, in da tsin carak yit mben ni kizek kakak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukyɛ ashi fo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Natuk kafi kusɔk abe anaas, ba ren se ni i ki tirisi yit na izek aMeditereniya, bakat kate atuk, bafi ikɔk kukyɛ ashi me yes gyan ngmash nin sɛ yit mben. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ba mara kutsik ashi me, ba sɛ kutsik e se atak anakat azining ni nsɔk nfaa. Ama ki izen gyet, ba tɛ ba sok imaas e ba sɛ nsɔk agyɛng azining. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Nek nnyim fok kɔng in bi tsin in nyim yit na ata, nek anɔng, ba tik na anyin atsɔm anaas fɛ́ arɔ ni kutseet ama kukyɛ ashi me. Ba ra awon mok mgbey ni in se.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Nek itsɛt irèn ihwyet, bafi ikɔk kukyɛ ashi me, tik na kabankyɛ me ayɛt ashi, na ba nye tɛ ba shim ba bang tik na anyin atsɔm ama kukyɛ ashi me. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />ABulus fɛ̀ na agbat batsom e, ni isherep batsom me, &lt;&lt;Ke da banet bang sot ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me awo, vit anet fɛ́ a da sɛ kutset.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Nek anɔng, batsom e tɛsɛng ndun kabankyɛ ashi me, ba won ika ka kpa azika.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Na kadiding tsin tsɛt ka te gbey, aBulus di ban ni ba fok na ba yas, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Nkɔs kusɔk abe anaas atut, i se yin na ayɛ gak, vit ite ikyɛng nanu, i rayin kuyak. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Nek anɔng, in tsin ra awon ni yin, yas yin nek kukyang irɔm yin. Vit azining yin fɛ́ a da bit kukwey ice wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ama fɛ́ a mi gang kucɛɛt, a sok akpam, a di ra awon na Adakunom azɔng ashon bà. A but iwu, a kpa iya me. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Na anɔng, ba di sɛ agap iyɛ, ba kpa yas ice ba. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Ngma yit in kin se yit banet anakat afaa ni nsɔk nkara ina karataat ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi yas na ka ba kyem, ba bang kyɛɛs kunanang fi kukyɛ ashi sok, ba bara ica kuyak sak ayɛt ashi.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ni izen fɛ́ kadiding te gbey, ba kyem ba rēn mben awo, ba di kawɔ ni izɛk, ba shim ba da nɔ ni kukyɛ ashi me azɔng ke ba da kyem. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ba tɛsɛng ndun fɛ́ ba di rosom atsɔm fɛ́ a yit kukyɛ ashi me, ba won ina ayɛt ashi, ba wat tɛsɛng ndun ikyɛng fi i tirisi kukyɛ ashi me. Ama anɔng, ba tarak nkpin fi in se ashon kukyɛ ashi me kpaf abak fi kuwun di nes, ba wɔk sak ni nzɛk. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Awɛt kukyɛ ashi me tsi ku carak ázék, ku di berem sak ayɛt ázék e. Kashon e nɔ meel vit iserek. Kukyɛ ashi me kpa sarak ama nek kuren ashi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Batsom me tsɛt ke ba fɛs nnon inyang e, kɔng akak ba bi wɔk ayɛt ashi na hwyet. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Awɛt nek agbat batsom me shim aBulus na sot ni kutset, a ka ba ro mo inye ikyɛng fɛ́ ba shim inye me. A sak bayɔng fɛ́ ba rēn iwɔk na ba tung furu sak amatse, na ba tse ba ta ni mben. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Nsherep e da ne ba wɔk naton afak-fak ákon, nɛ naton acɛk irɔm kukyɛ ashi me. Na anɔng wu, kaangan di tasak ni mben.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul's Journey to Rome" file="cen Paul-4_B&amp;W.jpg" size="span" loc="ACT 27:1--28:31" copy="SIL" ref="27:1--28:31">Kutseet ishara ifɛ́ itek aBulus kufɛ anaas</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">ABulus na aMalta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ama fi in tat yit kyang, in bin rēn yit fok ba yes izek e aMalta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Banet izek e ki tonong yit nggɔn ntek makiyi. Ba fɛp kurong, ba ki yes yit nin in fok yit nek ba kin se ni iza, karɔ me shirim. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />ABulus tusung kusom nkon, na tsin te me ni irong, afɔ tun amazɛrɛ ayɛt irong e, a ku te shɛng ni bɔk. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ni izen fɛ́ banet izek e di fi ihwyen e di te shɛng ni bɔk wu, ba kpa cɛɛt wɔɔn ba ye, &lt;&lt;Na atsak e, anet yong yet afi ifɛɛs banet. Ngma ni ihwyet fɛ́ a nye na ashi, di ishɔt ku won a hwyet awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Awɛt aBulus tanang kubɔk, ihwyen e kpa ni irong, vit ice isong fi i ku sɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Banet e di te ayisi fok a da kpa mos ke kukom wu da kpa aben ayi, awɛt ama fɛ́ ba woso tot, da ba di ikikak te ni wu awo, ba shesheng kuyiring bà, ba fɛ̀ a yet kaban-nnom.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ikɔ akak kin se bakat azɔng fɛ́ a yet afɛ́ aPɔbiliyus, akɔk-ashon izek e. A ki shan yit ni mbɔk nfaa ayɛt ari wu, a sok nkɔs ntat na ya ni iyit. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Ada aPɔbiliyus kin se na meneng ni irɔk, a kin bɔrɔng ni ifes ni kutang. ABulus nɔ a tse a ku di, ama ku ra awon, a di sak mbɔk naton wu, a ku te kyang. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ama fi ikyɛng e te anɔng, ishɛrɛp bafi nrɔk fɛ́ ba se ni izek e, bɛ́ ba ka ba te kyang. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Banet e ki nesek yit iratek ni irèn zizɛɛt, fi izen itseet yit nye, ba ki tusung yit nkyɔrɔk fi in shim yit.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">In ta yit na aRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ama nfɛn ntat, in nɔ yit ni kukyɛ ashi fi ku ya ikos azɔng ni izek e. Kukyɛ ashi me yet kufɛ́ Alekzandiriya fɛ̀ ba di maat nabanrɔm nnom nafɛrɛs e fɛ́ ba yes ina aKasto na Apolos. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />In tsi in ta yit ni iwɔp aSirakus, in nye yit nkɔs ntat azɔng. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />In won yit azɔng, in tsin ta yit ni iwɔp aRijiyum. Ama kukɔs kuzining, awun fɛ́ a ne abatin a kpa fesem, akatson in tsin ta yit ni wɔp aPutiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />In tsi in sɛ yit bafi ikuus azɔng fɛ́ ba ki rini yit ni in nye yit nkɔs kanakataat azɔng ni iba. Na anɔng wu in tsi in di ta yit na aRoma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se azɔng fok yi in se yit ni rèn, ba nes yik-yik, ba tse ba ku shan sak na aZere Apiyus, nɛ sak na atu batsen ataat. Ni izen fɛ́ aBulus di ta ayisi ni bafi ikuus e, a nɔɔk ifeng sak na Adakunom, a bang sɛ agap. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ni izen fi in tsin ta yit na aRoma, ba nɔɔk aBulus kutu aziwu, na afi itsom azining fɛ́ a da kuyɛrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus shara ifɛ̀ na aRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ama nkɔs ntaat, a sak ba ku tusung bakɔk-ashon baYahuda. Ama fɛ́ ba mi nyim, aBulus fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ábaruneng, imi nye ikikak imaan e sak na banet yit awo, da imi beseng nggɔn badakop yit awo, ngma na anɔng, ba di tekab na aRushelima, ba di nabak ni bɔk aRoma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ama fɛ́ ba di nyes nrisim zizɛɛt, ba shim ke ba di won, nek vit inɛn fɛ́ ba di sɛ ni ide fi i kyem ba di sok kutset hom. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Awɛt fɛ́ baYahuda raba fok da ba di won awo, i di sot gbing ni in tos kanak aKaisar di fok, da iyet fok imi bin ite kukun banet hom awo. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Nek anɔng fi i sak, in tsɛt ku di yin, ni ncɛɛt yit. Ayet fok nek ite iyɛ aIsrela wu fɛ́ ba di te mo anyang nang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Wat iba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Iyit mi sɛ yit kufumung kukak fi ku ne na aJudiya azaton ngɔn awo, ama anɔng, vit akak ayɛt baruneng yit fɛ́ ba ne azɔng, fɛ́ a mi te kukun ke a ki tak yit ikikak imaan e azaton ngɔn awo. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Awɛt iyit di yit i se gyat ni in rēn yit akyɛ yet kuyiring ngɔn ɛ, nek in rēn in fok banet kaakyɛ nyes aduk icɛɛt naton irèn ifas e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Ba sak kunom kukak fɛ́ ba bi di nyim na aBulus, atuk e yɔng, ba tse narɔ fi iwu di se, banet e wat bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin tsang tse. Nkum kadiding sak kahwyɛ, a ka ba bis e, na ka shara ifɛ̀ igwɔm Adakunom, a tsɛt a shesheng kuyiring bá naton aYeso ni irèn ikyɛng fɛ́ afumung aMusa nɛ afɛ́ Batan jɛk. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bakak ayɛɛt ba shesheng kuyiring e, awɛt bakak raba inɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Nanan nɔ nate ba, ba kpa tsees ama fɛ́ aBulus mi gang kucɛɛt ka, &lt;&lt;Kabik aJɛrɛ kin tak atsak na badakop yin, ni kucɛɛt fi ku ne nanu atan aIshaya fok:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Tsi tak banet bang, &lt;&lt;I da foos yin awɛt i da rēn yin awo, i da ya yin kashon ni iyɛrɛ yin awɛt i da di yin awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Nek ayɛ banet bang mi te kashalang, i ka ba se gbang na ba foos na ato bà, ba mi famasa ayisi bà, ke da anɔng awo, ke ba di di na ayisi me, ke ba foos na ato bà, ke ayɛ bà irērēn ikyɛng fi ise, ke ba tirik, ni imi ka ba te mo kyang.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Nek anɔng, in shim ni i rēn fok Adakunom mi tom isheshek wu sak ni Ícɛn-iduk; iba di ki wes ato ni de.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni mbɔk bɛ̀ ibyat ifɛ́ </char><char style="fv">29</char> ane: <char style="fqa" closed="false">Ama fɛ̀ a fɛrɛng anɔng, baYahuda kana kam, ba woso ra nanan wɔɔn ba.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />ABulus nye ayɛ afaa azɔng nitu isot wu, na shashan bayɔng fɛ́ ba shim ku di wu. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Na shara ifɛ̀ igwɔm Adakunom na agap iyɛ, vit ikyɛng itɛnɛng, na tees banet ifɛ̀ aTisa aYeso Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>